<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Saam Hlabu</book>
  <para style="h">Saam Hlabu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Saam Hlabu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Saam Hlabu</para>
  <para style="mt">Saam Hlabu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih ruahnak pekmi a saang lo ih, Mi sual lamzin a thlun lotu le Pathian a hmuhsuamtu pawl lakih a tel lotu cu mi thluasuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih Daan thlun cu a lungawinak a si, Cuih Daan cu sunzan in a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu tiva kapih a khomi thingkung, A tikcu ih a rahmi le a hnah tla A vuai dah lomi bangtuk a si. A tuahmi kipah a hlawhtling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu cubangtuk an si lo; Thli ih semhlo mi fanghi vek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu Pathian in a hnong ding; Mi sual pawl cu mi ding lakah an tel lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in mi ding fehnak lamzin cu a kilveng ringring; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo cun siatralnak lamzin a zawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangah so hi miphun pawl in ral an thawh? Ziangah so hi minung pawl in a ṭhahnem lomi phiarsawmnak khua an khan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa le a hriakculhmi siangpahrang an dodal ih, An siangpahrang pawl ral an tho; An hotu pawl ṭangtlang in phiarnak an ngaihtuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“In uknak ihsin luat uhsila, In ṭeemnak pawl cu hlon uhsi,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu vancung a siangpahrang tokham ihsin a hni, Anmah pawl cu a hnihsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thinheng in a kawk hai ih, A thin ai-thok in mangbang vansaang in a tuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka tlang thianghlim, Zion tlang parah, Ka siangpahrang cu ka toter zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang cun, “ Bawipa ih thuruahmi cu ka than ding, Bawipa in ka hnenah ‘Nangmah cu ka fapa na si; Tuihsun ihsin na pa ka si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I dil awla miphun hmuahhmuah na ro ah ka lo pe ding; Leilung pumpi hi na ta a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thirfung in na vuakkuai ṭheh hai ding ih, Tlak beel an sutkuai bangin na sukuai ṭheh ding,’ i ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang pawl, ngai hnik uh; Mi uktu pawl tla, rak thei uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa cu ṭihzahnak le phannak thawn in rian uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khur phah in a hmaiah kuun uh. Culole a thin a heng ding ih nan hloral ding; Ziangahtile hmakhatte-ah a thin a heng thei a si. Amah a beentu cu mi thluasuak an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka ral hi an va tam lawmmam so! Mi tamzet keimah dotu ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thuhla an rel ih, “Pathian in a bawm lo ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , nang cu ka himnak phaw na si ih, ṭihphannak ihsin i hum ringring. Nangmah in nehnak i pek ih, Ralṭhatnak tla i pek sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu napi in ka ko ih, A tlang thianghlim ihsin i run let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka zau ih ka itthat; Cule himte in ka ṭhang sal, Ziangahtile Bawipa in i kilveng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kiangkap ih i kulhtu, A thawng le a za ka ral pawl tla, Ka ṭih hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tho awla, Maw ka Pathian, i run aw. Ka ral pawl cu nangmah in na neh ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu na siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Runnak cu Bawipa na hnen ihsin a ra, Na minung pawl parah, Na thlawsuahnak um hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lo kawh tikah i let hram aw, Maw i ṭantu Pathian! Thinpit ih ka um tikah na ra ih, Ka thaw i ongter. I zaangfah awla ka thlacamnak hi ngai hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw milai pawl, ziangtik tiangso ka sunlawinak cu ningzahnak ah nan canter ding? Ziangtik tiangso thil ṭhahnem lo hi nan duh hrih ding ih, Thuphan hi nan thlun hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in mi ding pawl cu amah ih ta dingah i hril zo ih, Ka kawh tikah i thei a si, tihi thei ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭih uhla sual nawn hlah uh, Nan ihkhun ah daitein um uhla, ruat ciamciam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah a dikmi thawinak pe uhla, Amah cu rinsan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , thlawsuah in pe sinsin hram maw! Zaangfahnak thawn in run zoh hram aw!” tiih thlacamtu an tam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah ih i pekmi lungawinak cu, Rawl le sabit tampi neitu pawl ih Lungawinak hnakin a nasa sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ih vete in thlangamte in ka itthat; Maw Bawipa , nangmah lawng i himtertu na si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka ṭongmi hi ngai hram awla, Ka hui ka aihramnak hi thei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Siangpahrang le ka Pathian, Bomnak dil ih ka au-nak hi I ngaisak hram aw. Maw Bawipa , na hnenah thla ka cam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zingtin ka thlacamnak cu na thei, Ni a suah tikah ka thuhla cu na hnenah ka thlenter; Cule na thulehnak hngak in ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sual tuahnak ah lungawitu Pathian na si lo; ṭhat lonak cu na hnenah na umter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tluangkhawng pawl cu na hmu thei lo; Mi ṭha lo hmuahhmuah na hua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuphan pertu hmuahhmuah na siatsuah ih, Thisen suah hiartu le mibum hmang pawl cu na fih hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a hmunmi na duhdawtnak a natsat ruangah, Kei cu na inn sungah ka lut ding; Na Biakinn thianghlim sungah ka lo bia ding ih, ṭihzahnak thawn na hmai ah ka kun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka ral an tam ngaingai, Na duhmi tuah dingah i hruai aw. Ka thlun theinak dingah na lamzin tluangter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ih ṭongkam cu rintlak a um hrimhrim lo; Mi siatsuah lawng an duh. An kaa cu thlaanka ong-aw vek a si, An lei cu a naalzet ih mibum a thiam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , annih pawl cu hnong awla hrem hai aw. An khawkhannak ṭha lo cu an tluknak ah canter aw. An sualnak a tam ruangah le Nangmah an lo dodal ruangah Na umnak ihsin hlon suak hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hnenih himnak a tongtu cu an lung a awi ding, Lungawi in hla an sak ringring ding. A lo duhdawtu cu na hum hai a si. Nangmah ih ruangah annih cu mi lungawi taktak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mi ding pawl cu na thlawsuah hai ih, Na zaangfahnak thawn phaw bangin na hum a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , thinheng in i kawk hram hlah aw, Na thin ai-thok in i hrem hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I zaangfah hram aw, Ziangahtile ka baang ih ka vuai thluh; Ka tha tlungter saal hram aw, Ziangahtile ka baang tuk ih ka soprop thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunnak tiangin vansaang a lam, Maw Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso hiti ih ka um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ra awla i run aw, I zaangfahnak thawng in thihnak ihsin i runsuak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thih hnuah cun zoso a lo thei thei ding, Sheol ah zoso a lo thangṭhat ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hui ka aihramnak in ka vuai thluh zo; Zantin ka ṭah ruangah ka ihkhun a ciar ih, Ka lukham cu ka mitthli in a ciap ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ṭahnak ah ka mit an thling ṭheh ih; Zianghman ka hmu thei lo. Ka ral pawl ruangah hiti in ka cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nannih thilsual tuahtu pawl, tlan ṭheh uh; Bawipa in ka ṭahnak a thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bomnak dil ih ka au-nak cu a ngai ih Ka thlacamnak a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu an sun ruangah ningzak in an um ding, Mangbang le vansaang in an tlan thluh ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka Pathian, nangmah cu ka beunak na si. I duumtu pawl hnenih sin i run awla i hum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuti lo cun zohman ih in run thei nawn lonak hmun ah, Kiosa bangin in thiarhlo ding ih Cutawkah in botthleek thluh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, Mi pakhatkhat parah thil ka ti sual ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lamṭang pawl ka phiarsawm ih, A um meenmi ka ral ka tuahmawh a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral in i dawi in i kai seh; I saat aw sehla i that seh, Ka ruak cu mualpho in leidip lakah taan seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thinheng in tho aw; Ka ral pawl ih thin ai-thawhnak do dingah ding aw. ṭhang awla i bawm aw, Ziangahtile dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu ṭhen cu na duhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kiangkap ah mi hmuahhmuah kokhawm awla, Tlunlam ihsin run uk hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Nang cu mi hmuahhmuah ih thuṭhentu na si; Curuangah ka felnak le ka ṭhatnak bangin ka thu ṭhen aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang cu a dingmi Pathian na si, Kan ruahnak le kan duhnak tla thu na ṭhen. Mi ṭha lo pawl ih ṭhat lonak cemter awla, Mi ṭha pawl laksawng pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian cu ka ralphaw a si ih i humtu a si. Amah ih duhnak a thlun tu pawl a humtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian cu a dingmi thuṭhentu a si; Mi ṭha lo pawl cu a hnong ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Milai pawl an siir awk lo a si ahcun, Pathian in a ralnam a taat ding; A li a nawp ih sai dingah a tiar zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mi thahnak hriamnam pawl a lak ih, A vaam hluahhlomi a conkiang pawl a bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zohhnik uh, mi ṭha lo pawl ih thupol mi cu ṭhat lonak lawng a si, Siatsuahnak lawng an ngaihtuah ih Mi bum hlir in khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leilung ah khur thuk zet an lai, Cule an laihmi khur sungah anmah riangri an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak an tuahmi cu an hnenah a thlengkir ih, Mi thisen an suahmi cu an lu parah a thleng sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu a dingmi a si ruangah lungawi thu ka sim ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa ih hnenah Thangṭhatnak hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kan Bawipa, Leilung pumpi ih na hmin a than zia hi! Nangmah an lo thangṭhatnak van a thleng a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nauhak le naute pawl tla in hla in an sak. Na ral pawl le a lo dodaltu pawl kham dingah, Ralhruang cu nangmah in na tiang hnget zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kut ih tuahmi van ka zoh ih, An umnak ciarih na retmi thlapi le arsi ka hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milai hi ziangso a si ih na seherh ringring? Mihring taak ko hi ziangso a si ih a zawn na ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asi, minung cu nangmah hnakih niam deuh fangin na tuah ih, Sunlawinak le upatnak cu lukhuh bangin na khumter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na seemsuahmi hmuahhmuah tlunah uktu na siter ih, Ziang tinkim a ke tangah na ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuu le caw, hramlak ih ramsa pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vate le tisung um nga le ti sungih a nungmi hmuahhmuah tlunah na ret zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kan Bawipa, Leilung pumpi ih na hmin a than zia hi! A va mak so!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thinlung zatein nangmah cu ka lo cawimawi ding, Mangbangza na tuahmi ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah ih ruangah lungawi zetin hla ka sak ding, Maw Cungnungbik, na hnenah thang ṭhatnak hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah na lang tikah ka ral pawl cu an kir sal, An ril ih an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dingmi thuṭhentu na si ih na tokham parah na to; Keimah ṭan in thu na ṭhen a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thei lo miphun pawl na hnong ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu na siatsuah hai a si. Annih cu kumkhua in an hloralta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In dotu kan ral pawl an cem thlata ih theih an si nawn lo, An khawpi pawl cu na ṭhio ṭheh ih, Theih sal ding an si nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa cu kumkhua in siangpahrang a si. Thuṭhen dingah a siangpahrang tokham parah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung pumpi cu dingnak thawn a uk ih, ṭan bulmi nei loin mi hmuahhmuah ih thu a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Neh-nen hremnak a tuartu hrangah Bawipa cu relhnak ralhruang a si. Harsatnak caanah himnak ralhruang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hmin a lo theitu cun an lo rinsan ding, Ziangahtile na hnenih a rami cu Na dungtun dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion ihsin uktu Bawipa ih hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sak uh. A thil tuahmi cu mi hmuahhmuah hnenah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zonzai pawl ih tuarnak cu Pathian in a thei, An ai-hramnak cu a hngilh dah lo; Curuangah thisen a luantertu pawl parah phu a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa , i zaangfah hram aw. I huatu pawl ih in tisiatnak hi hmu hram aw. Maw Bawipa , thihnak ihsin i runsuak hram awla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem khawsungmi pawl hmaiah ding tahratin, Nangmah ka lo cawimawinak thuhla pawl hi ka sim ding. I runsuak ruangah lungawi thu ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian thei lo miphun pawl cu anmah ih laihmi khurah an tla; Thang an kam ih anmah an awk aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa cu a dingmi a thuṭhennak in a lang awter; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu anmah ih tuahmi lala ah an awk-aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl le Pathian a dungtuntu miphun pawl ih lamzin netnak cu thihnak Sheol a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain mi farah pawl thlauthlak ringring an si lo ding ih, Mi rethei pawl ih beiseinak cu kumkhua in namthlak a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa tho thlang aw; Minung in nangmah dodal in tluangkhawng nawn hlah hai seh. Miphun hmuahhmuah cu na hmai ah kokhawm awla, an thu cu ṭhen aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , an thin phangter aw; Mihring meen an si kha theiter hai aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ziangah so hlapi ih na um ringring? Ziangah so kan harsat caan ah in relhsan ṭheu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl an puarthau ih Mi farah pawl an neh-nen, an hrem. Anmah ih kam ciami thang ah awk-aw hram hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in a ruahnak ṭha lo kha a uanpi zet ih, Mi duhham in Bawipa cu a cam ih a hnong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in Bawipa cu zianghman ah a siar lo, “Pathian cun i hmu zik lo,” tiah puarthau in a ti. A ruahnak hmuahhmuah ah, “Pathian a um lo,” tihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cu a thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah a hlawhtling; Pathian ih thuṭhennak cu a theih banmi a si lo. A ral pawl tla a hnihsan meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thinlung te cun, “Ka tlasam dah lo ding; Ziangtik hmanah vansaannak ka tong lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kaa cu camnak, thuphan pernak le midang hronak lawngin a khat; Midang huat zawng le ṭongsia ṭong dingah a lei cu a zamrang zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawkip ah a relhthup aw; Cutawk mi a bawhnak ihsin misual lo tla a that. Bawmtu nei lo mi vanduai pawl kha a thupte in a thlingthla ziar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kiosa bangin a thuh awknak hmun ihsin mi a bawh; A thah dingmi pawl a bawh a si. A thang in a awk ih a thiarhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zianghman tithei lo pawl thah an tuar; Thacak pawl in an bawh, an peel, an hrual neknek hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cun, “Pathian in minung cu zianghman ah a siar lo. A mit a siing zo ih i hmu dah lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tho awla mi ṭha lo pawl hi nor hai aw; Maw Pathian, harsatnak a tuartu pawl tla hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangtin so mi ṭha lo in Pathian a hmuhsuam ih, “Pathian cun i hrem lo ding,” a ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nang cun na hmu a si; An tuarnak le an riahsiatnak cu na hmu ih, Anmah bawm dingah na khul a fung dah lo. Zianghman tithei lotu in na hnen ah a nunnak a pek; Ngakṭah pawl bawmtu cu nangmah na si ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misual le mi ṭha lo pawl ih cahnak thazaang khiak thluh aw; An sualnak ruangah hrem hai awla, ṭhat lonak a reh tiangin hawl suak hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in siangpahrang a si. Curuangah Pathian thei lo pawl cu A ram sungih sin an hloral ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , thinlung nemmi ih saduhthah cu na thei; Cule an thinlung na cakter ih an thlacamnak na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milai in ṭihphannak an suahter nawn lonak dingah, Ngakṭah farah pawl le neh-nenmi pawl ih aunak cu theihsak awla, anmah ṭan in thu ṭhen hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka beunak a si. Ziangtin so nannih in, “Vate bangin tlangpar ah zam aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangahtile mi ṭha lo pawl in an li an nawp ih, Khawthim sung ihsin mi ṭha pawl sai dingah an conkiang an bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilungpi hramṭohnak a siat thluh tikah, Mi ṭha in ziangso tuah theimi a neih ding?” tiah in ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu a biakinn thiang sungah a um ih, A siangpahrang tokham cu vancung ah a um. Mi hmuahhmuah amah in a hmu ih An tuahmi hmuahhmuah khal a thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha le mi ṭha lo an pahnih a hniksak hai ih, Daan nei lo minekrawk hmang pawl cu a thinlung zatein a hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo parah meiling vaam a tlakter ding ih, Kaat mei-alh le meihliopi in a hrem hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu miding a si ih a dingmi hnaṭuan a duh; Amah ih duhnak a thluntu pawl cu a hmai an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i bawm hram aw. Mi ṭha zohman an um nawn lo. Mifel pawl hmuh an theih nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in thuphan an sim-aw ton ih, Porh awknak thawn an bum-aw ton rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a porh-aw reromi lei pawl cu hlep awla, Tluang a khawng reromi kaa pawl cu phit aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih in, “Kan ṭongkam in mi kan neh ding, Ka kaa hi kanmah ih ta a sisi; Zoso kan tlunah lal a ṭuan thei ding?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in, “Mi farah zonzai pawl an namthlak ih, An hremmi pawl harnak tuar in an hui an aihram ruangah, Atu cu ka ra ding. An hiarhal zetmi humhimnak cu ka pe ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih thukamnak cu rintlak a si. A thiangmi a si ih somei ih voi sarih tiang sermi ngun eerlet bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl khuazakip ah an vakdarh ih, Zozo khal in ṭhat lonaktu sawn hi an uar a si. Maw Bawipa , nangmah in in kilveng awla, Cubangtuk minung hnen ihsin in hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso i hngilh ding? Kumkhua in maw i hngilh ta ding? Ziangtik tiangso na mithmai na thuh hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangtik tiangso hiti in ka tuar hrih ding? Ziangtik tiangso a sun a zan in ka thinlung a nat ding? Ziangtik tiangso ka ral pawl hi ka parah thu an neih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, i zoh awla i sawn hram aw; Ka thih lonak dingah ka tha tlungter sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in, “Amah cu kan neh zo a si,” tiah an ti pang ding; Ka sun ruangah an lungawi hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain kei cun a thleng-aw dah lomi na duhdawtnak ka ring, I luatter ruangah ka lung a awi zet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka parih a ṭhat ruangah Bawipa cu hla in ka thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi aa cun a thinlung in, “Pathian a um lo,” a ti. Milai cu an siat ṭheh a si; Ningsinza thil tampi an tuah. Thil ṭha a tuahtu pakhat hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minung lakah fimnak a neitu le Pathian a hawl ih a biatu an um maw? ti theih duh ah, Bawipa in minung pawl cu, Vancung ihsin a run zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain an zatein an pial ṭheh; An thinlung sung tiangin a thu ṭheh a si. Zohman thilṭha tuahtu an um lo, Pakhatte hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hi mi ṭha lo pawl hi theihthiamnak zianghman a nei lomi maw an si? saang an ei vekin ka minung pawl an ei baar ṭheh a si. Ka hnenah thla an cam fawn lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain annih cu ṭih phang in an um ding; Ziangahtile a dingfelmi hnen lawngah Pathian cu a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi lungnem ih khawkhannak cu nan siatsuah, Sikhalsehla annih ih beunak cu Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi runnak cu Zion ihsin ra suak sehla ka va duh so! Bawipa in a minung pawl mal a sawm sal tikah, Jakob ih tesinfa pawl cu an lung a awi ding ih Israel mi pawl cu an ai a puang ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na biakinn ah zoso a lut ding? Na tlang thianghlim Zion ah zoso a kai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziang tinkim ah soisel um loih a nungtu le a dingfel ringringtu, Thungai le thudik a ruat a reltu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midang a relsia lotu, A rualpi pawl hnenah thil ṭha lo a tuah lo ih, A innhnen pawl tla a relsia lotu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Misual pawl zianghman ah a siar lo ih, Bawipa , a ṭihzahtu pawl upatnak a petu, Ziangtluk a hrangah a nat khalle A thutiam cia vekih a thlun suak ringringtu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangka ṭhang thawn midang a coih lotu le Mawh nei lo mawhphurter dingah nawhthuh a la lotu pawl an si ding. Hi bangtuk a tuahtu pawl cu an tlu dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kei i hum hram aw; Ziangahtile nang cu ka beunak na si ih ka lo rinsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah, “Nangmah cu ka Bawipa na si ih, Nangmah locun ṭhatnak zianghman ka nei lo,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih mi thiang pawl cu ziangtluk in so an mawi! Anmah thawn um cu ka lungawinak bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawzing dangdang hnenih a tlan rerotu pawl cu Anmahte vansaannak an pe aw a si. An raithawinak ah ka tel lo ding; An khawzing pawl ih hmin tla ka hmur in ka sal lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah cu ka ro le ka covo na si; Ka hai mi hmuahhmuah nangmah in i pek. Ka nunnak cu na kut sungah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ramri i tuahsakmi cu ziangtluk in so an mawi! Ka hrangah ro sunglawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rem i ruahsaktu Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat; Zan khalah ka thinlung in ralrinnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnenih Bawipa a um cu ka thei ringring; Ka vorhlam ih a um ruangah, Zianghman in i hnin thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah lungawinak le thinnomnak in ka khat; Ka hna a ngam ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile mithi khua ahcun i fehter siang lo ding ih, Nangmah a lo rinsantu cu khur sungah cun na tanta lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmah in nunnak lamzin cu i hmuh ding; Na umnak ah lungawinak a kim ih, Na ban thacak ah nomnak kumkhua in a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , dingfelnak hrangih Ka thlacamnak hi ngai hram aw. Bomnak dil ih ka aunak cu ruat hram aw. Ka thlacamnak cu thei hram aw; Bum hmang lo ka hmurka ih thla ka camnak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thudik na theih ruangah Keimah ṭan in thu na ṭhen ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah in ka thinlung na thei; Zan ah i rung veh ih, I hlathlai thluh hmanah, ka sungah ṭhat lonak zianghman na hmu lo. Ka hmurka in ṭongsia ka ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midang ih tuah vek cun ka tuah lo, Na thukham ka thlun ih Mi nunsia pawl ih lamzin ka thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lamzin ah ka feh ringring ih Ziangtik hmanah ka bah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Pathian, thla ka cam tikah Nang cun i run let ringring. Atu khalah na hna i tun awla Ka thu hi i theihsak aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw in Runtu, na duhdawtnak mangbangza cu run langter hram aw. Na kiangih a um hmuahhmuah cu ral pawl ih kut in an him a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mitmu na kilven vekin i kilveng hram aw; Na thladem thuaiah i thup hram aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in in do ih, Mithah hiar ka ral pawl in in kulh ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zaangfahnak zianghman nei loin, Puarthau zetin an ṭong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka fehnak kip in zawt ih in kulh ṭheh, Dirthlu dingah caan ṭha lawng an bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kiosa vek an si ih bauhthlek thluh lawng in tum. Kiosa no vekin an kua ihsin in bawh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tho awla ka ral pawl cu do in neh hai aw. Ka nunnak hi mi ṭha lo pawl kut ihsin na ralnam thawn i hum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na ban thacak in i hum hram aw, Leitlun covo lawng a neimi pawl kut sung ihsin. An hrangih na khawl ciami hremnak in hrem hai aw, An faale hrangah hremnak um sehla, An tesinfa pawl hrang tla ah taang hrih seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain kei cun dingnak thawn na hmai ka hmu ding; Ka ṭhangharh tikah na mithmai ka hmu ding ih, Ka lungawinak a kim ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ziangtluk in so ka lo duh! Nang cu ka cahnak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka lungpi, ka ralhruang le i runtu a si. Ka Pathian cu ka beunak lungpi, ka ralphaw le ka rundam cahnak a si; Amah sungah cun ka him.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thangṭhat tlak Bawipa cu ka ko ih, Ka ral pawl kut sung ihsin i luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thihnak hrihrual in i ngerh ih Siatnak tilian in i khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sheol hridai in i awk ih Thlaan in thang i kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Harsat ka ton laiah Bawipa cu ka ko; I bawm dingah ka Pathian cu ka ko a si. A biakinn ihsin ka aw a thei; Ka aunak aw a hna sungah a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian a thin a heng ruangah Leilung cu a hnin ih a thir, Tlang pawl ih hram ṭoh-nak tla cu An khur ih an ṭhia thlohthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnarkua in meikhu a suak ih, A kaa ihsin meihlio le meivam a suak zukzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Van a caihkuur ih a rung ṭum, Khawdur sahzet a ke hnuai ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherub parah to in a rung zam; Thli ih thla parah to in zamrang tein a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawthim in a tuam aw; Tidai in a khatmi mero sahzet a kimvel ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmaiih nimthlakau tle sungin Rial le meivam an rung tla ih Khawdur sahzet cu a run pah suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cu van ihsin khawri bangin a ri durdo; Cungnungbik in a aw a suah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A conkiang a sai ih a ral pawl a ṭhio ṭheh; A nimthla a kauter ih a tlanter ṭheh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thinheng in na ral pawl na kawk ih na huuk ciamco tikah cun, Tipi thuanthum ih tawne a lang ih Leilung ih hramṭohnak tla an lang ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in tlun ih van ihsin i run dawh ih i run kai; Tithukpi sung ihsin i dirh suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A cakzetmi ka ral pawl ih kut sungin i suah; I huatu le ka hrangih a cak tukmi kut sungin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka vanduai ni ah annih in in do; Asinain Bawipa in i hum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ṭihphannak ihsin himnak hmun kaupi ah i suah; Ka parih a lung a awi ruangah i run.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dikmi ka tuah ruangah Bawipa in laksawng i pek; Ka kut a thianhlim vekin i lehrul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa ih lamzin cu ka zawh; Ka Pathian hnen ihsin hlothlau zetin ka tlansuak dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A daan hmuahhmuah ka hmai ah an um ringring ih, A thupekmi pakhatte hman ka hnong dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hmaiah mawh nei lo ka si ih Sual phuhrunawknak ihsin hlimphirte in ka um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dingfelte ih ka um ruangah laksawng i pek; A mithmuh ih ka kut a thianhlim vekin i lehrul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , rintlakmi hnenah rintlak in na lang ih, Mawh neilo mi hnenah mawh nei lo in na lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi thianghlim hnenah thianghlim in na lang, Sikhalsehla mi khermei hrangah cun na khermei ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi tangdor pawl cu na run suak ṭheu, Asinain mi hngal pawl cu na nam thlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in ka mei-inn na vang ih, Ka Pathian, nangmah in ka thimnak tla na tleuter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ral pawl do theinak ah le An ṭannak hruang pawl lan thei nakah thazaang ṭha i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi Pathian ih lamzin cu a famkim a si; Bawipa ih thutiamnak cu rintlak a si! A hnenih beunak a hawltu hrangah Amah cu ralphaw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa siar lo Pathian dang zoso a um? Kan Pathian hlei ah lungpi dang a um mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah cu i caktertu Pathian a si ih, Ka lamzin khalah himnak a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zukneng bangin ka ke zuan a zaangter ih, A saannak hmun ah himte in i umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dar ih tuahmi li hman nawp thei dingah, Amah in ral do i zirh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in na rundamnak phaw i pek; Na vorhlam kut in i kaifek ih, Na nunneemnak in i tumlianter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka fehnak lamzin na kauter ih, Ka rilbah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ka dawi ih ka man hai a si; Ka siatsuah ṭheh hlan lo ka kir lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka saat hai ih an tho thei nawn lo; Ka kehram ah an ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nangmah in hi raldonak ah thazaang i pek ih, Ka ral pawl cu ka hnuai ah an tlu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka hnen ihsin ka ral pawl cu na tlanter ih, I huatu hmuahhmuah ka siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bomnak dil in an au, Asinain zohman in an run hai lo. Bawipa ih hnenah an au, Asinain a sawn hai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka deengcip vivo hai ih, Thli ih semmi leivut vekah an cang. Ka palcih vivo hai ih, Lamzin ih ciarbek vekah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Dodal hmang miphun sung in i run ih, Miphun tampi uktu ah i tuah. Ka theih dah lomi pawl cu i riantu ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka thuhla an theih cun ka thu an thlun; Ramdang mi tla ka hmaiah kun in an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Annih tla cu an thin a phang ih An ralhruang sung ihsin ṭhia thlohthlo in an ra suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Bawipa cu a nung a si! Ka ṭannak lungpi cu thangṭhat si ko seh. Ka rundamnak Pathian cu hlorh in um seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Phuba i laksaktu amah a si ih, Mi hmuahhmuah ka ke thuaiah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />I raltu pawl ih kut ihsin i runsuak. Maw Bawipa , ka ral pawl ih tlunah i khaisaang; Mi suaksual pawl lakin i runsuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Curuangah maw Bawipa , miphun tampi lakah ka lo lawm ding; Na hmin thangṭhatnak hla in ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Pathian in a siangpahrang hnenah nehnak tumpi a pek; Hriak a culh zomi David le a tesinfa hnenah kumkhua in A hmunmi a duhdawtnak cu A langter ringring a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van pawl khin Pathian sunlawinak an sim ih, Tlolak kaupi cun a kutsuak an langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun in sun hnenah thu a sim ih, Zan in zan hnenah theihnak a thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭong an hmang lo, aw khal an suah lo; Thawmvang zianghman theih a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain an aw cu leilung khua zakip ah a thang; An thuthanmi cu vanhram deng a thleng. Van ahl khin Pathian in ni hrangah puanthlam a zar sak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni cu a inn ihsin mo neitu tlangval pa bangin a rung suak, Tlan zuamnak ih a teltu tlangval ṭha bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khatlam vanhram dengin a thok ih, Khatlam deng tiang a heel ih a tlan. A satnak ihsin zohman a relh theitu an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih daan cu a famkim, Nunnak thartertu a si. Bawipa ih thupek mi pawl cu rintlak an si, A fim lomi fimnak petu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih daan pawl cu a dikzet, A thluntu hrangah lungawinak a si. A thukham pawl cu a dikzet, Thinlung mit vaangtertu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah cu a thiangfai, Kumkhua in a hmun ringring. Bawipa ih thu ṭhennak cu a dik, Ziangtik khalah a dik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sui hnakin duh a um sawn, Sui ṭha bik hnak khal in. Khuaitizu hnakin a thlum sawn, Khuaithlar ihsin a formi khuaitizu hnak khal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na siahhlawh i fimtertu a si, Na daan thlun cu hlawknak tumpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mah ih palhnak a thei theitu zoso a um? Thupte mawhnak in i thiangter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tumhrim sualnak khal in i hum awla, I uktu ah cang hram hlah hai seh. Cuticun mi famkim ka si ding ih Tuksumza sualnak in ka luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hmur in a suakmi ṭongkam le Ka thinlung ih khawruahnak tla hi, Maw Bawipa , na hmaiah cotlak si hram seh; Ka beunak lungpi le i runtu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangbang vansaangih na um ni ah Na aunak aw cu Bawipa in lo thei hram seh. Jakob ih Pathian in lo hum hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A biakinn ihsin bomnak lo pe sehla, Zion Tlang ihsin ṭanpinak lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thawinak pekmi hmuahhmuah lo saang sehla, Mei-ur thawinak na pekmi parah a lungawi hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungthlitum hmuahhmuah lo pe sehla, Na tumtahmi ah lo hlawhtlingter hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutiih na neh ruangah lungawi in kan au ding ih, Kan Pathian hmin in kan thantaar saangah kan khai ding. Bawipa in na dilmi hmuahhmuah cu lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hriak a culhmi siangpahrang cu, Bawipa in a bawm ti ka thei. A vancung thianghlim ihsin a aunak a run thei ih, A vorhlam kut in mi nehtu a siter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat in an raldonak rangleng an ring, A hrek in an rang an ring; Asinain kannih cun Bawipa kan Pathian ih cahnak kan rinsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih cu an bah ding ih an rilta ding, Asinain kannih cu kan thosal ding ih kan ding hnget ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , siangpahrang cu nehnak pe hram aw; Kan lo kawh tikah in sawn hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , siangpahrang cu na cahnak ah a lung a awi. Nehtu na siter ruangah lungawinak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungthlitum na pek zo; A lo dilmi hmuahhmuah na el lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnenah malsawmnak a phunphun thawn na ra ih, A lu parah sui lukhuh na khumter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nunnak a lo dil ih na pe zo, Kumkhua tlaitluan ih damnak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na bawm ruangah a sunlawinak a tum, Lennak le hminthannak na pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thluasuah cu a parah kumkhua in a hmun, Na umpi ruangah lungawinak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrang in Cungnungbik Bawipa a rinsan; A thleng-aw dah lomi Bawipa ih duhdawtnak ruangah, Anih cu hnial thei loin siangpahrang a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ral hmuahhmuah na kut cak in na kai ding; A lo huatu hmuahhmuah tla na kai ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lang tikah annih pawl cu Somei vaam bangin na ur thluh hai ding. Bawipa in a thinhengin a dolh thluh hai ding ih, Meisa in a kangral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang in an faale pawl an ci a hmit ding ih, An tesinfa pawl tla a ṭhiam thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo an ngaihtuah ih an phiar khalle, An hlawhtling lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A conkiang in a sai hai ding ih An pet an zuang ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na cahnak hi hlorh in um-aw sehla, Na thilti theinak cu hla in kan cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, Ziangah so i tlansan? Bomnak dil in ka au rero laiah, Ziangah so hlapi ih i um san?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, sun ah ka lo ko, Asinain i awi lo. Zan khal ah ka au rero naón Colhdamnak ka ngah cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nang cu siangpahrang tokham parah, Thianghlim bik in na to; Israel mi in hla ih thangṭhatmi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan pupa pawl in nangmah an lo rinsan; An lo rinsan ih na run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah an lo ko ih ṭihphannak in an luat; An lo rinsan ih an mualpho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain kei cu milai ka si nawn lo, cangcel ka si ko; Mi hmuahhmuah ih hmuhsuammi le nautatmi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I hmutu hmuahhmuah in hnihsuahsainak ah in hmang; An lei in khaak ih an mit in phen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Bawipa na rinsan a sisi; Ziangah so a lo run lo? Bawipa in a lo duh asile, Ziangah so a lo bom lo?” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nu ih pum sung ihsin damte in i suah tertu cu nangmah na si; Ka nu ih hnawi ka fawh lai khalah Himteih i kilkhawitu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka suah vete in nangmah ka lo rinsan; Ka suah ihsin nangmah cu ka Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hnen ihsin feh hram hlah aw; Harsatnak ka kiang a thleng, Zohman bawmtu ka nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ral tampi in cawcang bangin in kulh; Ka kiangkap ah an um ṭheh. Bashan ramih cawcang hee vek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kiosa vekin an kaa an ang; An huuk ih bauhthlek thluh in tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tha a cem, Leiro parih tidai thletmi vekin, Ka tha a poih ṭheh a si. Ka ruh pawl an pelh thluh zo; Ka thinlung cu meisa kiangih khuailul vekin, Ka sungah a zup thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka dang cu peibung vekin a caar ih, Ka lei cu ka saangkhar ah a erh aw a si. Nang in a thi zo ah i ruat ih leivut lakah i taanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uico pawl cu ka kiangah an um. Mi ṭha lo pawl in in kulh ṭheh; Ka kut le ka ke pawl an suntlang ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ruh pawl an lang thluh, Ka ral pawl cun in zoh ih in diriam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hnipuan pawl an ṭhen aw ih, Ka korfual ngah dingah camcawh fung an zuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka hnen ihsin tlan hram hlah aw! I Runtu, zamrang in ra awla i ra bawm aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ralnam ihsin i run awla; Ka nunnak cu hi uico pawl sungin in hum hram aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi kiosa pawl kaa sungin i suah aw; A hee zetmi cawcang pawl ki ihsin i runsuak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na tuahmi hmuahhmuah hi ka miphun hnenah ka sim ding; An tonkhawmnak ah ka lo thangṭhat ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Amah cu thangṭhat uh, nannih Bawipa ih siahhlawh pawl; Amah cu upat uh, nannih Jakob ih tefa sin pawl; Amah cu bia uh, nannih Israel mi pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi farah a thlauthla lo ih Mi zonzai pawl tuarnak tla a umsan meen lo. Annih pawl a dungtun lo. Asinain bomnak dil ih an au tikah A awi hai a si,” tiah ka ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na thil tuahmi ruangah hin An pumkhawmnak thupi ah ka lo thangṭhat ding. Thawinak pe dingih ka rak lo kam cia zo bangin, A lo ṭihzahtu pawl hmai ah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi farah pawl in an duhzat in an ei ding; Bawipa hnenih a rami pawl in amah an thangṭhat ding. Lungawi aipuang in um ringring hram hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah in Bawipa cu an thei sal ding ih, Vanrang deng khal in a hnenah an kir ding. Citin le hnamtin in amah an bia ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si; Miphun hmuahhmuah a uk hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi hngal le mi neinung pawl a hmai ah an bok ding; A thi theimi milai hmuahhmuah a hmai ah an kun ding; Mahte a nung awter thei lotu pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An tesinfa pawl in Bawipa ih hna an ṭuan ding; A ra dingmi san khalah Bawipa ih thu cu an sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A suak lai dingmi pawl hnen khal ah, “ Bawipa in a minung pawl a run a si,” tiah an sim ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu i khaaltu a si; Sammi zianghman ka nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlimno lakah i bawhter ih, A thiangmi tiva kamah i hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thazaang a tlunter saal i, I tiam cia vekin lamzin dingah i hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thimmi thihnak horkuam sung zawh hman ningla, Maw Bawipa , ka ṭih lo ding; Ziangahtile nang cu ka hnenah na um, Na talhtum le na kianghrol in ka hna in ngamter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ih hmuhhngan ah cabuai parah rawl i hun; Ka lu ah hriak i culh ih, Ka khuathai khal a liam thluahthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nunsung hmuahhmuah ah, ṭhatnak le duhdawtnak cun Pelh loin i thlun ringring ding. Bawipa ih inn ah kumkhua in ka um ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leilung pumpi le a sungih ummi hmuahhmuah cu, Bawipa ih ta an si. Leilung le a parih ummi tla Amah ih ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangahtile ti thukpi parah Leilungpi cu a dinter ih, A hram cu tipi thuanthum ih tawne ah a phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih tlang ah zoso a kai ding? A biakinn thiang sungah zoso a lut ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tuahnak le a ruahnak a thianghlim mi, Milem a bia lomi le Thuphan a per lomi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah cu Bawipa in thluasuah a pe ding ih a run ding; Pathian in, “Mawh nei lo na si,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian hnenih a rami cu cubangtuk an si; Jakob ih Pathian mithmai a hawltu pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw kotkhar pawl, rak khaisaang aw uh; Maw kumkhua sangka pawl, khaisaang aw uh; A sunglawimi siangpahrang a lut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sunglawimi siangpahrang cu zoso a si? A cakmi le a nasa zetmi Bawipa , Raldonak ih mi nehtu Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw kotkhar pawl, rak khaisaang aw uh; Maw kumkhua sangka pawl, khaisaang aw uh; A sunglawimi siangpahrang a lut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sunglawimi siangpahrang cu zoso a si? Amah cu mi hmuahhmuahih Bawipa , Sunloih mi siangpahrang a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka nunnak ka lo hlan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian, nangmah ka lo ring, Mualpho ningzahnak ihsin i luatter hram aw; Ka ral pawl cu ka parah an di riam hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah a lo ringtu cu an ning a zak dah lo; Nangmah a lo phiartu cu mualpho in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na lamzin i zirh aw; Na lamzin cu i theihter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thudik vekih nung dingah i zirh aw; Ziangahtile nangmah cu i Runtu na si; Sunvute nangmah ka lo hngak!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , khuahlan lai ihsin na rak langtermi, Na mi zaangfahnak le a thleng-aw dah lomi na mi duhdawtnak cu, vun ruat sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka no laiih ka mawhnak le ka thil tisualmi pawl I ngaidam hram aw. A thleng-aw dah lomi na duhdawtnak le na ṭhatnak ruangah, Maw Bawipa , kei hi i hngilh hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu a dik ih a ṭha; Misual pawl lamzin ṭha a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi tangdor pawl cu lamzin dik ah a hruai ih, Mi lungnem pawl cu a lamzin a zirh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thukham le a thupekmi a thluntu pawl cu, A duhdawtnak le rintlak a sinak thawn a hruai hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hmin ih vaangah, A besia zetmi ka sualnak cu i ngaidam hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihzahtu cu zoso an si? An thlun dingmi lamzin Pathian ih zirhmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Annih cu mi neinungzet an si ringring ding ih, An faale pawl khal himdam zetin An ram an luah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu a thu a thluntu pawl ih rualpi a si, A thukam a theihter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bomnak duh ah Bawipa cu ka zoh ringring, Cule thang sung ihsin i luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i hoih awla i zaangfah hram aw; Ziangahtile ka lung a leeng ih ka tha a nau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thinlung donharnak zatein in i sawng awla, Ka harnak sung in i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka harsatnak le ka tuarnak hi i theihsak awla; Ka sualnak hmuahhmuah i ngaidam hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ral pawl hi zohhnik aw! Ziangtluk in so an tam ih, Ziangtluk lawmmam in so in huat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I hum awla i run hram aw; Ningzahnak in i luatter hram aw; Beunak duh ah na hnenah ka ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ruahsannak na hnenih a um ruangah, maw Bawipa, ṭhatnak le felnak in i himter hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na minung Israel mi pawl hi, An harsatnak hmuahhmuah sung ihsin luatter hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mawh neilo a si, tiah i ti hram aw; Ziangahtile a dikmi ka tuah ih, Ka thinlung zatein nangmah ka lo ring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i zingzoi awla i hniksak hnik aw; Ka duhnak le ka ruahnak khal hi khingkhai hnik aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thleng-aw dah lomi na duhdawtnak in i kil ih, Rintlak na sinak in i hruai ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hlothlau pawl cu ka kom hai lo ih, Mi ti-awter pawl hnen khal ah ka tel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hrokhrawl pawl hnenih tel cu ka hua ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu ka hrial hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mawh neilo ka si langternak ah ka kut ka kholh ih, Nangmah bia phah in na biakṭheng cu ka heel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah hnenah lungawinak hla ka sak ih, Mangbangza na thil tuahmi pawl thu ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na umnak inn cu ka ngaina, Na huham a umnak hmun cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misual pawl lakah i siatter ve hlah awla, Laithat pawl thawn khal i hloralter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Annih cu cat loin sualnak thil ṭha lo a tuahtu le, Nawhthuh a la ringringtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain kei cu thildik a tuahtu ka si; I zaangfah awla i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭihphannak hmun ihsin hmun rawnpi ka thleng zo; Mi zapi khawmnak hmunah Bawipa Ka thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka tleunak le ka rundamnak a si; Zoso ka ṭih ding? Bawipa cu ka beunak lungpi a si; Zianghman ka ṭih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo ka ral pawl in in do ih a thah in tum tikah, Anmah riangri an bah ih an ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ralkap burpi ih in kulh ṭheh hmanah, ka ṭih lo ding; Ka ral pawl ih in nor ciamco hmanah, thlaphang loin, Pathian cu ka rinsan thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thil pakhat ka dil; Cuih thil pakhat lawng cu ka duhmi a si: Bawipa ih inn sungah ka nun sung hmuahhmuah um ka duh; A mawinak zoh dingah le amah ih duhmi hawl ding, hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harsat caanah amah ih puuk sungah i thup ding; A Biakinnpi sungah himte in i kilkhawi ding ih, A saangmi lungpi parah hnangamte in i umter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun ka kiang ih a ummi ka ral pawl cu ka neh ding. Lungawinak thawn au phah in a Biakinnpi sungah thawinak ka pe ding. Hla ka sak ding, Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka lo kawh tikah i thei hram aw; I zaangfah awla i let hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ra awla Bawipa ih mithmai hawl aw,” na ti tikah, “ Bawipa , na mithmai ka hawl ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mithmai i hersan hram hlah aw. Ka parah na thinheng loin, Na siahhlawh hi i khir hram hlah aw. Nangmah cu i bawmtu ringring na si. Maw Pathian, I Runtu, I taanta hlah awla i dungtun hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu le ka pa cun in dungtun hman hai sehla, Bawipa cun ṭhatein i tuam hlawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tuahter i duh mi cu i zirh awla, A dingmi lamzin ah i hruai aw. Ziangahtile ka ral an tam ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuphan le hro-nak hlir in i dotu ka ral pawl hnenah cun, i taanta hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nungmi pawl ih ram ah Bawipa ih ṭhatnak cu Ka hmu tengteng ding tiah ka zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu hngak uh; Cakzet le ralṭha in um uh; Bawipa cu hngak uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka Lungpi, Nangmah ka lo ko. Ka aunak aw i thei hram aw! Daiziar ih i umsan a si ahcun, Mithi khua ih a fehmi lakah ka tel ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bomnak dil in ka lo ko; Na Biakinnpi thianghlim lam ban phar in ka hoi tikah, Ka aunak aw i theih sak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siatnak hlir a tuahtu pawl le An ṭongkam cu a thlum naón An thinlung huatnak ih a khatmi, Mi ṭha lo pawl hnenah i hnong hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thil tuahmi, thilsual an tuahmi vekin lehrul hai aw; An hnaṭuanmi, an kutih an ṭuan sualmi vekin hrem hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnaṭuanmi le a kutih a tuahmi pawl cu ziang hmanah an siar lo. Curuangah siatbal hai awla, Ziangtik hmanah an tho sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thangṭhatnak pe uh; Zaangfah ka dilnak aw a thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka thazaang le ka ralphaw a si, Amah ka rinsan. I bom ruangah ka lung a awi. Amah cawimawinak cu hla in ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl a hum. A hrilmi siangpahrang cu a ṭan ih a run.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl hum awla, Na ta a si mi pawl cu thlawsuah pe hai aw. Anmah khaaltu si awla, Kumkhua in kilkhawi hai aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw vanmi pawl, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh; A sunlawinak le a cahnak cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmin sunglawi cu thangṭhat uh; A sunlawinak thawn a lang tikah Thianghlim bik hmai ah kun uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih aw cu tifinriat parah a thang; Sunglawi bik Pathian cu khawri bangin a ri durdo. A aw cu tipithuanthum parah a khawk ruangro.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih aw cu huham a nei zet ih a nasa ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih aw in sidar thingkung a khiak, Lebanon ih sidar thingkung tiangin a khiak thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah in Lebanon tlang pawl cu, cawte turcaai bangin a khirter ih, Hermon Tlang cu sele note bangin a petter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih aw in nimthla a kauter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A aw in nelrawn a hninter, Kadesh ih nelrawn khal cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih aw in zukneng pinu ih fa a suakter; Thingkung pawl tla an hnah a kolhter ṭheh. Cule a Biakinn sungah, “Pathian cu sunglawi seh,” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in tipi thuk pawl a uk; Siangpahrang a si ih kumkhua in a uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl cu thazaang cahnak a pek; Hnangamnak thawn a thlawsuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i run suak zo ih Ka ral pawl ih diremmi ka si lo ruangah nangmah ka lo thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, na hnenah bomnak dil in ka au ih nangmah in i damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mithi khua ihsin Nangmah in i kirter sal. Thihnak khur sungah ka tla lawk naón nangmah in ka nunnak cu na humsuak sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw rinsantlak a mithiang pawl, Bawipa cu hla in thang ṭhat cio uh. Thianghlim bik ih a tuahmi kha ciing uhla, Lungawinak a hnenah pe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thinhengnak cu mitṭhep fang a rei; Asinain a ṭhatnak cun sansung a daih. Zan ah ṭahnak um hmansehla, Zinglam ah lungawinak a thleng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka rinsan awk deuh tikah ka thinlungte in, “Neh mi ka si nawn lo ding,” tiah ka ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka parah na ṭha ngaingai ih, Tlangpar ih ralhruang sung um vekin himte in i ret. Sikhalsehla ka hmuh lonak ih na thuh-awk tikah cun, Ka thinlung cu ṭihnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo ko; Na zaangfahnak ka lo dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thih ahcun ziang ṭhatnak so na hrangah a um ding? Thlaan ih ka feh ahcun ziangso na hlawk cuang ding? Mithi in an lo thangṭhat ding maw si? A cat dah lomi na ṭhatnak hi an phuang thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i thei awla i zaangfah hram aw. Bawipa , i bawmtu si hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka riahsiatnak cu lungawi ih laamnak ah i thleng sak zo. Ka riahsiatnak khumdip puan cu i hliit sak ih, Lungawinak hnipuan i hrukter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah daiziarzi cun ka um lo ding; Nangmah thangṭhatnak hla ka sak ding. Maw Bawipa , nangmah cu ka Pathian na si. Na hnenah lungawinak kumkhua in ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hnenah beunak hawl in ka ra; Ningzak in i umter hlah aw. Nang cu a dingmi Pathian na si ruangah I run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lo dilnak aw thei in zamrang tein i run hram aw. Ka beunak si awla i hum hram aw; I ṭantu si awla i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang cu ka beunak lungpi le ka ralhruang na si. I tiam cia vekin i kil awla i hruai hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hrangih an kam ciami thang ihsin i luatter hram aw. Nang cu ka beunak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu na kut sungah ka lo hlan. Maw Bawipa , i hum hram aw; Nang cu rintlak Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Santlai lo milem a biatu pawl cu na hua. Asinain kei cun nang ka lo rinsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak ruangah Ka lung a awi ding ih ka ai a puang ding. Ka tuar zia na hmu ih ka harsat zia na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ih kut sungah i thlengter lo. Ka duhnakah luatzet in ka feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka parah zaangfahnak nei hram aw. Vansang in ka um a si. Ka ṭahnak ah ka mit a cuur ṭheh; Ka tha khal a cem ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Riahsiatnak ruangah ka nun a tawi ih, Ka ṭahnak in ka kum a ralter. Ka zonzai tuk ih ka taksa khal in a daih lo. Ka ruh tiangin an rop a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in capoh-nakah in hmang; Ka innhnen pawl in in hnihsan. I theitu pawl cun in ṭih; Lamzin ih in hmuh tikah an tlanhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zohman in in thei nawn lo; mithi tluk ah in ruat. Beelkuai hlonmi vek ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ral pawl thuthup an sim-aw ka thei. Ka kiangkap cu phannak in a khat. Keimah phiarnak khua an khang; A thah in tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Bawipa, Ka rinsanmi cu nangmah na si; Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ziangzongza na kut ah a um. Ka ral pawl le i hremtu pawl kut in i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei cu na siahhlawh ka si, Zaangfahnak thawn i zoh hram aw. A hmunmi na duhdawtnak in i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo ko; Ningzahnak ah i thlengter hram hlah aw. Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an ningzak ko seh; Mithi khua ah ṭong ding nei loin um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihngal le mi puarthau pawl, Hmuhsuamnak thawn miṭha pawl ih thu a reltu pawl, Thuphan an simnak kaa cu phit hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmah a lo ṭihzahtu pawl hrangih na khawl ciami thil ṭha a tam zia cu! Nangmah a lo ringtu pawl na humnak thu mi hmuahhmuah mithmuh ih a mawizia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thladem hnuai ah himte in na ret hai, Mi phiarnak ihsin an luat. Na puuk sungah hnangamte in na thup hai, An ral pawl ih hmuhsuamnak in an luat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat siseh. In kulh ih ka van a san laiah I duhdawtnak na langter zia cu mangbangza a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thin a phang ih ka lung in: ‘A umnak ihsin i hlon zo a sihi!’ tiah ka ruat. Asinain bomnak dilih ka lo kawh tikah ka aunak aw i thei thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw mithiang pawl, Bawipa cu duhdaw uh; Amah rinsantu cu Bawipa in a hum ih mi hngal pawl cu nasa zetin a tuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa ah ruahsannak a neitu pawl cu cak le ral ṭha in um uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A mawhnak ngaithiam a si mi le, A sualnak thlahsak a si mi cu mi thlawsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in sual a puh lomi le, A lung sungah mibumnak a neilotu cu mi thlawsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sualnak phuang loih ka um tikah cun, Sunvu ka ṭahnak ah ka taksa a vuai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a sun a zan in na kut in i nen; Ka thazaang cu, ṭhal ni ling ih daitla a roter bangin, a roter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule na hnenah ka sualnak cu ka phuang; Ka thil tisual mi pakhat hman ka pheh lo. Ka sualnak cu na hnenih phuang dingin ka ruat cat; Cule nangmah in ka sualnak cu i ngaithiam ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah a lo tlaihsantu hmuahhmuah in, An harsat caan ah na hnenah thla cam hai seh. Tilik lianpi a thlen tikah an hnen a thleng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka beunak hmun na si. Harnak in i hum ding. Nangmah ih i run ruangah I runnak cu hla in ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Na thlun dingmi lamzin ka lo sim ding. Ka lo zirh dingih ka lo hmuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rang le laak vek cun aa hlah; Na thu ngaitu si dingah annih cu Kakharh le hmurhri in dirh an ṭul,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih tuarmi cu a tam ngaingai; Asinain Bawipa a rinsantu cu A hmunmi a duhdawtnak in a hum hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nannih miding pawl, Bawipa ah lungawi aipuang in um uh. Nannih thinlung ṭha pawl, nuamzet in au uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nannih miding pawl, Bawipa ih thil tuahmi ruangah nan lungawi uh. Nannih a thu thluntu pawl, Amah thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah ṭingṭang thawn lungawinak thu sim uh. Hri pahra nei tingrisit thawn a hnenah hla sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnenah hla thar sak uh. Mawi zetin tingrisit tum uhla ring zetin hla sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih thu cu a dik; A tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu rintlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in dingnak le thudik a duh; A duhdawtnak in leilung hi a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in vanih ummi hmuahhmuah a thu in a seemsuah. A ṭong in ni, thlapi le arsi pawl a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tifinriat tidai pawl cu rial tithawl sungih tidai thun vekin hmunkhat ah a finkhawm; Tipithuanthum tithukpi pawl cu A thilri retnak khaan sungah a khum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung pumpi in Bawipa cu ṭih seh. Leilungtlun mi hmuahhmuah in Bawipa cu ṭihzah cio hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ṭong tikah leilung cu seemsuah a si ih, A thupeknak in ziang hmuahhmuah a suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in leitlun miphun pawl ih tumtahmi cu a phelhsolh. An tawlrelmi tuahsuak lo dingah a kham hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain amah ih tumtahmi cu kumkhua in a hmun ih, A tawlrelmi pawl cu sanikhuk a hnget.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa kha an Pathian ah a neitu miphun cu, mi thlawsuak phun an si. Bawipa in a rothil ah a hrilmi pawl cu mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa cun vancung ihsin a run zoh ih, Miphun hmuahhmuah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lalnak hmun ihsin leilung ih a ummi hmuahhmuah a run zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah cu an ruahnak hmuahhmuah a sersiamtu le, An tuahnak hmuahhmuah a theitu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siangpahrang in ral a neh tikah A ralkap bu an cahzet ruangah a si lo. Ralkap khal in ral a neh tikah Amah ih tha a cah ruangah a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Raldonak rang pawl cu ral nehnak ngaingai ahcun, Santlai lo an si. An cahzet hmanah zohman an run thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in amah ṭihzahtu le A hmunmi a duhdawtnak a ringtu cu A kilveng ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thihnak ihsin a run hai ih Paampi a tlun tik khalah an nunnak a hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah ruahsannak kan nei. Amah cu in bawmtu le in humtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah ih ruangah kan lung a awi. A hmin thianghlim kan ring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hnenih ruah saannak kan neih bangin, A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu Kan hnenah um hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih parah ka lung a awi ringring ding. Amah thangṭhat cu ka bang dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thil tuahmi ruangah amah cu ka thangṭhat ding. Rethei zonzai pawl in thei uhla nan lungawi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih maksak zia cu in cawimawi pi uhla, Amah ih hmin cu thangṭhat tlang uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thla ka cam ih amah in i let. Ka ṭihphannak hmuahhmuah sungin i luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi zonzai pawl in amah cu an zoh ih an lung a awi. Ziangtik hmanah an ning a zak nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawmtu nei lo pawl in amah an ko ih a sawn hai. An harsatnak hmuahhmuah in a luatter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihzahtu pawl cu a vancungmi in an kil ih, ṭihphannak in a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭhatzia cu nanmah tein tep ciar hnik uh; A hnenih himnak a ngahtu cu mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw amah ih minung pawl, Bawipa cu ṭihzah uh. Amah a ṭihzahtu cu tlaksammi zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kiosa hman rilrawng in an um ṭheu; Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih duhnak a thluntu cu, Thil ṭha an hlawhsam dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ra uh, mino pawl, i ra ngai hnik uh. Bawipa ṭihzah daan ka lo zirh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leilung tlunah hin nuam zetih nun nan duh maw? Nun sau le lungawi nan duh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan duh asile a ṭha lomi ṭong lo dingah le Thuphan sim lo dingah ralring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo cu hrial uhla a ṭhami tuah uh. Daihnak tumtah uhla a cangthei tawkin ngah zuam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in miding pawl cu a zoh ringring hai ih an aunak khal a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu a dodal hai a si. An thih tikah an hmin hngilh tata dingah a phiatfai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Miding pawl in Bawipa cu an ko ih an aw a thei; An harsatnak hmuahhmuah sungin a luatter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in thinnau mi pawl cu a naih hai ih, Beiseinak zianghman a nei nawn lotu pawl cu a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ṭha khal harnak tampi a tuar ṭheu; Asinain Bawipa in cu hmuahhmuah sung khal in a suah ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in ṭhazet in a kil, A ruh pakhatte hman a kiak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cu ṭhatlonak in a that ding; Miding a huatu pawl cu hremnak an tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in a siahhlawh pawl cu a tlen hai ding; Beunak duh ah a hnenih a fehtu cu, an him ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i ralsantu pawl ralsan ve awla, I dotu pawl do ve aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ralphaw le na raldonak thuam la awla, Keimah bawm dingah pok aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na feipi le na hriamhrei la awla, I dawitu pawl cu kham hai aw. Cule, “Nangmah Runtu ka si,” tiah i tiam hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keimah thah i tumtu pawl cu Sung hai sehla ningzak in um hai seh; Keimah siatsuah ding ih i phiartu pawl cu, Thinnau le thinlung hnok in kir hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi in a dawi hai tikah, Thli ih a semhlomi fanghi vek si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi in a vuak hai tikah, An lamzin thim sehla naalzet seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangthu hman um loin keimah kai dingah, Thang in kam ih khur thuk an lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain an theih hlanah siatsuahnak in a man ding; Anmah ih kam ciami thang in a awk hai ding ih, Siatsuahnak sungah an tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ah ka lung a awi ding; I hum ruangah ka ai a puang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah ka thinlung zatein, “Nangmah bangtuk zohman an um lo; Mi ṭawnṭai pawl cu mi cak pawl kut ihsin na humhim ih, Mi farah zonzai pawl cu Hmuhsuamtu pawl ih kut ihsin na humhim hai a si,” ka ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ka sual hawltu ah an suak ih, Ka theih dah lomi sual in puh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhatnak cu siatnak in in lehrul ih, Thinnau le riahsia in ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An dam lo tikah riahsia in buri hnipuan ka hruk ih, An hrangah rawl ka ul. An hrangah lu kun in thla ka cam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka rualpi le ka unau hrangih riahsia bangin. Mi pakhatkhat a nu ih zuun a ngai bangin, An hrangah riahsia in ka kuun ih ka feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain harsatnak ka ton tikah, Annih pawl cu an lung a awi; Keimah hnihsan dingah in kulh, Tluangmi pawl khal in in vua, Cat loin in vaw ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ke-awl an hmuhsuam ih an puahcok bangin, In hua ih in mitkem ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso hiti in i zoh meen ding? Hitiih in vuaknak ihsin i run hram awla, Ka nunnak cu hi kiosa pawl kut sungin i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuticun a pumkhawmmi na minung lakah ka lo lawm ding, An zate hmaiah ka lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuphanpertu ka ral pawl cu kham hai aw, Ka sun ruangah diriam in um hlah hai seh; Thuhla um loin i huatu pawl cu kham hai aw, Ka riahsiat ruangah an lungawi in hni suamso hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rualpi ṭha ṭong in an ṭong lo, Rualremnak a duhtu pawl kha thuphan a phunphun an puh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sual in puh ih, “Na tuahmi kan thei,” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa nang in hi thil hi na hmu thluh; Curuangah Bawipa daitein um hram hlah aw; Lamhla ah i umsan hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tho awla Bawipa i hum aw; Ding awla ka Pathian ka thu i simsak aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nang cu a dingmi na si; Curuangah sual nei lo a si tiah i phuan sak aw. Ka ral pawl cu hni suamso in umter hlah hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kan dawihlo zo, kan duh mite kan tuah ngah zo,” an ti lonak dingah nangmah in kham hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi tluk ka tuarnak parih a hni sursotu pawl cu, Ningzak le buai in um hai seh. “Anih hnakin kan ṭha deuh,” i titu pawl cu, Mualpho le thangsia in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keimah thiamcotermi ka si ding, i duhsaktu cu lungawi aipuang in um hai sehla, “ Bawipa cu a maksak a si; A siahhlawh hlawhtlinnak a ngah ruangah a lung a awi a si,” tiah cat loin au hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuticun na dingnak cu ka than ding ih, Sun nihlawh in ka lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sualnak in mi ṭha lo ih thinlung sungah thu a vun sim; Cutiin Pathian an hnong ih malte hman Pathian ṭihnak an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anmah le anmah an porh awk tuk ruangah an sualnak an hmu thei loih an hua thei fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An kaa ih a suakmi cu sualnak le thuphan hlir an si. Ṭhatnak zianghman tuah dingah fimnak an nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ihkhun ih a zau phah ah thilṭha lo a ngaihtuah; Theinacing in zinsia a zawh; Ziangbangtuk sualnak hman hrial mi a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a hmunmi na duhdawtnak vancung a thleng ih, Rintlak na sinak in van khi a dai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na dingfelnak cu tlang saangpi bangtuk in a saang ih, Na dingthluk lairelnak cu tipi thuanthum bangtuk in a thuk. Maw Bawipa , nang cun minung siseh ramsa siseh na zaangfah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, a hmunmi na mi duhdawtnak cu a va sunglawi ve! Mi in na thladem ah humhimnak an ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na inn sungih ei cawk lo rawl cu an ei-ih, Na lungawinak tiva ihsin tidai na pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangahtile na hnenah nunnak cerhti a um; Na tleunak sungah tleunak kan hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah a lo theitu hnenah, Na duhdawtnak cat loin um sehla, Thinlung a dingmi hnenah, Na ṭhatnak cat loin um hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihngal pawl cun i siim hram hlah hai seh; Mi ṭha lo pawl cun i tlanter hram hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl an tlaknak khi zohhnik! Khi tawkah an ril ih an thosal thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo an um ruangah donhar in um hlah. Sualnak a tuahtu pawl khal va daw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annih cu hrampi ro bangin an hlo ding ih, Hramkung vuai bangin an thita ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu rinsan awla thil ṭha tuah aw. Cuticun hi ram sungah himdamte in na um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ah na lungawinak hawl awla, Na lungthlitum a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah na nunnak pe aw; Amah rinsan awla a lo bawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhatnak cu sun khawvang bangin a vangter ding ih, Na dingnak cu sun nitleu bangin a tleuter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah daiteón um aw, Amah ih cangvaihnak cu thinsau in hngak aw; Mi neinung an um ruangah ninghang in um hlah; Mi ṭha lo pawl khawkhannak an hlawhtlin ruangah thin ṭeu in um hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thinheng hlah! Na ai khal thok hlah! Na don tla har hlah! Thil ṭha lo a suahter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa a rinsantu cu hi ram sungah hnangamte in an um ding. Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu dawihlo an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Reilote-ah mi ṭha lo pawl cu an hlo ding. Na hawl khalle na hmu nawn lo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla lungnem pawl cun, Ram cu an luah ding. Daihnak le neihnunnak an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭha loin mi ṭha an phiar, An hacang an rial ih huatnak mit in a zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in mi ṭha lo cu a hnihsan; An cem cing ding ti a theih ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cun an ralnam an zuuk ih an li an nawp; Mi farah le zonzai thah an tum. Mi ṭha le mi fel thah ṭheh an tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla anmah ih zuh mi ralnam in a dawt hai ding ih, An li pawl cu khiah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih neihmi thil tampi liangluang hnakin, Mi tha pawl ih neihmi thil malte man a nei sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa in, Mi ṭha lo ih thazaang cahnak cu a khiak ding ih, Mi ṭha pawl cu a humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in amah ih thu a thluntu pawl cu a kilkhawi hai; Hi ram cu kumkhua in anmah ih ta a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Harsat caanah mual an pho lo ding; Paam caan khalah ei khop an ngah ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu an hloral ding; Bawipa a raltu pawl cu hramlak pangpar bangin an ziam ding, Meikhu bangin an hlota ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cun mi thil an cawi ih an sam sal nawn lo; Asinain mi ṭha cun mi a zaangfah ih a tirh a siang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa ih thlawsuahmi pawl in hi ram hi an co ding; Asinain a camsiatmi pawl cu dawihlo an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minung ih fehnak lamzin cu Bawipa in a sial sak ih An nuncan parah a lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A bah hmanah a rilta lo ding, Ziangahtile Bawipa in a tho saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka seenlai ihsin ka tar tiang, Bawipa in mi ṭha a tlansan ka hmu dah lo. An faale pawl khal rawl diltu an si ka hmu dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ziangtik khalah siang zetin mi a pe ih mi a coih, A faale pawl cu thlawsuah ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siatnak cu tlansan awla ṭhatnak tuah aw; Cutin hi ram sungah kumkhua in na um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa cun a dikmi a duh ih, Amah rinsantu pawl cu a dungtun hai lo a si. Annih cu kumkhua in a hum hai. Asinain mi ṭha lo ih tefa pawl cu dawihlo an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miding pawl in hi ram cu an luah ding ih, Hnangamtein kumkhua in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl ih kaa in fimnak a suak; An lei in dingnak a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian ih daan cu a thinlung sungah a ret ih, Ziangtik hmanah a pialsan dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in mi ṭha cu a zoh thup ringring ih thah a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in a ral ih kut sungah a taanta lo ding ih, A thu an rel tik khalah a hnongta lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nan ruahsannak cu Bawipa ih hnenah ret uhla, A thupekmi pawl thlun uh. Hi ram co theinak thazaang a lo pe hai ding. Cule mi ṭha lo pawl siatsuah thluh an si cu na hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pakhat thu neizet le porh-aw zettu ka hmu zo; Lebanon sidar thingkung bangin midang hnakih saang deuh ah a ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asinain nehhnu ih ka zoh sal tikah a um nawn lo. Ka hawl khalle ka hmu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi ṭha cu zohhnik uh, Mi ding cu thlir hnik uh; Mi lungnem le midai cun te le fa an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu an hloral ṭheh, An tefa pawl cu an cimit ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi ding pawl ih runnak cu Bawipa hnen in a ra. Harsatnak caan ah an beunak lungpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bawipa in annih cu a bawm ih a run; A hnenah beunak duh ih an feh ruangah, Mi ṭha lo kut ihsin a hum hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thinheng in i kawk hram hlah aw. Na thin-aithok in i hrem hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na conkiang in i tuahmawh zo; Ril ko in i vuak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thin a heng ruangah besia zetin ka na; Ka sualnak ruangah ka ruangpi cu natnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sualnak tilian sungah ka pil; I delh tuk ih ka phur thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka aat ruangah ka hma pawl cu Hnai an khuar ih an thu, an nam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka eel a kuun ih ka bokta. Sun nihlawh in ka ai, ka hruum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tak a sa ih ka khur ciamco; Ka besia ih ka thi zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tha a cemthla ih ka bei a dong ngaingai. Ka thinhar in ka hui ka ai rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thinlung duh mi cu na hmu, Ka hruumnak khal na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lung a hnin ih tha ka nei nawn lo. Ka mit khal khua a hmu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hma tampi ka neih ruangah ka rualpi le, Kan innhnen pawl in in hrial; Keimah ih innsung saang hman hlimphirte in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thah i duhtu pawl in thang in kam. Tuahmawh i duhtu pawl in siatsuah dingah in hro. Sun nihlawh in keimah phiarnak an tawlrel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnaset ka bang, zianghman ka thei thei lo. Dangpit ka bang, zianghman ka ṭong thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ṭong a theih thei lo ruangah, Mi thusuh a let thei lomi ka bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo hngak; Bawipa ka Pathian, nangmah in i sawn hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Harsatnak ka ton ruangah ka ral in in direm hlah hai seh; Ka bah ruangah porh-aw hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka bah zik ringring ih Cat loin harsatnak ka tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka sualnak ka phuang, Ka thinlung donharnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu an harhdam zetih an cakzet fawn. Ziangthu hman um lo ih i huatu an tamzet fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dikmi tuah ka tum ruangah Keimah i duh lotu pawl cun ṭhatnak cu siatnak in in lehrul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i dungtun hram hlah aw; Maw ka Pathian, a hlatnak ah i umsan hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i Runtu, atu-ah zamrangin i ra bawm hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka thil tuahmi ka ralring pei, Ka lei in i sualter hlah seh; Ka ral pawl ka kiangkap ih an um sungah cun, ṭong lotein ka hmur ka ciip ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Daiziar in ka um ih kam khat hman ka ṭong lo; Thil ṭha thu hman rel lotein ka um. Asinain ka harsat tuarnak cu a zual deuhdeuh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thinlung donharnak in a khat. Ka ruat tam deuhdeuh, ka thin a ling deuhdeuh. Curuangah Pathian hnenah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso hiti in ka nun ding? Ka thi mai sawn lo ding maw? Tuan ah ka nunnak hi a cem ko lo ding maw? I theihter hram aw!” tiah sut loin ka um thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi na va tawiter tuk lawmmam so! Na hmaiah ka nun caan tawite hi ziangti tham a si lo. Minung nunnak cu kan thaw ih kan thawt mi thli lawng hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan phenthlam tluk fang a rak si. A ṭuanmi hmuahhmuah cu thu lolak hlir ah an cang. Ro a khawl vivo naón a cotu ding ngaingai a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuti asile maw Bawipa , ziangso beisei ding ka neih? Ka ruahsanmi cu nangmah lawng na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sualnak hmuahhmuah sungin i luatter awla, Mi aa pawl ih hnihsuahsainak ah i cangter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi tluk harsatnak tuar dingih i tuah ruangah, Daite in ka um ding; Kam khat hman ka ṭong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I hrem nawn hlah aw. I vuak ruangah ka thi zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minung sualnak cu kawknak thawn na lehrul, A sunsakmi thil hmuahhmuah cu, sunhrul bangin na siatsuah ṭheh a si. Asi, minung cu kan thawtmi thaw vek fang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thlacamnak i thei hram awla, Ka lo dilmi hi i ngaisak hram aw. Na hnenih ka ṭah tikah daitein i um san men hlah aw. Ka pu le ka pa pawl vekin kei hi caan tawite sung lawng na mikhual ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi leilung hi ka fehsan ih ka um nawn lo tikcu caan a thlen deuh hlan ahhin lungawi hnadai ih ka um theinak dingah khatlam i hoisan hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih bomnak cu thinsau in ka hngak ringring, Cule i run ngai ih ka aunak a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭihnungza khur thukpi sungin i dir suak; Ciarbeek duuppi in a khatmi kua sung ihsin, Lungto parah himte in i dinter ih Hnangamtein i ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla thar sak ding i zirh, Kan Pathian faknak hla cu; Hi ka tonmi thil hi mi tampi in an hmuh tikah, An ṭih ding ih Bawipa cu an rinsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawzing pawl biaknak ih a tel lotu le mi puarthau a kom lo ih Bawipa sawn a rinsantu cu mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, Kan hrang thil tampi na tuah zo. Nangmah bangtuk zohman an um lo. Kan hrangah mangbangza tumtah mi na nei; A zate in sim le phuan ṭheh tum sehla, ka sim cawk dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Raithawinak le thawhlawm pekmi pawl hi na duhmi an si lo. Biakṭheng parih ṭilva mei-ur thawinak pek khal na dilmi a si lo. Sualthlah thawinak pek khal na lungawimi a si lo. Cu ai-ah na thu theih theinak ah hna i pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hnenah, “Hinah ka um. Ka hrangih na retmi na cazual sungah ka thuhla ngan in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, na duhnak thlun cu ziang tlukin so ka duh! Na thupekmi cu ka thinlung sungah ka ret,” tiah ka lo ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl an pumkhawmnak hmun ah, In runnak thuthangṭha ka sim. Cuih thusim cu ka cawl dah lo ding, ti cu na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na runnak thuthang cu keimah hnen lawngah ka ret lo. Rintlak na sinak le in bomnak thu cu ka sim ringring a si. A hmunmi na duhdawtnak le na felnak cu, Na minung pawl an tonkhawmnak hmunah daiteón ka umpi meen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka parih zaangfahnak na neihmi cu cemter hram hlah aw. Na duhdawtnak le in tlaihsannak cun in humhim ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Harsatnak tampi in i kulh, siarcawk khal an si lo. Ka sualnak in i kai ngah, khua khal ka hmu thei lo. Ka lu parih sam hnakin an tam deuh ih ka thin a phang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i run awla zamrang in i bawm hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keimah thah i tumtu pawl cu Ningzak le thinlung aa in um hai seh. Harsatnak ka ton ruangih lungawitu pawl cu, Dungah kirsal hai sehla mualpho in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnihsuahsainak ih i hmangtu pawl cu, An sun ruangah ningzak in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na hnenih a rami pawl cu Lungawi le thinnuam in um hai seh. Na rundamnak a sunloihtu pawl cun, “ Bawipa ih maksak zia cu!” ti ringring hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kei cu mi rethei le mi tlasam ka si; Asinain nang cun i ruatzet. Nang cu i bawmtu le i Runtu na si; Maw Pathian, i ra bawm zaang aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi farah pawl zawnruattu cu mi thlawsuak an si, An harsat caan ah Bawipa in a bawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in a kilkhawi ding ih a nunnak a humhim ding; Hi ram sungah hin mi lungawi a siter ding; A ral pawl ih kut sungah a taanta lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nat tikah Bawipa in a bawm ding ih a damter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih hnenah, “Maw Bawipa , na parah ka sual zo. I zaangfah hram awla i damter hram aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in in nahsiik ih in ṭongsanmi cu a sia ngaingai. “Ziangtikah so a thih ding ih, A hmin a hlohta ding cu?” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I ra vehtu pawl cu thinlung tak in a rami an si lo. Ka parih thusia lawnglawng an hawl ih an kir sal tikah khawzakip ah in rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I huatu pawl cun ka thu hlir thuthup ah an rel. Ka hrangih a sia pittawp tiangin an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih in, “Besiazet in a na ih, A ihkhun ihsin a tho nawn zik lo,” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rualpi ṭha bik, ka rinsan bikmi le ka rawl i ṭawmtu rori in i phiarsawm zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i zaangfah awla i damter hram aw; Ka ral pawl ka lehrul theinak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ih in neh lo a si ahcun, Ka parah na lung a awi a si, ti ka thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dikmi ka tuah ruangah nangmah in i bawm ding; Na hnenah kumkhua in i umter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian cu thangṭhat uh. Amah cu atu le kumkhua in thangṭhat uh. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zukneng in zo tidai a ngai duahdo vekin, Maw Pathian, nangmah cu ka lo ngai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Pathian, a nungmi Pathian, Ka nunnak in nangmah cu tidai bangin a lo haal a si. Ziangtikah so na hnen ka thlen ih, Na mithmai ka hmuh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sun a zan in ka ṭap ih, Mitthli lawng hi ka rawl a si. Ka ral pawl in, “Khui-ah so na Pathian cu a um?” tiah cat loin in sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A cem ciami tikcu ka ruah sal tikah ka lung a kuai ṭheu. Mi senpi thawn Pathian inn ih kan rak feh ṭheu kha; Cutiih kan feh tikah keimah cu an hruaitu ka rak si; Lungawi aipuang in, au phah le Pathian thangṭhatnak hla sak phah in kan rak feh kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangah so hi tluk lawmmam in ka riah a siat? Ziangah so hi tluk lawmmam in ka thinlung a bang? Asinain ka ruahsanmi cu Pathian lawng a si. Amah cu ka thangṭhat sal ding; I Runtu le ka Pathian cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan saltaannak hmun ah ka lung a kuai ṭheh zik thlang; Jordan ram in le Hermon le Mizar Tlang kiang ihsin Amah cu ka ciing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tipithuanthum thuk in ti thuk dang a ko; Riahsiatnak cu ka nunnak sungah tisuar bangin le tilik bangin an ra thleng. Riahsiatnak tisuar an bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in nitinte in in duhdawtnak langter hram seh. Zan ah a hla cu ka thinlung ah a caam. Ka nunnak Pathian hnenah thla ka cam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian, i ṭantu ka lungpi hnenah, “Ziangah so i hngilh zo? Ziang hrangah so ka ral pawl ih in tisiatnak cu ka tuar rero hrih ding?” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ṭongsannak cu ka hrangah hma hnaikhuar bangin a na; Cat bang loin, “Na Pathian cu khui-ah so a um?” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangah so hitluk lawmmam in ka riah a siat? Ziangah so hitluk lawmmam in ka thinlung a bang? Asinain ka ruahsanmi cu Pathian lawng a si. Amah cu ka thangṭhat sal ding. I Runtu le ka Pathian cu!
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thu i rel sak awla, Pathian thei lomi pawl ih hmaiah, Sual nei lo ka sinak hi i than sak aw. Mi ṭha lo le mibum thiam pawl ihsin i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah cu i humhimtu na si; Ziangah so i thlauthlak? Ka ral pawl ih in tisiatnak cu Ziangah so ka tuar hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tleunak le na thudik i pe hram awla, Na tlang thianghlim Zion ah le Na umnak na Biakinnpi ah i hruai kir hram hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun maw Pathian na biakṭheng ah ka feh ding; Lungawinak le aipuannak i pek ruangah maw Pathian, ka Pathian, Tingrisit tum phah in thangṭhatnak hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangah so hitluk lawmmam in ka riah a siat? Ziangah so hitluk lawmmam in ka thinlung a bang? Asinain ka ruahsanmi cu Pathian lawng a si. Amah cu ka thangṭhat sal ding. I Runtu le ka Pathian cu!
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan hna in kan thei zo, Kan pu le kan pa pawl in in sim zo; Khuahlan laiih thil mangbangza na tuahmi pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah in Pathian thei lo pawl na dawi ih, Na minung pawl hi ram luahtu ah na tuahnak cu! Miphun dang pawl cu na hrem hai naón, Na minung pawl cu mi neinung ih na tuahnak pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na miphun pawl in hi ram cu an ralnam in an neh a si lo; An cahnak in an neh khal a si lo. Na vorhlam ban thacak le huham, an hnenih na um ringringnak le, Na duhdawtnak an hnenih na langternak in an neh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka siangpahrang le ka Pathian na si. Na minung hnenah ral nehnak na pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na huham in kan ral pawl cu kan neh; Na hmin in in dotu pawl leilung ah kan palcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka li hi ka rinsan lo; Ka ralnam khal hi i run theitu a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan ral pawl ih kut ihsin in hum zo ih, In huatu pawl na neh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan lo thangṭhat ding ih, Kumkhua in kan lo cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Pathian, Nangmah in in hnong ih kan ral in in neh sal zo. Kan ralkap bu pawl hnenah na feh nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan ral pawl hmai ihsin in tlanter zo, Kan ral in kan thilri pawl in long ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuu vekih thah thluh dingah in siang zo; Ram dangdang ah in ṭhekdarh thluh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na minung pawl na zuar hai ih An man na ngenmi cu zianghman reltlak a si lo. Na zuarmi man in zianghman hlawknak na ngah fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan parih na thil tuah mi hi kan kiangkap pawl in an hmuh tikah, In hmuhsuam ih in hnihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miphun tampi lakah nautat phun ah kan cang; Nautat hmuhsuamnak thawn an lu in suthnawh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In duh lotu le ka ral pawl Hmuhsuamnak le relsiatnak ka theih ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ningzahnak in puan bangin i khuh ih, Mualpho in ka um ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan lo hngilh lo ih Kanmah thawn na thukamnak tla kan balsiat lo naón, Hi bangtuk thil hi kan parah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan thinlung hi a zuangzam dah lo; Kan ke khal na lamzin ihsin an pial dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain zohman bawmtu nei loin ramsa lakah in taanta ih, Thihnak khawthim sungah in hlonta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian biak kan cawl ih Ram dang khawzing hnenah thla kan cam sibang sehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah in in thei thluh zo ding a si; Ziangahtile nang cu minung ih Ruahnak thup tla a thei ṭhehtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nangmah ih ruangah Sun nihlawh thah tuar rero in kan um; Thah dingmi tuu tlukih ruah mi kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ṭhang thlang aw! Ziangah so na ih ringring? Tho thlang aw! Kumkhua cun in taanta hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangah so kan hnen ihsin na relh ringring? Kan harsatnak le kan tuarnak hi in hngilh sak hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lei parih palcih mi kan si; Ral in in neh ih leivut lakah in thluk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tho awla in bawm aw. A hmunmi in duhdawt ruangah in run hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thinlung cu ṭongṭha le ṭongmawi in a khat, Siangpahrang hrangih hi hla ka phuah tikah hin, Ka lei cu cangan thiam pa ih cafung bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang cu mipa hmuahhmuah lakah a piangbik na si, Na hmurka khal a thlum bik; Pathian in a lo thlawsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na taai ah na ralnam thlaih aw; Nang cu huham nei le mi sunglawi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thudik le dingnak ṭan in, Mi dang hnakin a cuang in nehnak lamzin ah feh aw. Na ban thacak in nehnak tampi a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na conkiang an hriam ngaingai; Na ral pawl ih thinhna a suntlang a si. Miphun tampi cu na ke hramah an tlu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ih a lo pekmi siangpahrang tokham cu, Kumkhua in kumkhua tiang a hmun ding. Na uknak cu lal kianghrol thawn dingtein na uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhami cu na duh ih a ṭha lomi cu na hua; Curuangah Bawipa na Pathian in a lo hril zo ih, Siangpahrang dang hmuahhmuah hnakin na parah lungawinak hriak cu a burh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hnipuan tla cu myrr rimhmui, aloes rimhmui le kassia rimhmui pawl hnih mi an si ih an hmui vurvo. Vuiho ih cermi siangpahrang inn ah hlathiam pawl in awnmawi thawn an lo nompi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na umnak innpi sungih a ummi nunau pawl cu Siangpahrang fanu an si. Na siangpahrang tokham ih vorhlam kap ah Ofir sui ṭha bik hlawnthil a hruktu Siangpahrang bawinu a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw siangpahrang ih fala, Ka sim mi hi i thei sak hram aw: Na minung le na sungkhat pawl hngilh ta aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na mawi ruangah siangpahrang in a lo hahio ding. Na bawipa a si ih amah ih thu cu na ngai pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭai-ar khua nunau pawl in laksawng an lo pe ding. Mi lian pawl in nangmah ih tlaihsan duh ah paisa an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang fanu cu siangpahrang inn sungah a um. Fala mawizet a si! A hnipuan cu sui pat ih tahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnipuan a mawi zetmi sin in siangpahrang hnenah an fehpi, Amah kilkhawitu nunau pawl in an thlun ih, Annih khal cu bawipa ih hnenah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungawi aipuang in an feh ih Siangpahrang inn sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw ka siangpahrang, fapa tampi na nei ding ih, Na pu le na pa ih ai-awhtu an si ding. Cule leilung pumpi uktu ah na tuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi ka hla phuahmi in na hmin cu kumkhua in a nungter ding. Mi hmuahhmuah in nangmah cu Kumkhua in an lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu kan beunak le kan thazaang a si; Harsat caan ah cat loih in bawmtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah zianghman kan ṭih lo ding; Leilung pi a hnin ṭheh ih, Tipithuanthum thuuk sungah tlangsaang pawl an cim ṭheh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tifinriat pawl tilet tho in a huuk ih tlang pawl an hnin an cim hman ah kan ṭih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian khawpi sungah le, Cungnungbik ih inn thianghlim sungah lungawinak a rak luanpitu tiva pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih khawpi ah Pathian a um ih Ziangtik hmanah siatsuah a si dah lo ding. Zingthlapit ah cuih khua bawm dingin a ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun pawl an tuk a sum, Uknak ram pawl an hnin ṭheh; Pathian in a aw a suah ih leilung pumpi cu a ziam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa cu kan hnenah a um. Jakob ih Pathian cu kan beunak lungpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ra uh; Bawipa ih a tuahmi hi zohhnik uh, Leilung tlun ih thil a siatsuah thei zia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung pumpi ah ral a daihter; Li pawl a khiak ṭheh, fei pawl a sattan ṭheh ih, Ralphaw pawl mei in a ur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah in, “Nan do awknak cu baang thlang uh, Keimah hi Pathian ka si kha thei uh; Miphun hmuahhmuah tlunah bawi bik ka si ih leilung pumpi tlun khal ah bawi bik ka si thotho,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa cu kan hnenah a um. Jakob ih Pathian cu kan beunak lungpi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw leilung mi pawl, lungawi in nan za beng uh; Pathian cu ring zetin hla in thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa , Cungnungbik cu maktara Pathian a si. Amah cu a lian bik siangpahrang a si ih leilung pumpi uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah in miphun tampi tlun ah nehnak in pe ih, Miphun tampi uktu ah in tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan hrangah kan umnak leiram hi a hril; A duhdawt a minung pawl ih comi, Jakob ih uarmi ram sunglawi cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian cu a siangpahrang tokham ah a hung feh. Lungawi ih au thawm le tawtawrawt tum thawm a um, Bawipa a hung feh tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sak uh. Kan siangpahrang hnenah cawimawi- nak hla sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian cu leilung pumpi tlunah siangpahrang a si. Amah cu hla in thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian cu a siangpahrang tokham thianghlim ah a to. Miphun hmuahhmuah a uk ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung miphun uktu pawl cu Abraham Pathian ih minung pawl thawn hmunkhat ah an tongkhawm. Raldotu ih ralphaw hmuahhmuah cu Pathian ta an si ṭheh. Amah cu a hleice ih sunloihmi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu a mak ngaingai ih Nasa zetih thangṭhat ding a si. Kan Pathian ih khawpi ah, A tlang thianghlim parah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ih tlang, Zion tlang cu A saang ih a mawi zet fawn. Siangpahrang khawpi cu leilung pumpuluk ih lungawinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in cuih khawpi sung, A umnak ralhruang sungah cun, Himnak a um tiah a langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl hmunkhat ah an tongkhawm aw, Zion Tlang do dingah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain Zion Tlang an hmuh tikah an mang a bang; An ṭih ih an tlan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭihnak le phannak in an khat, Nau hring zik nunau bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in Tarshish lawng tumpi Nisuahlam thlisia hmang in a siatter ṭheh hai bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa kan Pathian in a khawpi sungah, thil a tuahmi pawl kan thei zo; Atu-ah kan mit in kan hmu lala. Amah in a khawpi cu kumkhua in a humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na Biakinn sungah a hmunmi na duhdawtnak hi kan ruat ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah cu leilung khawzakip mi in an lo cawimawi ih, Na hmin cu leilung pumpi ah a thang. Dingnak thawn ramkip na uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion ih minung pawl an lungawi ko seh. Na ṭhuthennak cu a dik a si. Judah khawpi pawl sungah lungawinak um ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion tlang kimvel in feh uhla zohhnik uh. Ralvennak inn donhleisang pawl cu siarhnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A phar pawl cu zoh ṭha uhla A ralhruang pawl cu hniksak uh; San thar mino pawl hnenih nan sim dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hi Pathian cu kumkhua in kumkhua tiang kan Pathian a si. Sanikhuk amah in in hruai ding.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in thei uh! Khawzakip ih a um minung pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Upa nauta le milian farah in Ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ṭongmi cu fimnak ṭongkam a si. Ka ruahnak cu sullam neimi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phungthluk thu ka ruat ding ih Tingrisit tum phah in a tican ka fianter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in in kulh ih ṭihnak can hmanah, Ka thin a phang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thilri a rinsantu pawl le an lennak a porh ciamco pawl in in kulh hmanah zianghman ka ṭih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zohman in amah ih nunnak cu a tlen thei lo ding. A nunnak ih man cu Pathian a pe thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangahtile a nunnak ih man cu a khungtuk ih, Thihnak ihsin humhimnak ngah ding le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumkhua nunnak ngah ding ih a pek theimi man hman in a daih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zokhal in mifim pawl an thi ih Mi aa le mi-hmuk pawl tla an thi thotho ti an hmu. An zatein an thilri cu an tefa an roh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An thlaan cu kumkhua in an inn a si. Cutawkah kumkhua in an um; Hlan ah leiram an rak nei naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minung cu a lennak in thihnak ihsin a hum thei lo ding. Ramsa vekin an hloral ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mah le mah a rinsan awzet pawl khi, Ziang an cang ti zohhnik uh! An lennak ih diriam pawl vanduai zia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuu bangin a thi ding lawng an si, Thih cu anmah khaaltu a si ding. Miding pawl cu anmah nehtu an si ding, Thihnak khua ah an ruangpi a thut ih, An inn ihsin lam hlapi ih an um tik ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in kei cu i hum ding; Thihnak huham sung ihsin i runsuak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat a len vivo tikah le, A lennak cu a karh sinsin tikah na lung sia hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thih tikah zianghman a keng thei lo ding; A lennak in thlaan ah a thlun lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat leilung tlun a nunnak ah hin lungdaihnak a ngah ih a hlawhtlin ruangih an porhzet hman ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thihnak a ton tikah cun kumkhua ih khawthimnak hmunah A pu le a pa pawl a vun thlun thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Minung cu a sunlawinak in thihnak ihsin a hum thei lo ding. Ramsa vekin a hloral ve ko ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian Bawipa cu a ṭong; Nisuahnak ihsin nitlaknak tiang, leilung pumpi cu a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian cu Zion ihsin ni bangin a tlang; Mawinak famkim a neitu Zion khawpi cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu a ra, a sinan daiteón a ra lo. A hmailam ah mei a alh hluahhlo ding ih, A kimvel ah nasa zetin thlipi a huuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A minung pawl thu a ṭhen tikah theihpitu ah lei le van a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thawinak pek tahratin keimah thawn thukamnak a tuahtu ka mithiang pawl cu ka hnenah rak kokhawm hai uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van pawl cun Pathian cu a ding, Amah cu thuṭhentu a si, tiah an aupi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Maw ka minung pawl, ngai uh, ka ṭong ding. Maw Israel, fiangtein ka lo theiter ding. Keimah hi Pathian, nan Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnenih nan pek ringring mi thawinak le mei-urthawinak pawl ruangah ka lo kawk hai a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan inn ihsin nan rak kenmi nan cawcang ka ṭul lo; Nan ṭilva rual lakih nan me pawl khal ka ṭul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile hramlak ih ramsa hmuahhmuah ka ta an si ih, Siarcawk lo tlangpar ih ṭilva pawl khal ka ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vate hmuahhmuah le hramlak ih a nungmi hmuahhmuah khal ka ta an si ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka rilrawng hman sehla nannih ka lo sim hai lo ding; Ziangahtile leilung pumpi le a sung ummi hmuahhmuah hi ka ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cawcang sa ka ei mawsi? Me thii ka in mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan lungawinak hi Pathian hnen ih nan pekmi thawinak si sawnseh. Cule pek ding tiih nan kam ciami hmuahhmuah cu Ziangkimtithei hnenah pe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harsatnak a thlen tikah keimah i ko uhla ka lo run hai ding ih, Nannih in in thangṭhat ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo hnenah Pathian in, “Ka thupekmi cu ziangah so nan saal duh rero? Ka thukam cu ziangah so nan rel duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan ziaza rem ding cu nan duh lo ih ka thupekmi pawl cu nan dungtun ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fifir nan hmuh tikah a rualpi ah nan cang; ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuahtu pawl thawn nan kom aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ṭong ṭha lo ṭong ding ahcun nan zamrang zet. Thuphan sim ding ahcun nan ṭhukṭhun dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nan unau pawl ih ṭhat lonak hawl le sualpuh ding ahcun tiar cia in nan um ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi tluk thil ṭha lo nan tuah naón kei cun zianghman ka ṭong dah lo. Curuangah keimah tla hi nanmah tlukfangah in ruat. Asinain atu cu nun ka lo sim ding, Fiangtein ka lo sim hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zianghman ah i siar lotu pawl, Hi thu hi ṭhatein ngai uh; Culole ka lo siatsuah thluh hai ding. Zohman runtu nan nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnenih lungawinak nan langtermi hi keimah in upat nan raithawinak a si. Ka thu a thluntu hmuahhmuah cu Ka run hrimhrim ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, a hmunmi na duhdawtnak ruangah, Kei hi i zaangfah hram aw. Na zaangfahnak a tum ruangah Ka sualnak cu hnawtfai thluh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭhat lonak cu kholhfai thluh awla, Ka sualnak ihsin i thiangter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tuah sualmi cu ka thei ih, Ka sualnak cu ka ciing ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na parah, na par hrimhrim ah, ka sual; Na mithmuh ah thil ṭha lo ka tuah zo. Curuangah thuṭhennak i pekmi cu a dikmi a si; Mimawh ih i ret khal a dikmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka suahthlak in mi ṭha lo ka si, Ka nu ih pum sung ihsin misual ka si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thutak le thinlung tak cu na duhmi an si. Ka thinlung cu na fimnak in khatter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sualnak hi hyssop thawn fai tein i hlonsak awla mi thiangah ka cang ding. I kholh awla vur hnakin ka vaar sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinnomnak le lungawinak awkam i theiter hram aw. Cutin na siatsuah ciami ka taksa cu thinnuam le hnangam in a um sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka sualnak zoh duh hlah awla, Ka ṭhat lonak kha i hnawtfai sak thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, thinlung thiang ka sungah seemter aw. Ka sungah a thar le a dikmi lungput run ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na umnak ihsin i dawi hram hlah awla, Na thlarau thianghlim cu ka hnen ihsin la hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na runnak ihsin a rami thinnomnak cu i pe sal awla, Ka thlarau cu na thu ngaitu siter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutin misual hnenah na thupek mi cu ka zirh ding ih, Na hnenah an ra kir saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Pathian, i Runtu, ka nunnak cu zuah hram awla, Na dingnak cu lungawi zetin ka aupi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka hmur run ong awla, Ka kaa in na thangṭhatnak ka phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thawinak pekmi cu na duhmi a si lo. Na duh sisehla ka lo pe zo ding. Mei-ur thawinak khal na lungawi mi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka lo pekmi thawinak cu, A kekkuaimi thinlung a si. A kekkuaimi le sualsir thinlung cu na hnong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Pathian, Zion parah zaang- fahnak nei awla bawm hram aw. Jerusalem khua kulhnak pawl cu dawl sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutin thawinak pawl le mei-ur thawinak pawl parah, Na lung a awi ding ih Na biakṭheng parah cawcang pawl cu thawinakah pek an si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw micak pa, ziangah so thil sual na tuahmi cu tluang na khawnpi rero? Pathian ih rintlak sinak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang cun midang siatsuah ding na ngaihtuah; Na lei cu lumehnak namte vekin a hriam. Cat loin thuphan na per ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ṭhami hnakin a siami na duh sawn ih, Thudik hnakin thudik lo na tlaihsan sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw thuphanper pa, na ṭongkam in midang thinlung natter khi nuam na ti zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian in a lo siatsuah ding, kumkhua in; A lo kaihrem dingih na puanthlam ihsin a lo phih suak ding. Minung umnak ram ihsin a lo hlon ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cumi cu midang pawl in an hmuh tikah an ṭih ding. An lo hnihsan ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zohhnik uh, humhimnak duh ah Pathian rinsan loin amah ih lennak sawn a rinsantu, Lung hnangamnak cu ṭhat lonak in a hawltu pa hinah a um,” tiah an lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cu Pathian inn kiangih a kho mi, Olif thingkung bangtuk ka si. A hmunmi a duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in ka rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na thil tuah cia mi ruangah, Ka lo lawm ringring ding. Na minung pawl ih tonkhawmnak hmun ah na ṭhat zia cu ka aupi ringring ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi aa pawl cun an thinlung tein, “Pathian a um lo,” an ti. Minung hi ziangtlukinso an siat? Tuksumza thil tampi an tuah! Thil ṭha tuahtu pakhatte hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minung lakah fimnak a neitu le Pathian a betu pakhat tal an um maw tiah Pathian in vancung ihsin a run zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain an zate in an pial ṭheh! An nunzia tiangin a borhbah ṭheh a si. Zohman thilṭha tuahtu an um lo. Pakhatte hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hi mi ṭha lo pawl hi, Theihthiamnak zianghman a nei lo mi maw an si? Minung in saang an ei vekin, Ka minung pawl an ei ṭheh a si. Ka hnenah thla an cam fawn lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih cu ṭihphang in an um ding. An neih dah keel lomi ṭihphannak an nei ding. Ziangahtile Pathian in nan ral pawl ih ruh cu a ṭhekdarh thluh. An tumtahmi hmuahhmuah a cemter ṭheh, Ziangahtile annih cu a hnonmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion ihsin Israel hnenah runnak ra sehla ka va duh so! Pathian in a minung pawl a ṭhansoter saal tikah, Jakob ih tesinfa pawl an lung a awi ding ih, Israel mi pawl an ai a puang zet ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na huham in i run awla, Na cahnak in i luatter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thlacamnak ngai awla, Ka ṭongkam i theihsak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl keimah do dingah an ra ih, Mi zaangfah nei lo pawl keimah that dingah an ra. Pathian zianghman ih a siar lo minung pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian cu i bawmtu a si ih Bawipa cu ka nunnak a cawmdawltu a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in ka ral pawl cu anmah ih ṭhat lonak in hrem seh. Rinsan tlak a si ruangah ka ral pawl cu a siatsuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , lungawi zetin na hnenah thawinak ka pe ding. Lungawi in ka lo thangṭhat ding. Ziangahtile nang cu na ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka harsatnak hmuahhmuah sungin i luatter zo ih, Ka ral pawl an sun kha ka mit in ka hmu zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thlacamnak hi thei hram awla, Ka lo ngennak hi dungtun hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I ngai awla i sawn hram aw. Ka donhar ruangah ka baang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ih in hro ruangah le Mi ṭha lo pawl ih in hmuhsuam ruangah ka bei a dong. Harsatnak ka parah an thlenter. Ka parah an thin a heng ih in hua fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭihnak in ka thinlung cu a khat ih, Thih ṭihnak in i delh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭihphannak le khurhnakin i kai, Tuksum in ka ṭhia thlohthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw, thuro bangin thla nei ningla ka va duh so! Ka zam hlo ding ih colhnak ka ngah ding naón.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlapi ah ka zam ding ih nelrawn ah umnak inn ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlisia ruahpi tuar lo dingah Zamrangte in beunak ka hawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka ral pawl an lung aa ter awla, An ṭong hnokhnaiter thluh aw. Ziangahtile khawpi sungah sual nak le tawh awknak lawng ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sun a zan in khawpi kulhnak phar par ihsin khawpi cu an vel, Khawpi cu buainak le tuahmawhnak lawngin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmunkip ah siatsuahnak lawng lawng a um ih, Khawsung lamzin tla cu huatsuah le bum awknak lawngin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I zawmtaitu cu ka ral si sehla Ka tuar thei paam ding. I hmuhsuamtu cu i ngaih lotu si sehla ka relhsan mai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu ka ral cu nangmah ka theih mi, Ka hnaṭuanpi le ka rualpi na rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nuam zetin thu kan ruah aw ih Biakinnpi ah misenpi thawn kan feh tlang ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rin lopi ah thihnak cu ka ral pawl parah thleng seh; Mithi khua Sheol ah an nungcung in feh hai seh. An innsang sung le an thinlung sungah ṭhat lonak hlir khatseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bomnak dil in Bawipa Pathian ka ko. Amah in i run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka phunzainak le ka aihramnak cu a hnenah, Zing, sun le zan ah a thleng ih Ka aw cu a thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ral tampi ka donak hmun ihsin Him damteón i kirpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumkhua in uktu bawi a si ringringtu Pathian in, Ka aunak a thei ding ih ka ral pawl cu a neh ding. Annih cun zianghman an tuah thei lo ding. Ziangahtile Amah ṭihzahnak zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hlanih ka rualpi in a rualpi pawl a do. A thukam ciami cu a balsiat ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kaa cu sahriak hnakin a naal sawn; Asinain a thinlung sungah huatnak a khat. A ṭongkam cu siti hnakin a neem sawn; Asinain ralnam vekin mi a aat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nan thilrit cu Bawipa hnenah ṭhum uhla, Nan tha a lo damter ding. Miding cu ziangtik hmanah a rilsawnter dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Pathian, nang cun mi thattu pawl le Thuphanpertu pawl cu an san kauseu hlanah khur thukpi sungah na thlak hai ding. Asinain kei cun nangmah lawng ka lo rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, zaangfahnak ka parah nei hram aw; Ka ral pawl in in do ih cat loin in hrem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun nihlawh in ka ral pawl in in do. Keimah dotu hi an tam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭihphannak ka neih tikah, Maw Ziangkimtithei Bawipa , Nangmah ka lo rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ka ring ih a thukamnak ka thangṭhat. Amah ka rinsan ih zianghman ka ṭih lo ding. Mihring cun ka parah ziangso an tuah thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in sun nihlawh harsatnak in pe. Keimah tuahmawh ding lawng a phunphun in an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah thah duh ah an relhnak hmunah an tongkhawm aw ih, Ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah in zoh thup ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ṭhat lonak ruangah, maw Pathian, hrem hai aw. Na thinheng in hlonhlo thluh hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangtluk in ka thin a baang ti cu na thei. Ka mitthli cu na palang sungah na khum zo. Na cabu sungah na ngan zo a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmah ka lo kawh ni ihsin Ka ral pawl dungah an siip ding. Hi thil pakhat ka thei: Pathian cu keimah lam ah a ṭang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian cu ka rinsan ih a thukamnak ka thangṭhat. Bawipa ih thukamnak cu ka thangṭhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah cu ka rinsan ih zianghman ka ṭih lo ding. Mihring cun ka parah ziangso an tuah thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka lo tiamkam ciami cu ka lo pe ding. Nangmah cawimawinak cu ka raithawinak ai-ah ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangahtile thihnak ihsin i luatter ih, Rilhbahnak ihsin i hum zo a si. Curuangah Pathian nangmah ih mithmuh ah ka feh, Nunnak lamzin tleu ah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I zaangfah hram aw; Maw Pathian, i zaangfah hram aw; Na hnenah himnak duh ah ka ra. Ṭihphannak a cem thluh hlan lo, Na thladem thuaiah humhimnak ka ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ka ko, Cungnungbik cu! Ka ṭulmi hmuahhmuah i petu Pathian cu ka ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van ihsin i run awi ding ih i run ding; I palcih rerotu cu ningzak koin a tuah hai ding. Pathian in a hmunmi a duhdawtnak le rintlak a sinak cu ka hnenah a langter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kiosa lakah ka it, Mi ei-tu kiosa lakah; An ha cu feipi le conkiang vek an si ih, an lei cu ralnam hriam bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na maksak zia cu vanah khin langter awla, Na sunlawinak khal leilung tlun hmuahhmuah ah langter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah kaih duh ah ka ral pawl in suurthang in kam. Mangbang vansaangin ka lu ka kun. Ka fehnak lamzin ah khur an lai. Asinain anmah riangri an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thinlung cu a hnget ko, Maw Pathian, ka thinlung cu a hnget a si. Hla ka sak ding ih ka lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw ka thlarau, ṭhang thlang aw. Ka ṭingṭang le ka lemlawi pawl, tho thlang uh. Ni khal ka ṭhang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , miphun tampi lakah ka lo lawm ding! Minung tampi lakah ka lo cawimawi ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu vancung a thleng; Rintlak na sinak in van a dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na maksak zia cu van ah khin langter awla, Na sunlawinak cu leilung pumpuluk ah langter aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw uktu pawl, dik zetin thu hi nan ṭhen ngaingai maw? Mi hmuahhmuah diktein an thu nan ṭhen sak ngaingai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asilo! Thil ṭha lo tuah nan tummi lawnglawng nan ruat ih, Hi ram sung thisen a luangtertu cu nanmah nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an nu ih pum sung ihsin an ṭha lo cia; An suahthlak in an pial ih thuphan an per a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rul vekin tur an nei ih an tur cu thihsii a si. Thu theih duh lo ah an hna an phit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rul ai nei ih aw siseh, mitkher thiam ih aw siseh, A thei thei nawn lotu rulngan hnaset bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Pathian, an ha pawl khiak ṭheh aw; Maw Bawipa , hi ṭihnungza kiosa pawl ih ho cu thlong ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dokmi tidai bangin cem ṭheh hai sehla, Lamzin ih palbeek mi hrampi bangin vuai ṭheh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kharkhem a feh phah ah a hnang ih a cemral bangin si hai seh. A thi cia in a suakmi naute Khawtleu a hmuh dah lo vekin si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih thu an theih hlanah hram bur bangin tan ṭheh an si. Pathian thinhengnak in an nun lai rori ah thlisia bangin a semhlo thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miding pawl in misual pawl hremnak an tuar kha an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ding. Mi ṭha lo pawl ih thisen ah an ke an kholh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah mi in, “Miding pawl in laksawng an ngah ngaingai, Leilung pumpi thuṭhentu Pathian a um ngaingai a sihi!” an ti ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka ral pawl ih kut sungin i run hram aw. Keimah i dotu pawl ihsin i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi mi ṭha lo pawl kut ihsin i hum awla, Hi mi thattu pawl kut ihsin i luatter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zohhnik! Keimah do dingah in bawh. Zaangfah nei lo pawl cu keimah do dingah an tiar aw cia. Sualnak le mawhnak ka neih ruangah a si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka sualnak zianghman a um lo naón, Hi bangtuk in an umnak hmun ciar ah an tiar aw cia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Ziangkimtithei Pathian, tho awla i ra bawm aw. Israel ih Pathian, nangmahte in zoh ve hnik aw! Ṭhang awla hi pawl hi hrem hai aw. Hi mi ṭha lo mi zuarthlai pawl parah cun Zianghman zaangfahnak nei hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zanlam ah an ra sal, Khawpi sung sukso ah an vak ih, Uico bangin an hngirhngir phahphah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ṭongmi hi ngaihnik aw! An lei cu an ka sungah ralnam vek a si. Asinain annih in, “Zoso in thei ding?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , nang cun na hnihsan hai. Cubangtuk miphun cu hnihsuahsainak ah na hmang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw i ṭantu, na thazaang a si ka rinsan; Maw Pathian, nangmah cu ka beunak lungpi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I duhdawtu ka Pathian cu ka hnenah a ra ding. Ka ral pawl an sung cu amah in i hmuhter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Pathian, that ṭheh hlah aw, Ka minung pawl in an hngilh thluh pang ding. Na cahnak in ṭhekdarh thluh hai awla neh thluh hai aw. In humtu kan Bawipa!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hmur ah sualnak a um; An ṭongkam cu sual ṭongkam a si. An puarthaunak ahcun awk-aw hai seh. Mi an cam ih thuphan an per ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thinheng in siatsuah hai aw; Pakhat hman zuah lo in siatsuah thluh hai aw. Cule mi hmuahhmuah in, Israel ram cu Pathian in a uk ih A uknak cu leilung khuazakip ah a thleng ṭheh, ti an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu zanlam ah an ra kir sal, Uico vekin hngirhngir phah in khawpi sungah an vak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uico rawl hawl bangin an tawi an vak ih, Ei khop an ngah lo tikah an kio an ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na cahnak cu hla in ka sa ding. Zingtinte a hmunmi na duhdawtnak thu cu ring zetin ka sa ding. Nang cu ka beunak lungpi na si, Ka harsat caanah ka dornak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw i ṭantu, nangmah ka lo thangṭhat ding. Ka beunak cu Pathian a si; I duhdawtu Pathian cu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kannih cu in hnong zo ih in tisiat zo. Kan parah na thin a heng zo; Asinain kan lam hoikir saal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan ram hmuahhmuah na hnin thluh ih na saat kuai ṭheh zo. A hma cu damter saal aw, Ziangahtile a tla kuai thluh pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na minung pawl cu harsatnak tamzet na tuarter zo. In ritertu sabit in pe ih kan sawn kan ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah a lo ṭihzahtu pawl hrangah thantaar na thlai sak. An ral pawl kut sung ihsin an luat theinak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na cahnak in in run aw. Na duhdawtmi na minung an luat theinak dingah Kan thlacamnak in let hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hmunthiang sung ihsin Pathian in “Lungawi zetin Shekhem cu ka ṭhen ding; Sukkoth phairawn cu ka miphun hnenah ka zem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead ram cu ka ta a si, Manasseh khal ka ta a si. Efraim cu ka lukhuh a si; Judah cu ka bawi kianghrol a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Moab ram cu ka kut kholhnak kheng ah ka hmang ding; Edom ramah ka kedam ka hlon ding, Ka ta a si ti theihnak ah. Filistin ram parah neh-nak aw thawn ka au ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ralhruang kulhmi khawpi ah zoso i feh pi ding? Edom ah zoso i hruai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In thlauthla ngaingai mawsi? Kan ralkap pawl thawn na feh ve lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan ral in do bawm aw. Ziangahtile milai bomnak cu a lak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan hnenih Pathian a ṭan ahcun kan neh ding; Kan ral pawl a neh ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka aunak ngai hram awla, Ka thlacamnak i theihsak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thin a pih ruangah vanhram deng ihsin nangmah ka lo ko. Keimah hnakih a saangmi himnak lungpi ah i khor hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile nang cu ka beunak lungpi na si; A khoh zetmi ka ṭannak ralhruang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nundam sung hmuahhmuah, Na puanthlam sungah i umter aw. Na thla hnuai ah himnak i coter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thutiam pawl na thei zo ih, Nangmah a lo ṭihzahtu pawl ih ro cu i coter ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih nunkhua sauter hram aw. Kum tampi nung vivo hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na hmaika ah kum reipi uktu si hram seh. A hmunmi duhdawtnak le rintlak na sinak in hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuticun ka thutiammi nitinte kimter phah in, Na hmin thangṭhatnak cat loin hla in ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian amah lawng ka nunnak in daitein a hngak; Ka rundamnak cu amah hnen ihsin a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah lawng hi ka lungpi le i runtu a si. I ṭantu cu amah a si ruangah zohman in in neh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nannih pawl in ziangtik tiangso, Phar bang a sawn zomi le, Hauhruang vekih a tlu zik zomi, Mi pakhat cu nan do hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upat a conak hmun ihsin dirh thlak lawng hi nan duhmi a si. Thuphan rel hi nuam nan ti zet. Nan hmurka cun thlawsuahnak ṭongkam a suak naón, Nan thinlung ngaingai cun nan camriam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian amah lawng ka nunnak in daitein a hngak; Ka ruahsannak cu a hnen lawngah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah lawng hi ka lungpi le i runtu a si. I ṭantu amah a si ruangah zohman in in neh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka rundamnak le ka sunlawinak cu Pathian hnenah a um; Amah cu a cak zetmi i humtu a si ih, Ka beunak lungpi khal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misenpi pawl, ziangtik khal ah Pathian rinsan ringring uh. Amah cu kan beunak lungpi a si, Nan harnak hmuahhmuah a hnenah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minung cu thawthawt khat vek fang an si; Mitum mite, zianghman an si lo. Cuai ah khai awla zianghman an si zik lo. Thaw hnakin an zaang deuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thazaang ih mi nehnak rinsan hlah; Ruk ru in ziang khal ngah ding tumtah hlah; Cuti tuah in na len sinsin khal le cupawl cu rinsan duh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Voikhat hnakih tam Pathian ih ṭong ka thei zo: Huham hmuahhmuah cu amah ih ta a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mi duhdawtnak cu a thleng aw dah lo. Maw Bawipa , mi hmuahhmuah cu an ṭuan vekin, An ṭuanman cu nangmah in na pe a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nang cu ka Pathian na si ih nangmah ka lo ngai. Ka nunnak pumpi in nangmah a lo ngai a si. Leiro, leicaar le tidai um lonak leilung in tidai a haal vekin, Ka nunnak in nangmah a lo haal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim ah nangmah ka lo tong ih, Na cahzia le na sunlawi zia ka hmu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu Nunnak hnakin a sunglawi sawn; Curuangah ka lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nundam sung hmuahhmuah ah Na hnenih lungawi thusim ka daiter lo ding. Ka kut thlir in na hnenah thla ka cam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi rawl thaw ei bangin a tlai zet a si. Nangmah thangṭhatnak hla lungawi in ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ihkhun tlun ih ka zau tikah nangmah ka lo thei; Zanvar nangmah lawng ka lo ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangahtile nang cu i bawmtu na si ringring; Na thladem hnuai ah lungawi in hla ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nunnak in nangmah a lo pawk, Na vorhlam kut in i himter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah thah i tumtu pawl cu Mithi khua ah an vung thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Raldonak ah ralnam in an thi ding ih, An ruak cu cinghnia in an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian nangmah ruangah siangpahrang a lung a awi ding. Pathian hmin in thukamnak a tuahtu pawl an lung a awi ding. Asinain thuphan reltu pawl ih kaa cu phih an si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, harsatnak ka tong; Ka thlacamnak ngai hram aw. Ṭihnungza ka ral pawl kut ihsin i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih phiarthupnak in i hum awla, Misual burpi lakin i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei cu ralnam hriam bangin an taat ih, An ṭong siava cu conkiang bih in an bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi an bawhnak ihsin an conkiang in mi ṭha pawl an sai; Rinlopi ah an sai; Phanmi zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thu ṭha lo tawlrelnak ah pakhat le pakhat an forh aw. An thangkammi ṭhate ih thup ding lawng an ruat. “Zohman in hmu lo ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo an ngaihtuah ih, “Mi siatsuah dingah fel zetin kan tawlrel zo,” an ti. Minung ih thin le lung hi mangbangza a va si so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Pathian cun a conkiang in a sai hai ding ih, Rinlopi ah hma an pu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ṭongkam a siat ruangah a siatsuah hai ding, Anmah a hmutu hmuahhmuah in tuksum in an lu an thing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An zate in ṭihphang in an um ding; Pathian ih thiltuahmi cu an sim ding ih, A hnaṭuanmi pawl an ruat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa ih thiltuahmi ruangah Miding pawl an lung a awi ding. A hnenah himnak an tong ding. Mi ṭha pawl hmuahhmuah in amah cu an thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, Zion ah kan lo thangṭhat ding ih, Kan thukammi cu kan kimter ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi thlacam na theihsak ruangah. An sualnak a tam ruangah khuazakip in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tampi na hnenah an ra ding. Kan sualnak in in neh ṭheu naón, Nangmah in in tlengfai sak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah ih na hrilmi pawl cu mi lungawi an si; Na hmun thianghlim ih na umter mi tla mi lungawi an si. Na innih thil ṭha le na Biakinn thianghlim ih thlawsuahnak in kan hna in ngamter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil mangbang maksak tuah tahrat in in run let ih in run. Leilung khuazakip le tipi ral ih minung khal in nang an lo rinsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na cahnak in tlang pawl cu na toh ih, Cuticun na huham na langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tifinriat awn thawm le tisuar thawmvang pawl na daihter ih, Mi tampi ih awn-au thawm khal Nangmah in na daiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil maksak pawl na tuah ruangah, Leilung pumpi in an lo ṭih. Na thil tuahmi ruangah lungawi au-nak thawm cu, Leilung khatlam dengin khatlam deng tiang a khawk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leiram na duh ruangah ruah na surter, Leiram ṭha le leiram thlum-al ah na tuah. Na tuahmi tiva pawl cu an caar dah lo ih, Lei parah lo rawl an ṭoter. Cutluk fel in thil na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leileh mi ah ruah tampi na surter ih tidai in na ciarter. Leilung cu ruahti in na nemter, Cule thlaikho pawl na ṭhanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ṭhatnak in ziangtluk rawl tam so a suahter! Na fehnak kipah ziang hmuahhmuah duhzat in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hramhring lakah cun ṭilva an khat; Tlangtluan pawl cu lungawinak in an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leenkolh hmuahhmuah cu tuurual in an khat ih, Phairawn pawl cu sangvut in a khat thluh. Lungawi in an au ih hmunkhat ah hla an sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitlun mipawl, Pathian thangṭhat in lungawi in au uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah hmin sunloihnak hla sa uh. Sunglawi zetin a hnenah cawimawinak pe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian hnenah, “Na thil tuahmi pawl hi mangbangza an si, Na huham a nasa tukih na ral pawl hman ṭihnak in na hmaiah an bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung mi hmuahhmuah in na hmaiah kuun in an lo biak; Na thangṭhatnak hla an sak. Na hmin cawimawinak hla an sa,” tiah ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ih tuahmi hi ra zohhnik uh! Minung lakih a tuahmi mangbangza hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tifinriat cu leilung ro ah a canter; Kan pu kan pa pawl in tivapi cu an ke in an tan; Cutiih a tuah ruangah a parah kan lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A cahnak in a uk kumkhua ih Miphun kip a mit in a zoh ringring. Ziangvek ral hman amah dodal in tho hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah pawl, kan Pathian thangṭhat uh. Nan thangṭhatnak cu thang ṭheh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah in in nundamter zo ih In bahter sianglo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in hniksak zo; Ngun cu somei ih an hniksak bangin, Kannih khal in hniksak zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thang an kammi sungah in tlakter ih, Kan zaang parah thilrit ngaingai na suang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan ral pawl ih palcih mi ah in tuah ih, Meisa le tilian lakin kan feh. Asinain atu cu himnak hmun ah in thlenpi zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na inn ah mei-ur thawinak pawl ka rak keng ding; Ka lo kam ciami cu ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Harsatnak ka ton laiih ka thukammi cu ka kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakṭheng parih ur dingah tuu ka lo pe ding; Mecang urnak rimthaw khal a um ding; Cawcang le mecang pawl thawinak ah ka pe ding; A meikhu cu vanah a kai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian a upattu pawl, ra uhla ngai uh; Ka hrangih a thil tuahmi pawl ka lo sim hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hnenah bomnak dil in ka au. Hla in ka thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka sualnak hi zianghman poisa loin um ningla, Bawipa in ka thlacamnak a ngai lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain Pathian in i thei zo; Ka thlacamnak a ngai zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak a hnong lo ih A hmunmi a duhdawtnak khal ka hnen ihsin a lakkir lo ruangah Pathian cu ka thangṭhat a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in zaangfah awla in thlawsuah hram aw; Zaangfah thinpemnak thawn in run zoh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuticun leilung pumpi in na duhnak an thei ding ih, Mi phunkip in nangmah ih runnak thu an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Pathian, minung in lo thangṭhat hai seh; Mi hmuahhmuah in nangmah lo thangṭhat cio hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minung pawl dingthluk lairelnak thawn an thu na ṭhensak ih, Miphun hmuahhmuah na hruai hai ruangah lungawi in hla sa hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, minung in lo thangṭhat hai seh; Mi hmuahhmuah in nangmah lo thangṭhat cio hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leiram in rawl a suah zo; Pathian, kan Pathian in in thlawsuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in mal in sawm zo. Amah cu vanrang tangmi hmuahhmuah in upat hai seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian tho sehla a ral pawl ṭhekdarh seh; Amah a huatu pawl cu tlanhlo thluh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu cu thli ih a semhlo bangin amah in a semhlo ding; Khuailul cu meisa hmai ih a zup thluh bangin, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu Pathian hmai ahcun siatral thluh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain miding pawl cu a mithmuh ah an lung a awi ding. An lung a awi ngaingai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian hnenah hla sak uh; Amah ih hmin thangṭhat uh; Mero parih a totu hrangah lamzin rak sial uh; Amah ih hmin cu Bawipa a si; A hmai ah nan lungawi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian, a Biakinn thianghlim sungih a umtu cun, Nu le pa nei lo farah zawn a ruatih nuhmei pawl a hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn nei lo lungleng vakvai pawl umnak innsang a pek ih, Thawngtla mi pawl kha lungawiza zalennak ah a hruai. Asinain raltho hmang pawl cu ramcaar lakah an taang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na minung pawl na hruaisuak tikah, Nelrawn tan ih na fehpi hai tikah khan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung a hnin durdo ih van in ruah a run burh; Sinai Pathian, Israel ih Pathian a thlen tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruah tampi na surter ih, Phuul ram cu na hnawngter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na minung pawl in cutawkah umhmun an khuar; Na ṭhat ruangah mi farah pawl tla na cawm hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in thu a pek ih Nunau tampi in thuthang cu an fehpi ih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Siangpahrang pawl le an ralkap pawl an tlanhlo a si,” an ti. Inn ih ummi nunau pawl in thilri lonmi an zem aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngun ih tuam mi thuro, An thla pawl sui bangin an tleu zohzo. (Ziangah so raldo laiah mi hrek khat tuuhruang sungih nan um men?)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian in Zalmon Tlang parah siangpahrang pawl a ṭhekdarh thluh hai tikah Cutawkah vur a tlakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bashan tlang, tlangbol tampi neitu tlang lian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangah so Pathian in amah umnak dingih a hrilmi tlang cu na tlangbol par ihsin nautatnak thawn na vun zoh? Bawipa cu a hrilmi tlang ah kumkhua in a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rangleeng mak zetzet, siar cawk lo thawng tampi thawn, Bawipa cu Sinai tlang ihsin hmun thianghlim ah a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa cu tlangzim ah a hung kai; A ral kaihmi tampi a fehpi. Ral thotu pawl hnenin laksawng tampi a ngah. Bawipa Pathian cu cunah a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat si ko seh. Amah in kan thilrit nitinte in a phur; Amah cu in runtu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu mi runtu Pathian a si; Amah cu Bawipa a si ih thihnak ihsin in runsuaktu kan Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in a ral pawl le, Sualnak lamzin a thlun ringring tu pawl ih lu cu a khuai thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Nan ral pawl cu Bashan ihsin ka rak hruai ding ih, Tipithuanthum tawne ihsin ka hun suahpi hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuticun nan ke cu an thisen ah nan kholh ding ih, Nan uico khal in an duhzat in an liak ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na feh lai cu mi hmuahhmuah in an hmu; Ka Pathian le ka siangpahrang, a hmunthiang ih feh lai cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmaisabik ah hla satu pawl an feh; Dunglam ah awnmawi tumtu pawl an feh; An karlakah khuangte tumtu fala pawl an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Pathian cu a minung pawl tonkhawmnak ah thangṭhat uh; Bawipa cu Israel tesinfa pawl hmuahhmuah in thangṭhat uh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hmaisabik ah an hrin lakih fa nauta bik Benjamin mi an ra; Cumi saangtu ah Judah hotu pawl, Anmah ih ho ciar thawn an ra. Cule Zebulun le Naftali hotu pawl in an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na huham run langter aw; Kanmah hrangih na hmanmi na huham cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl in laksawng an lo peknak, Jerusalem khua na Biakinnpi ihsin run langter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Phaikung lakih a ummi ramsa vek a si mi Izipt kha kawk awla, Caw note pawl thawn a tlangmi Cawcang rual vek a si mi miphun pawl cu kawk hai aw; Na hmaiah an kun ih an ngun pawl an lo pek hlanlo nun zirh hai aw. Raldo lawnglawng a duhtu pawl cu ṭhekdarh thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin thlahmi rampalai pawl an ra ding; Ethiopia mi pawl cun Pathian hnenah ban phar in thlacam an cam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Maw leilung tlun ram pawl, Pathian hnenah hla sak uh; Bawipa hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sak uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumkhua ih a hmunmi van, Cuih van pawl a totu hnen ahcun! Amah ih aw, nasa zetih a aunak aw cu ngai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ih huham thangter uh. A makmi a sunlawinak cu Israel parah a um. A cahnak cu vandum ah khin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A hmunthiang sungah Pathian cu Ziangtluk maktara so a si! Israel ih Pathian cu! Amah ih minung hnenah cahnak le huham a pek. Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian i run hram aw. Tidai ka hngawng a tiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cerhduuppi sungah ka pil, Leilung hak zianghman a um lo. Ti thukpi sungah ka um ih Tisuar in i khuh zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bomnak dil in ka lo kawh-nakah ka tha a cem; Ka dang tla a caar ṭheh; Nangmah ih bomnak hngak in ka zoh-nakah ka mit a kham thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangthu hman um loih i huatu pawl cu ka lu par sam hnakin an tam sawn; Thuphanper tahratih ka ral ih a cangtu pawl cu, Mi cak zetzet an si ih a thah lawnglawng in duh. Ka ruk lomi thil pawl tla khirh thluh seh, in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka sualnak pawl cu Na hmai ihsin thuh theih a si lo. Ka aatzia cu nangmah in na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa Pathian Cungnungbik, Nangmah a lo rinsantu pawl cu Keimah ih ruangah ningzak in um hlah hai seh. Maw Israel ih Pathian, Nangmah a lo biatu pawl cu, Keimah ih ruangah mualphonak thleng hram hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah ih ruangah hmuhsuamnak ka tong ih, Ningzahnak tam ngaipi ka tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unau hnenah mikhual ka bang ih ka sungkhat hnenah mi phun dang ka bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na Biakinnpi ka tlaihsannak cu ka sungah meisa bangin a alh; Nangmah an lo hmuhsuamnak hmuahhmuah cu ka parah an tla ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rawl ul tahrat in mi tangdor in ka um; Asinain keimah nautatnak ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Riahsiatnak hnipuan hruk in ka nung; Asinain caponak ah in hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamzin ah keimai thu an rel ih, Zuri pawl in hla ah in phuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cun, Bawipa, na hnenah thla ka cam ding; Maw Pathian, na duhnak tikcu ah i let aw; Ziangahtile na duhdawtnak cu a tum ih, Mi run dingih na thukamnak cu na kimter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cerhduup sungih pilnak ihsin i run hram aw; Ka ral pawl ihsin i hum awla, Ti thuk sung ihsin i suah hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tilik cu ka parah thlengter hram hlah aw; A thukmi ih tawne ah i tlater hlah awla, Thlan thukpi sungah i pilter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i let hram aw; A hmunmi na duhdawtnak le na ṭhatnak thawn, Na lainatnak a nasat ruangah ka hnenah hoikir sal aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei na siahhlawh hnen ihsin relh hram hlah aw; Harsatnak tumpi ka tong, a tu ah i run let hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hnenah ra awla i hum aw; Ka ral pawl hnen in i runsuak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In nautat zia cu nangmah in na thei ṭheh ko; Ningzak le thangsia in in tuah zia cu na thei ih, Ka ral pawl hmuahhmuah khal nangmah in na hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In nautat tuk ruangah ka thinlung a kuai; Bawmtu zohman ka nei lo. Zaangfahnak ka beisei naón khui hmanah a um lo; Hnemtu ka hawl naón khui hmanah ka tong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ril a rawn tikah thihsii in pek, Ka ti a haal tikah sabit thur in pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An rawl daarmi pawl cu an tluknak ah cang seh; An puai pawl cu an rilhnak ah cang seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khua hmu thei lo dingin an mit cawtter aw. Tha nei loin thir thlohthlo hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thinhengnak cu an parah run burh awla, Na ai-thawhnak in run kaiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An riah hmun pawl cu taan in ṭhing reprep seh, An riahbuk sungah a nungmi zohman um hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na vuak thlak ciami pawl an hrem hai ih, Na hliam ciami pawl ih tuarnak thu an rel fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An sualnak pawl cu hminsin ṭheh awla, Na runnak sungah tel hrimhrim hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hmin pawl cu nunnak cabu sungin phiah sisehla, Na minung pawl ih cazin sungah telhcih sihlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain kei cu zonzai le natnak tuar in ka um; Maw Pathian, i cawisaang awla i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian cu hla in ka thangṭhat ding; Lungawinak a hnenah sim in A maksak zia cu ka tlang-aupi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cumi in Bawipa cu caw ka pekmi le, Cawcang thawinak hnakin a lung a awiter sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi tlasam pawl in cumi an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ding; Pathian a biatu pawl an tha a tho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa in mi tlasam pawl ih ṭulnak cu a thei; Thawng sungih a minung pawl a hngilh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maw lei le van, tipi le a sung ih ummi pawl, Pathian cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zion cu a hum ding ih, Judah khawpi pawl cu a din sal ding. A minung pawl cutawkah an um ding ih cuih ram an luah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A siahhlawh pawl ih tesinfa pawl in an co ding ih, A mah a duhdawtu pawl cutawkah an um ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, i run aw. Maw Bawipa , atu-ah i bawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thah i duhtu pawl cu ningzak le Thinlung hnokhnai in um hai seh. Harsatnak ka ton ruangih lungawitu pawl cu, Dung ah kirsal in mualpho in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnihsuahsainak ih i hmangtu pawl cu, An sun ruangah ningzak in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hnen ih a rami pawl cu Lungawi le nunnuam in um hai seh. Na rundamnak a duhtu pawl cun, “ Bawipa ih makzia cu!” ti ringring hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei cu mi derdai le mi farah ka si; Maw Pathian, zamrang in ka hnenah ra hram aw. Nangmah cu i bawmtu le i runtu na si. Maw Bawipa , rei nawn hlah aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah cu ka beunak na si; Ziangtik hmanah ningzak in i umter hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dingmi na si ruangah i bawm awla i hum aw. Na hna in i ngai awla i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka beunak lungpi si hram awla, I humtu ralhruang ṭha zet si hram aw; Nangmah cu ka lungpi le ka ralhruang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, mi ṭha lo pawl kut ihsin i hum aw; Zaangfah nei lo le mi siava pawl kut ihsi cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka beiseinak cu nangmah ah a um; Maw Bawipa , ka senlai ihsin nangmah ka lo rinsan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nunsung hmuahhmuah nangmah ka lo rinsan; Ka suah thlak ihsin nangmah in i hum zo; Ka lo thangṭhat ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tampi hrangah ka nunnak hi ralrinnak petu a si; Asinain nang cu a khoh zetmi ka ralhruang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun nihlawh nangmah ka lo thangṭhat ding ih, Na sunlawinak ka than ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tar-aw pat tiah i hnong hram hlah; Santlai lo a si-aw pat tiah i dungtun hram hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in a thah in duh; An relkhawm ih in phiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih in, “Pathian in a dungtun zo, Dawi uhsi la kai uhsi; A humtu ding zohman an um lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Pathian, lam hlapi ah i um san hram hlah aw; Maw ka Pathian, zamrang in atu-ah i bawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah i dotu pawl cu Ningzak in um hai sehla siatsuah ṭheh si hai seh. Tuahmawh i tumtu pawl cu Ningzak le mualpho in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka beiseinak cu na hnenah ka ret ringring ding. Nangmah cu ka lo thangṭhat sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na dingnak ka rel ding, Na rundamnak sun nihlawh ka sim ding; Ka theih cawk lomi an si naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa, na cahnak ka cawimawi ding. Na dingnak, nangmah ih dingnak lawng ka aupi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka nauhak lai ihsin nangmah in i zirh zo; Atu tiang na thil tuahmi mangbangza cu ka sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Pathian, a tar zo ih a ṭuak a par-aw, tiah I dungtun hram hlah aw. A ra dingmi santhar hnenih na huham le, Na cahnak ka aupi tikah ka hnen ah um hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na dingnak in van a dai; Thil mak zetzet na tuah zo; Nangmah bangtu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Harsatnak le zonzaihnak ka parah na thlenter; Asinain ka thazaang cu na kimter sal ding ih, Thlaan ihsin i runsuak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hlan hnakin i cawisaang ding Nangmah in i hneem sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka ṭingṭang thawn ka lo thangṭhat hrimhrim ding; Maw ka Pathian, na rintlaknak cu ka thangṭhat ding; Ka lemlawi tum phah in na hnenah hla ka sak ding; Maw nang, Israel mi ih Mi Thianghlim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na hrangih awnmawi ka tum phah ah lungawi in ka au ding; I run zo ruangah ka nunnak zatein hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keimah siatsuah i tumtu pawl, Ningzak le mualpho ih an um zo ruangah, Sun nihlawh in na dingnak thu ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, dingthluk lairel- nak thawn thuṭhentu a sinak dingah nangmah in siangpahrang cu zirh aw. Na dingfelnak coter ve awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuticun na minung pawl feltein Thu a ṭhen sak thei ding ih Dingnak thawn namsuk mi pawl a uk thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ram in nunnomnak co aw sehla Dingnak a sungah leeng hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang in mi farah pawl ih thu cu dikte in relseh. Mi tlasam pawl bawm sehla, Mi hmuhsuamtu pawl palcih seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na minung pawl in ni a tlan sung hmuahhmuah le, Thlapi a van sung hmuahhmuah, san mureng tiang, Nangmah lo bia ringring hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu hrampi parih a surmi ruah bangtuk sisehla, Leiram parih a tla mi ruahti bangtuk si hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nundam sung hmuahhmuah ah dingnak karhzai sehla, Thlapi a um sung hmuahhmuah ah daihnak um ringring hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ram ukmi cu tifinriat in tifinriat tiang; Eufrates Tivapi in leilung netnak tiang a kau ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nelrawn ih minung pawl a hmaiah an kun ding ih, A ral pawl cu leivut lakah an bok ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Spain ram siangpahrang pawl le Tikulh siangpahrang pawl in laksawng an pe ding. Arabia le Ethiopia siangpahrang pawl khal in siah an pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang hmuahhmuah in upatnak thawn, A hmai ah an kuun ding ih Miphun hmuahhmuah in an rian ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah a kotu mi farah pawl cu a run hai; Mi tlasam le thlauthlakmi pawl khal a hum hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi derdai le mi farah parah zaangfahnak a nei ih, An nunnak a hum hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmuhsuamnak le thisen luannak sungin a run; An nunnak cu a hrangah a sunglawi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu a nunkhua sau hram seh. Arabia ram ih sui a hnenah pek siseh. Cat loin a hrangah thlacamnak um ringring seh; Pathian ih malsawmnak a parah um ringring seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi ram sungah thlairawl tam ngaingai um seh; Tlang pawl cu lorawl in khat seh, Lebanon ih thingrah bangin an rah tamzet seh. Khawpi pawl minung in khat sehla, Hramlak ih hrampi zat si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hmin cu ziangtik hmanah hngilh hlah hai seh. Ni a tlan sung hmuahhmuah a hmin thang seh. Miphun hmuahhmuah in amah cu thangṭhat hai seh; Siangpahrang thluasuah a pek ih, Cubangtuk in thluasuah ngah ve dingah midang in Pathian hnenah dil ve hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa thangṭhat uh; Israel ih Pathian cu! Amah lawng in hi bangtuk mangbangza a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hmin sunglawi kumkhua in thangṭhat uh; A sunlawinak leilung pumpi ah khat seh. Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse fapa David ih thlacam netnak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu Israel mi hnenah le Thinlung thiang a neimi pawl hnenah a ṭha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain kei cu ka tlu zik thlang; Ka ke pawl an naal zik thlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile mi hngal pawl khi ka iksiik ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl mi lian ih an can khi ka hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih pawl cu natnak zianghman an tuar lo; An harhdam zetih an cak zet fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midang tuar zat in an tuar lo; Harsatnak khal midang tlukin an tong fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah an hngalnak cu ṭhi bangin an orh ih, Thazaang ih mi nehnak cu angki bangin an hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thau tukah an mit a cuur liailiai; An thinlung cu aatnak in a liam hluahhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dang cu caponak ah an hmang ih mi siatnak thu an rel. An hngal zetih mi hmuhsuamnak thu lawng an rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancung ih Pathian an relsiat ih Leilung tlun minung hnenah hngal zetin thu an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian ih minung pawl hman an lam an hoi ih, An relmi hmuahhmuah cu lungtho zetin an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih in, “Ziangtin so Pathian in a theih thei ding? Anih Cungnungbik cun theih theinak a nei mawsi?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu hi bangtuk an si ko; Thil tamzet an nei naón tam sinsin neih an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thianghlim zetin ka um ih ka kut khal sualnak tuah loih an um hi a lak maw a si ṭheh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Pathian, sun nihlawh i tuarter zo; Zingtin in hremnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cubangtuk cun keimah in rak sim ningla, Na minung pawl zuarthlaitu ah ka cang zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah hi thu cu thu harzet sihmansehla, Theihthiam ding napi in ka zuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule na Biakinn sungah ka feh, Cutik lawngah mi ṭha lo parah Ziangvek thil a thleng ding, ti ka thei ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lamzin naalnak ah annih cu na ret ih, Siatnak sungah na tlakter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmakhatteah hlohralnak an tong; An cem netnak cu rapthlakza a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , annih cu Zinglam ih a hlo ṭhehmi mang vek an si; Na ṭhang tikah ziang an bang ti hman na ciing nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lung a sia ih Ka thin a natzet tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi aa ka bang ih zianghman ka ruat thei lo; Na hnenah ramsa bangin ka nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain cat loin na hnenah ka um ih ka kut in i kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na remruahnak in i hruai ih, A netnak ahcun upat hmin thannak thawn nangmah in i pom ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vancung ah nangmah siar lo ziangso ka neih? Nangmah ka lo neih hnu ahcun Leilung tlunah ziangso ka hai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thinlung le ka taksa hi ṭumsuk deuhdeuh hmansehla, Pathian cu ka cahnak a si. Amah lawng hi kumkhua ih ka covo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmah a lo dungtuntu pawl cu an thi tengteng ding; Nangmah ah mizuangzam pawl cu Nangmah in na siatsuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Asinain Pathian kiangih ka um hi ziangtlukinso a ṭhat! A thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah sim le rel dingah, Bawipa Pathian cu ka beunak ah ka tuah zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ziang ruangah so kannih hi in dungtun? Na tuu pawl kan parah hin kum khua in maw na thin a heng ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ta si dingah hlanlaipi ih na rak hrilmi, Na minung pawl hi hngilh hlah aw. Nangmah ih ro na miphun si ding ih na tlenmi pawl cu! Na umnak Zion Tlang cu ciing ringring hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ra awla hi siatsuah thluhmi parah hin ra fehhnik aw; Kan ral pawl in Biakinn sung thilri an siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na minung pawl na ton ṭheunak na Biakinnpi ah, Na ral pawl an au ciamco, Cutawkah nehnak thantaar an tar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anmah tla cu thing hautu pawl an bang, Hreitlung ih thing hautu pawl bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hreitlung le an nam in zanthing ih tuahmi, sangka le a dangdang an mawiter mi pawl cu, An ceek ih an khuai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na Biakinnpi cu an bal ih meisa in an ur; Nangmah kan lo biaknak hmun thianghlim an borhhlawhter. Ziang hmuahhmuah an siatbal ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan ci hmih ṭheh in tum. Kan ram sungih hmunthiang hmuahhmuah cu, Meisa in an ur ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hminsinnak thianghlim kan neih mi pawl cu an cem; Profet pakhat hman an um nawn lo; Hi vek in ziangtik tiang a si ding ti cu, Zohman ih theih lomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ziangtik tiangso kan ral pawl in, Caponak ah an lo hman ding? Na hmin cu kumkhua in maw an relsiat ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangah so in bom duh lo? Ziangah so na kut dunglet na sih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa , a hramthok ihsin nangmah cu, Kan siangpahrang na si zo; Leilung tlun ah runnak a thlen tertu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thacak in tifinriat cu na ṭhen; Tifinriat ih rulhreng tum zetzet ih lu pawl cu na deen kuai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leviathan timi rulpi lu pawl na rial dip ih, A sa cu nelrawn ramsa pawl ei dingah na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmah in cerhti le tikhur pawl na luanter ih, Tivapi khal na caarter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmah in sun le zan na tuah, Ni le thlapi tla an umnak ciar ah na ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah in leilung ih ramri cu na tuah ih, ṭhal caan le khawsik caan khal na tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Bawipa, na ral pawl in, Caponak ih an lo hman cu hngilh hlah aw; Pathian thei lo pawl in na hmin an hmuhsuam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zianghman tithei lo na minung pawl cu, Zaangfah nei lo an ral pawl kut sungah hnong hram hlah aw. Hremnak tuartu na minung pawl hi thei ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kanmah thawn thukamnak na tuah mi kha thei ringring aw; Hi ram khawthimnak kil kip ah, Nunsiatnak le dodalnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmuhsuamnak le hremnak tuartu pawl cu, Ningzak in umter hai hlah aw. Asinain mi farah le mi tlasam pawl in, Nangmah lo thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Pathian, tho awla na thuhla cu dinpi aw; Pathian thei lotu pawl in sun nihlawh caponak ih an lo hman cu ciing ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ral pawl thinheng ih an aunak le, A lo dodaltu pawl cat loih thawm vang an neih cu hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na hnenah lungawi thu kan sim; Nangmah hnenah lungawi thu kan sim a si. Na maksak zia cu kan tlang aupi, Mangbangza na tuahmi pawl thu kan sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in, “Thuṭhennak ni ka tin zo ih, Cuih ni ah diktein thu ka ṭhen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilung le a parih a nungmi hmuahhmuah an sawn ṭheh hmanah, Leilung hramṭohnak pawl cu ka hngetter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hngal pawl porh-aw rero nawn lo dingin ka sim; Mi ṭha lo pawl puarthau lo dingin ka fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An porh awknak baang dingah le An hngalnak cawl thlang dingah ka sim hai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuṭhennak cu nisuahnak le nitlaknak in siseh, Saklam le thlanglam khal in siseh a ra lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thu a ṭhentu Pathian in Mihrek cu a hnong ih Mihrek cu a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in a kut sungah khuathai a keng; Cuih khuathai cu a thinhengnak sabitti cang in a khat. A thletih mi ṭha lo hmuahhmuah in an in; Neta bik a taangmi forkhat tiangin an in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jakob ih Pathian thu le hla, sim le rel cu ka baang dah lo ding. A hnenih thangṭhatnak hlasak khal ka cawl lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah in mi ṭha lo pawl ih ki cu a khiak ding; Asinain miṭha pawl ih ki cu a sauter sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ram ah Pathian cu zokhal in an thei ṭheh; Israel ram ahcun a hmin an upat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah inn a nei ih Zion Tlang ah amah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawkah a ral ih conkiang pawl, Ralphaw le ralnam pawl a khiak; Asi, an hriamnam hmuahhmuah a khiak ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na sunlawi zia hi! Na ral pawl na nehnak tlang ihsin na rakir ih, Na sunlawi zia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ralkap ralṭha zetzet ih thilri pawl, Lon ṭheh an si tikah cun An itthat ih thihnak ah an it lanta! An hriamnam hmangtu ding pakhat hman an um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Jakob ih Pathian, annih cu na hro hai tikah, An rang le a totu pawl cu an ril ih an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ṭih na nun zia hi! Na thin a heng tikah, Zoso na hmaiah a ding ngam ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thuṭhennak cu vancung ihsin na run theihter. Leilung cu a ṭih tukah caang lotein a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung tlunih hmuhsuam hremnak a tuartu pawl, Run dingah le thuṭhennak than dingih na din tik ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minung thinhengnak a um tikah Nangmah thangṭhatnak a tam sinsin. Raldonak ihsin a luattu pawl in Na puai pawl an run tuah ṭheu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian hnenah nan tiamkam ciami cu pe uh. Kiangkap ih ram pawl nannih khal in a hnenah laksawng pe uh. Pathian in minung pawl cu amah ṭih dingin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siangpahrang fapa hngal zetzet pawl cu mual a photer hai ih, Siangpahrang tum zetzet pawl khal ṭihphang in a umter hai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hnenah napi in ka au; Napi in ka au ih amah in i thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harsat caanah Bawipa ih hnenah thla ka cam; Thlacam in zanvar ka ban ka phar, Asinain hnemnak ka ngah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ka ruat ih thinlung har in ka hui ih ka aihram; Thuk deuh in thu ka ruat ih ka thin a nau sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in zanvarte itthat loin i tuah; Ka thinlung a har tuk ih ka ṭong thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A cem ciami ni le thla ka vun ruat; A lan ciami kum pawl ka vun mang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A phunphun khawruat in zan ka var. Ka ngaihtuah vivo ih ka thinlung in thu ka suut aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Bawipa in in hnong kumkhua ding maw? Kan parah a lung a awi dah nawn lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In duhdawtnak cu a cemta rori ding maw? A thukamnak hi ziangtik hmanah kim ti a nei lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in zaangfahnak a nei nawn lo maw si? A lainatnak cu a thinhengnak in a airawl zo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziang dang hnakin ka thin i nattertu bik cu: Pathian in thil ti theinak Zianghman a neih nawn lo hi a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thil tuahmi, Mangbangza pawl ka ciing ring ring ding; A cem ciami caan ih khawruahhar na tuahmi pawl kha, Ka vun mang sal ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hnaṭuan ciami hmuahhmuah ka ruat sal pei; Na tuahmi a zatein ka ngaihtuah sal pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah hi, An thianghlim a si; Nangmah bangtuk a tummi Pathian zohman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang cu mangbangza tuahtu Pathian na si; Miphun tampi hnenah na cahnak na langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na huham in na minung pawl cu na hum; Jakob le Josef ih tefa pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Pathian, tidai pawl in an lo hmuh tikah an lo ṭih; Tipithuanthum tla cu a tawdeng tiangin a khur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawdur in ruahti a run burh; Van ihsin khua a ri durdo ih, Nimthla cu khuazakip ah a kau zukzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na khawri cun cat thiam loin khuazakip a tlir ih, Na nimthlakau in leilung pumpi a tlet; Leilung pumpi cu a khur ih a hnin hlurhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang cu tifinriat na tan ih na feh; A thuk zetmi tipithuanthum khal na tan thei. Asinain na keneh pawl cu hmuh an theih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na minung pawl cu tuukhal bangin na hruai; Moses le Aaron cu a hotu an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka minung pawl, ka lo zirh mi thu hi ngai uhla, Ka thusimmi hi nan hna tun hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan hnenah thu ka sim ding; A cem ciami kum le san ih, Thuthuk ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan hna ih theih ciami le Kan thinlung khalih theih ciami, Kan pupa pawl ih in sim ciami thu pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih thu cu kan faate pawl hnen ihsin kan thup lo ding ih, Bawipa ih huham le cahnak mangbangza pawl, Thil mangbangza a tuahmi pawl cu A ra lai dingmi san khal ah kan sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hnenah daan a pek ih, Jakob ih tefa pawl hnenah thukham a pek. An faale pawl hnenih zirh dingah Kan pu le kan pa pawl hnenah daan a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An faale pawl in anmah ih faale hnenah an zirh ih, Cuih faale pawl in anmah ih faale hnenih zirhsin vivo ding ah a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuticun annih khal in Pathian an rinsan ding ih, A thil mangbangza tuahmi kha hngilh loin an um ding ih, A thukham pawl cu an thlun ringring ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih pawl cu an pu le an pa, Mi lungruh le dodal hmang pawl, Pathian an rinsannak ziangtik hmanih a hnget dah lo pawl le, Pathian rintlak ih a um dah lo pawl bangtuk cu an si lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Li le conkiang thawn raldotu Efraim mi pawl cu, Raldo tikcu a thlen ngaingai cun an tlanhlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thawn an thukammi an thlun lo; A daan an thlun fawn lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangbangza tuahmi thil pawl le An hnenih thil khawruahhar a langter mi pawl cu, an hngilh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt ram sung, Zoan nelrawn, Pathian ih mangbangza tuahmi cu an pupa pawl in an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in tifinriat a ṭhen ih cutawkin a hruai hai. Tidai pawl cu phar bangin a dinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun ah khawdur thawn a hruai ih Zan ah meitleu thawn a hruai hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nelrawn ramṭhing ih lungto tumpipi a khuai ih an in dingah, Leilung thuk zetih tidai cu a putter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungto ihsin tidai a putter ih Tidai cu tiva bangin a luanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian parah an sual thotho ih, Cungnungbik Bawipa dodal in, Nelrawn ramṭhing ahcun ral an tho ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian cu an hniksak hrim, An hiarmi rawl an dil hrim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian an soi ih, “Nelrawn ahhin Pathian in Cabuai thawn rawl in pe thei ngai pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungto cu a vuak ih tidai a puut zurzo ngai; Asinain saang in pe thei ngai pei maw? Ei dingah sa in pe ngai pei maw?” tiah an sut lai hrih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu an parah a ai a thok ih, Cutiih a parah zumnak an neih lo ruangah le, In runsuak thei ding ti ih an rinsan lo ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meisa hmang in a hrem hai ih A minung pawl parah a thin a heng deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla tlunlam van hnenah thu a sim ih, A sangka pawl ong dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Van ihsin rawl a pek hai ih An ei dingah manna a run thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun vancungmi pawl ih rawl kha an ei ih, An ei thei zat in Pathian in a pek hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnuah nisuahnak lam thli a hrangter; Thlanglam thli a huham in a thoter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hnenah vate cu leidip zat in a run thlak; Tifinriat kap ih vunnel zat in a run thlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An riahhmun laifang, an puanthlam kiangkap ahcun, A tortor in an tla hnenhnen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuticun an duhzat an ei ih an lung a kim, Pathian in an duhmi hmuahhmuah a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an ei rero laiah, Diriam ko ih an ei ngah hlanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian cu an parah a thin a heng ih, Anmah lakih mi cak bik pawl, Israel mi lakih mino ṭha bik pawl a that hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi bangtuk mangbangza tampi tuah hmansehla, A minung pawl cu an sual thotho. An Pathian cu an rinsan cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah an damsung ni cu thaw bangin a tawiter ih, An nunnak cu rinlopi ah siatsuah nak a tong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutin mi hrekkhat pawl a thihter hnuah, A dang pawl cu amah hnenah an kir sal. An sual an siir-aw ih thinlung taktein a hnenah thla an cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian cu anmah humtu a si kha an thei sal ih, Cungnungbik cu an runtu a si kha an ciing sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asinain an hmurka in an porh an bum ih, An ṭongmi hmuahhmuah cu thuphan hlir a si. Thungai zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amah tlaihsannak zianghman an nei lo. Amah thawn an thukammi cu an kimter cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian cu a minung pawl hnenah, Zaangfahnak lainatnak a nei ih an sualnak cu a ngaidam. Curuangah a siatsuah thluh hai lo. Voi tampi thinheng loin a suup, A aithoknak cu a daiter thei sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A minung pawl cu mihring lawng an si ih, Thli vekin a hrangih a hlosalmi lawng an si, ti kha a ciing ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Voi ziangzat mengso thlaler ramṭhing ah, Pathian dodal in ral an thawh! Voi ziangzatso a riah an siatter!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Atu le atu Pathian cu an hnik sak ih, Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim cu a thin an hengter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A huham a tumzia cu an hngilh! An ral pawl kut sung ihsin A hum hainak tikcu kha an thei nawn lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Izipt ramsung, Zoan nelrawn ih Mangbangza le khawruah har a tuahmi pawl an ciing nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An tiva pawl cu thisen ah a canter ṭheh, Cuticun Izipt mi pawl cu an tiva ihsin tidai an ngah thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />An lakah thothe a thlah ih a hrem hai; Butlak khal a thlah ih an lo pawl a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kharbok a thlah ih an rawl pawl an ei ṭheh; Cuih kharbok cun an lo pawl an tisiat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An sabit hri pawl cu rial in a thah ih, An theipi kung pawl cu vur in a thihter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An caw pawl rial in a thah ih An tuu pawl cu ṭeek in a thah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A nasa zetmi a thinhennak le A lingsa zetmi a ai-thawhnak cu An parah a run burh ciamco. Awloksong le vansaanglam in a tuah hai ih, Mi siatsuahtu vancungmi an hnenah a vun thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A thinheng khal a suup lo; An nunnak khal a zuah lo. Pulhnat in a thihter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Izipt mi innsung saang hmuahhmuah ih, Fapa upa bik a thah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cule tuukhal bangin a minung pawl cu a hruaisuak ih, Nelrawn ramṭhing ah a khor hai. Nelrawn tan in a hruai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Thlangamten a hruai ih ziang hman an ṭih lo; An ral pawl sawn cu tifinriat in a khuh ṭheh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A minung cu a ram thianghlim ah a fehpi; Amah ih a nehmi tlang parah cun a hruai hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A minung pawl hmaiih an nor deuhdeuh tikah, Cuih ram a rak umtu pawl cu a dawihlo; Ram cu Israel miphun pawl hnenah a zem ih, An khua le an inn ciarah a umter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Ziangkimtithei Pathian cu an hniksak ih, Amah do dingah ral an tho; A thukham pawl an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />An pu le an pa pawl vekin ral tho duh pawl le, Mi dodal duh pawl an si; A ngawimi li ihsin saimi conkiang vekin rintlak lomi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />An khawzing biaknak hmun pawl an tuah ruangah, Pathian a thin an hengter. An milem pawl ruangah thiik an neihter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Cumi pawl a hmuh tikah Pathian cu a ai a thok ngaingai ih, A minung pawl cu a dungtun hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Minung hnenih a rung um ṭheunak a inn, Shiloh ih a puanthlam cu a suahsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A huham le a sunlawinak pawl a langnak Thukam Kuang cu ral pawl a longter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Amah ih minung parah a thin a heng ih, An ral pawl a thahter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Raldonak ah tlangval hmuahhmuah an thi ṭheh ih, Fala pawl hrangah pasal ding an um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Puithiam pawl khal ralnam in an thi ih, An nupi pawl khal in an ṭah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Neta bik ah Bawipa cu, Ihnak ihsin hung ṭhang vek khin a tho; Micak zet pa cu sabitti ih a tha a thawhter vekin a tho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ral pawl cu an dunglam ah a nor vivo; An ningzak koin a neh hai ih an tho thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Asinain Josef ih tefa pawl cu a hnongta; Efraim phun pawl khal a hril nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />An ai ah Judah phun le A duh zetmi Zion Tlang a hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Cutawkah vancungih a umnak inn bangin a Biakinn a thianghlimmi cu a sak. Leilungpi bangtuk ih san khat hnu san khat fek dingah a sak ih a hngetter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Amah in a siahhlawh David a hril; Tuu a khalhnak ihsin le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tuu note a kilkhawinak ihsin a ko. Israel siangpahrang ah a tuah, Pathian ih minung pawl khaaltu dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Thinlung zate pek in a kilkhawi ih, Felnak le thiamnak thawn a hruai hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah a lo thei lotu pawl in na ram an ra siim. Na Biakinnpi thianghlim an borhhlawhter ih Jerusalem an siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na minung pawl ih ruak cu langta ei dingah an taanta; Na siahhlawh pawl ih ruak khal ramsa ei dingah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na minung pawl ih thisen cu tidai bangin an suahter; Jerusalem khuasung hmunkip ah thisen cu tidai bangin a luang. Ruak pawl phumtu dingah zohman an taang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan kiangkapih miphun dangdang pawl in caponak ah in hmang; In hnihsan ih in nautat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kan parah ziangtik tiangso na thin a heng ding? Kumkhua in maw? Na thinhengnak hi meisa bangin maw a alh ringring ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah a lo bia lotu miphun pawl le na hmin a ko lotu pawl parah cun na thin khal heng ko aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangahtile na minung pawl an that zo ih, Kan ram khal an siatsuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kannih cu kan pupa pawl ih sualnak ruangah cun in hrem hram hlah aw. Zaangfahnak kan parah nei zaang hram aw. Ziangahtile ruahsannak zianghman kan nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in bawm awla in run aw. Na hmin sunlawinak dingah, Kan sualnak in ngaithiam awla in tlen hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangah so miphun dangdang in, “Nan Pathian khui-ah so a um?” tiah in suut ringring ding? Na siahhlawh pawl ih thisen an suah ruangah hi miphun dangdang pawl kan mithmuh ah hrem hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thawngtla pawl ih hruumnak aw cu ngai hram awla, Thah dingih thuṭhen ciami pawl Na cahnak huham in luatter hram hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thangsiatnak na hnen an hun thlenter ruangah, Hi miphun dangdang pawl parah A letsarih in phu la hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuticun kannih na minung, na tuu rual pawl hin, Kumkhua in na hnenah lungawinak thu kan rel ding ih, San khat hnu san khat in kan lo thangṭhat ringring ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel Tuukhal, in ngai hnik aw. Maw tuurual hotu bangin Josef a hruaitu, in thei hnik aw. Cherubim tlun, siangpahrang tokham ih a totu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni bangin rung tlang awla, Efraim, Benjamin le Manasseh hrin pawl hnenah rung lang aw. Na cahnak in hmuh awla in ra run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in tungding sal hram aw; Na zaangfahnak mithmai in hmuh awla runnak kan ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Ziangkimtithei Pathian, ziangtik tiangso na minung pawl ih thlacamnak parah na thin a heng hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan ei dingah riahsiatnak in pek ih, Kan in dingah mitthli, khuathai tumpi khat, in pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan kiangkap miphun dangdang Nangmah ih lungkimnak thawn kan ram sungah an do aw. Cule kan ral pawl in caponak ah in hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Ziangkimtithei Pathian, in tungding sal hram aw; Na zaangfahnak mithmai in hmuh awla runnak kan ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin sabit hri pakhat na keng ih, Miphun dangdang na dawi hnuah An ram sungah cuih sabit hri cu na phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ṭhannak dingah hmun na simsial sak; A hram pawl cu leilung sung thukpi ah an lut; A ṭhang ih ram pumpi a khuh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlang pawl cu a hneem thuaiah an um; Hnge tampi a neimi sidar thing tumpipi bangin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hnge cu Mediterranean Tifinriat le Zufrates Tivapi thleng tiang a zaam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kimvel ih kulh mi hauhruang cu ziangah so na bal ṭheh? A kiangih a fehtu poh in a rah an fir thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngalcang in a palsiat ṭheh ih, Hramlak ramsa pawl in an ei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Ziangkimtithei Pathian, Kanmah lam hoikir sal aw. Vancung ihsin in run zoh awla Na sabit hri cu rung veh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ra awla nangmah rori ih na phun mi, sabit cakzetih na tuah zomi, Na sabit cerh hi ra run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in cuih sabit cu Meisa in an ur ih an saattan. A saattantu pawl cu na thinheng in zoh awla siatsuah hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hrilmi na minung cu hum aw; Na hrangah cakzetih na tuah zomi minung cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hnen ihsin kan pial nawn hrimhrim lo ding; In nungter awla kan lo cawimawi ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Ziangkimtithei Pathian, in tungding saal hram aw. Na mithmai ṭha kan parah run tlangter awla, Runnak kan ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In ṭantu kan Pathian hnenah lungawi in au uh; Jakob ih Pathian hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hla sak uhla khuang tla tum uh. Ṭingṭang le tingrisit thawn hlamawi sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla a deet tikah siseh, thla a thulh tikah siseh, Puai tuahnak tawtawrawt tum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hihi Israel ram sung daan a si; Jakob Pathian ih thupekmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt ram a do laiah khan Israel mi pawl hnenih a pekmi thukham a si. Ka theih dah lomi aw ka thei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nan zaang parih thilrit cu ka lo sawng ih, Nan hnaṭuannak bawm cu ka lo ṭhumter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harsatnak nan ton tikah in ko ih ka lo run, Ka relhnak thlipi sung ihsin ka lo awi. Meribah tipuut ah ka lo hniksak hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka milai pawl, ralrinnak ka lo pekmi hi ngaihnik uh. Maw Israel, ka thu hi ngai uhla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ramdang khawzing nan rian hrimhrim lo pei. Keimah siar lo pathian dang nan bia lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah hi Bawipa , nan Pathian cu ka si. Izipt ram in a lo suahtu ka si. Nan kaa ang uhla rawl ka lo fah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl in ka thu an ngai lo. Israel in ka thu an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thulungkhen neih vekin ka fehter hai. An duhmi poh ka tuahter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka minung pawl in ka thu ngai hai sehla ka va duh so! Ka thu thlun hai sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An ral pawl zamrang zetin ka neh ding ih, Anmah dotu pawl cu ka hrem ciamco hai ding naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I huatu pawl cu ṭihnak thawn ka hmaiah an lu an kuun ding; Anmah ka hremnak cu a peh-aw tluan ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sangvut ṭha bik in ka lo cawm hai ding ih, Lung lak khuaitizu in ka lo khopkhamter hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vancung ah pathian pawl tonkhawmnak a um ih Pathian in hotu a ṭuan; Cuih tonkhawmnak ahcun Pathian in thuṭhennak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A dik loih thuṭhennak nan baang thlang pei. Mi ṭha lo pawl nan ṭan cuang nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tlasam le ngakṭah farah pawl nan bawm pei ih, Bawmtu nei lo le mi zonzai pawl parah dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu nan ṭhen pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi farah le mi tlasam pawl nan hum pei ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl kut sung ihsin nan run pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zianghman nan va thei lo lawmmam so! Nan va aa lawmmam so! Khawthim sungah nan um ih, Dingthluk lairelnak cu lei tlun ihsin a hloral zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Nanmah tla cu pathian nan si,’ tiah ka lo sim zo. Nan zatein Cungnungbik ih fapa nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla milai vekin nan thi ve ding. Zovek siangpahrang fapa a si hmanah a nunnak a cem ṭheu vekin, Nannih khal nan cem ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ra awla leilung hi thu ra ṭhen aw. Miphun hmuahhmuah hi nangmah ih ta an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ṭong lo in um hlah aw; Daite in um hlah, maw Pathian; Dai zirziar in um hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zohhnik, na ral pawl an tho ciamco; A lo huatu pawl ral an tho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na minung pawl a thupte in a phiar an tum; Na hummi pawl an dodal tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ra uh, an miphun in an ci hmit uhsi, Israel cu a kumkhua in, Hngilh lantami miphun ah cang seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An khawkhanmi ah an lung a rual aw; Nangmah dodal duh ah an ṭang tlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Edom mi, Ishmael mi, Moab mi le Hagar mi pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal mi, Ammon mi, Amalek mi, Filistin mi le ṭai-ar mi pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assiria mi le a cak zetmi Lot ih tefa, Ammon mi le Moab mi pawl tla an tel a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midian mi parih na tuah vekin, Kishon Tiva ah Sisera le Jabin parih na tuah vekin, Annih par khal ah tuah ve aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Endor ah na neh hai ih An ruak cu leilung parih a thut thluh vek khan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oreb le Zeeb parih na ti vekin An uktu bawi par khal ah tuah ve aw. Zebaj le Zelmunna na neh vekin An hotu pawl cu neh ve aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Annih cun, “Pathian ta a si mi ram cu, Kanmaió ram ah kan cangter ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Pathian, leivut vekin ṭhekdarh thluh hai aw; Fanghii thli ih a sem hlo thluh vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meisa in tupi a kaang ih Meihliau in tlang pawl a ur ṭheh vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmah cu na thlisia in dawihlo awla, ṭihnungmi na thlipi in an thin phanter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hmin an theihnak dingah, An mithmai cu ningzahnak in khatter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ral ih neh ringringmi si hai sehla, Kumkhua in an thinphang seh. Mualpho neekneek in thi hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leilung pumpi uktu Bawipa cu Nangmah lawng na si ti hi thei hai seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Ziangkimtithei Pathian, na Biakinnpi cu ziangtluk in so ka duh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sung thlen cu ziangtluk in so ka hiar! Bawipa ih Biakinn sung thlen cu ka ngaizet a si. Ka thinlung zatein a nungmi Pathian hnenah lungawi in hla ka sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sunṭam hman in bu an sak ih Vanva khal in inn an nei. Na biakṭheng kiangah cun an fano an ret. Maw Ziangkimtithei Bawipa , Ka siangpahrang le ka Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na Biakinn thiang sungih a ummi Na hnenih thangṭhatnak cat lo ih a satu pawl cu, Mi lungawi an va si so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hnen ihsin thazaang a latu Zion Tlang lamih thinlung a retu pawl cu, Mi thlawsuak an va si so.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A caarmi Baka horkuam sung an feh hmanah, Tidai puutnak hmunah a cang; ṭoruah in tikhur pawl cu a khahter theh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An feh phah in an cak deuhdeuh; Annih cun pathian lakih Pathian bik cu Zion ah an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa Pathian, Ziangkimtithei, ka thlacamnak ngai hram aw; Maw Jakob ih Pathian, ka aunak i theihsak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan siangpahrang i humtu hi thlawsuahnak pe aw, Na hril ciami siangpahrang cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na Biakinnpi sungih ni khat um cu, Hmundang ih ni thawng khat um hnakin a ṭha sawn. Ka Pathian ih inn sangka kil cu Mi ṭha lo pawl inn sungih um hnakin ka duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa cu in humtu le a sunglawimi siangpahrang a si. Zaangfahnak le sunlawinak thawn in thlawsuah a si. Thil dik a tuahtu hnenah cun Thil ṭha pek dingah zianghman a ui lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmah a lo rinsantu cu, Maw Ziangkimtithei Pathian, mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na ram parah zaangfahnak na nei zo; Israel cu neinung zetin na umter sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na minung pawl ih mawhnak na ngaidam ih, An sualnak hmuahhmuah cu na thlahsak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An parih na thinhengnak cu na rehter ih, Na ai-thawhnak cu na daiter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Pathian in runtu, in tungding sal awla, Kan parah lungawi loin um nawn hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumkhua in maw kan parah na thin a heng ding? Na ai-thawhnak cu a reh nawn lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan thazaang cakter sal awla Na minung pawl hin kan lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu in hmuh awla, Na rundamnak le bomnak cu in pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian ih simmi cu ka ngai; Kannih a minung pawl hnenah hnangamnak in tiam a si; Kan aatnak lamzin ih kan kir sal lo a si ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sunlawinak kan ramih a um theinak dingah, A rundamnak cu amah a upattu pawl hnenah a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hmunmi duhdawtnak le rintlaknak an tong aw ding; Dingfelnak le daihnak an hnam aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minung ih rintlaknak cu leilung ihsin van a thleng ding; Pathian ih dingfelnak cun vancung ihsin in run zoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in neinungzet ah in tuah ding ih, Kan ram in rawl tampi a suah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah dingfelnak cu a feh ding ih, A hrangah lamzin a rak sial ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka lam hoi awla i run sawn aw, Ziangahtile mi derdai le bawmtu nei lo ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thihnak ihsin i hum aw, Ziangahtile nangmah a lo tlaihsantu ka si. I run aw, ziangahtile na siahhlawh ka si ih, Nangmah a lo rinsantu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah cu ka Pathian na si ruangah ka parah zaangfahnak nei hram aw. Sun nihlawh na hnen thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na siahhlawh hi a nunnuamter aw, Ziangahtile ka thlacamnak cu na hnenah a hung thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nang cu na ṭha ih mi na ngaithiam; Na hnenih thla a camtu pawl hrangah cun a hmunmi duhdawtnak in na khat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thlacamnak ngai aw; Zaangfah dil ih ka aunak thei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harsatnak ka ton tikah nangmah ka lo ko; Ziangahtile ka aunak na thei ṭheu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah a lo bangtu pathian dang an um lo. Na tuah theimi tuah theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na seemsuahmi miphun pawl hmuahhmuah in na hnenah an ra ding ih an lu an kuun ding. Na hmin an thangṭhat ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian nangmah lawng a cak zetmi na si ih, Nangmah lawng mangbangza tuahtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tuahter i duhmi cu i zirh awla, Rintlak zetin na thu ka thlun ding. Thinlung takte ih a lo riantu si dingah nangmah in i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa ka Pathian, ka thinlung zatein ka lo thangṭhat ding. Na maksak zia hi kumkhua in ka tlang-aupi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak hi Ka hrangih a tumzia cu! A thukmi Sheol ihsin i runsuak zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Pathian, mi puarthau pawl keimah ral dingin an ra; Mi zaangfah nei lo pawl in a thah in tum a si. Nangmah zianghman ih a lo siar lotu pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nang cu mi zaangfahtu le mi duhdawtu Pathian na si; Mi thinsau na si ih thinpemnak na nei ringring; Rintlak Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lam hoikir awla i zaangfah hram aw; Ka tha cakter awla i run hram aw. Ziangahtile i hringtu ka nu ih a lo ren vekin, Nangmah ka lo rian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na ṭhatzia cu langter hram aw; Hnemnak le bomnak i pekmi an hmuh tikah i huatu pawl cu an ning a zak ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in tlang thianghlim parah a khawpi a din.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel ram hmun dang hmuahhmuah hnakin Jerusalem khawpi cu a duh bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Pathian khawpi, ngaihnik! A lo lom zia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Keimaió thu a ngaitu ram pawl hmin ka khum tikah, Izipt le Babilon ram ka telh cih ding; Filistin, ṭai-ar le Ethiopia mi pawl cu Jerusalem sungah an tel, ka ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion cu mi hmuahhmuah seemnak hmun a si ih, Cungnungbik in a cakter ding, tiah an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in mi hmuahhmuah cazin a tuah ding ih, Jerusalem khawsungmi ah a ret thluh hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutawk ummi cu hla an sak ih an laam: “Nangmah cu kan dawhhna na si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa Pathian, i runtu, sun nihlawh ka lo ko; Zan ah na hmai ah ka ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak ngai awla, Bomnak dil ih ka aunak hi i theihsak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Harsatnak tam tuk in i tlun ih Sheol ka thleng zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mithi zik dang vek thotho ka si; Ka tha a poih ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithi lakih taanta mi ka si. An thah ih thlaan ih an retmi, Na hngilh fai zomi le bom ding khal ih na ruah ban nawn lomi vek ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlaan tawdeng bikah nangmah in i hlon zo; A thim bik le a thuk bik khur sungah i thlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka parih na thinhengnak cu a rit ngaingai; Na ai-thawhnak tisuar in i delh tuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah ih forhfialnak thawngin, Ka rualpi pawl in in hrial, I theitu pawl in in fih a si. Kharhkhummi ka si ih ka suak thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zonzai ka tuar tuknak ah ka mit a mal; Maw Bawipa , nitinte ka lo ko ih ban phar in na hnen ah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithi hrangah mangbangza na tuah dah maw? Mithi pawl tho saal in an lo thangṭhat dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thleng aw dah lomi na duhdawtnak thu cu, thlaan sungah an rel dah maw? Na rintlaknak cu hlohralnak Abaddon hmunah an sim dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangbangza na tuahmi cu khaw- thimnak hmun ah an hmu maw? Na ṭhatnak cu hngilhnak ram ah an thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , bomnak dil in ka lo ko; Zingtinte na hnenah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ziangah so i hnon? Ziangah so ka hnen ihsin na relh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka no lai ihsin thi zik in ka tuar ringring; I hrem ruangah ka vuai ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mei bangin a alhmi na thin- hengnak cu ka parah a hlio; Na ṭihnungza thil in i siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sun nihlawh tisuar bangin in kulh; Ka kimvel in in naih cuahco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I duhtu le ka rualpi ṭha bik khal na tlanter thluh hai ih Ka rualpi neihsun cu khawthim lawng hi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu hla in ka sak ringring ding. Rintlak na sinak cu kumkhua in ka than ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a fek ding ih, Rintlak na sinak cu van vekin a hmun ding, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah in, “Ka hrilmi pa thawn thukamnak ka tuah zo; Ka siahhlawh David hnenah thu ka tiam zo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Na tefa pawl in cat loin siangpahrang an ṭuan ding; Na uknak cu kumkhua in ka hngetter ding,’ ka ti,” tiah na sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van pawl khin mangbangza na tuahmi cu an thangṭhat; Bawipa , rintlak na sinak cu, Vancung ih na mi thianghlim pawl in hla in an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , vancung ah nangmah bangtuk an um lo. A lo bangtu pathian an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thianghlim pawl tonkhawmnak ah nangmah cu an lo upat ih, Na kiangkapih ummi pawl in an lo ṭih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa Pathian, Ziangkimtithei, nangmah vekih a cakmi zohman an um lo. Maw Bawipa , ziangtinkim ah nang cu rintlak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huham a neizetmi tifinriat cu na uk ih, A cak zetmi tisuar cu na daiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramsa ṭihnungza Rahab cu na sutbeek ih na that; Na ral pawl cu na cahnak in na ṭhekdarh ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilung hi na ta a si; Van khal khi a si thotho. Leilung pumpi hi na seemsuah ih a sungih ummi khal na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlanglam le saklam khal nangmah ih seemsuah mi an si. Tabor Tlang le Hermon Tlang cu Lungawi in na hnenah hla an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huham na neih zia hi! Na thazaang a cah zia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tokham cu dingfelnak le dingthluk lairelnak parah na toh; A hmunmi duhdawtnak le rintlak na sinak in ziang hmuahhmuah na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hla thawn a lo biatu pawl cu mi lungawi an si; Na mithmai ṭha tleunak sungih a tlanglengtu pawl cu, Bawipa , Mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangahtile nangmah ih ruangah sun nihlawh an nun a nuam; Na ṭhatnak ruangah nangmah cu an lo thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ral nehnak nasa zetzet in pek; In zaangfah ih nehtu ah in tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangahtile in humtu cu, Bawipa nangmah ih hrilmi a si. Nang, Israel mi ih Mi Thianghlim in siangpahrang in pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlanlaipi ah na langnak in, Na siahhlawh pawl hnenah thu na rak phuang ih, “Ralkap hminthang zet parah, Siangpahrang lukhuh ka ret zo; A miphun sung ihsin hrilmi pa ih hnenah, Siangpahrang tokham ka pe zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka siahhlawh David cu ka hril zo ih, Nan siangpahrang ah hriak thianghlim ka culh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka cahnak cu a hnenah a um ringring ding ih, Ka huham in mi cakzet a siter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ral pawl in an fimhleih lo ding ih, Mi ṭha lo pawl khal in an ti ngam lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ral pawl cu ka ciil ding ih, A huatu pawl cu ka that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah cu a hmunmi duhdawtnak thawn ka duh ding ih, Ka tlaihsan ringring ding. Ral neh ringringtu ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ukmi ram cu Mediterranean Tifinriat in Eufrates Tivapi tiang ka kauter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih in, ‘Nang cu ka pa le ka Pathian na si; Ka lungpi le i rundamtu na si,’ i ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah cu ka fapatir ah ka tuah ding ih, Siangpahrang lakih siangpahrang tum bikah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hnenih ka thukammi cu ka kimter ding ih, Amah thawn thukam ka tuahmi cu, kumkhua in a hmun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tefa in siangpahrang an ṭuan ringring ding ih, A uknak cu van vekin a hmun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a tefa pawl in ka daan an thlun lo ih, Thukham ka pekmi vekin an nung lo a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thupekmi pawl zianghman ah an siar lo ih, Ka thukham pawl an thlun lo a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anmah ih sualnak ruangah nuang fung thawn ka hrem hai ding. Anmah ih mawhnak ruangah ka vuak hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sikhalsehla David cu ka duhdawt ringring ding ih, A hnenih ka thukammi tla ka kimter ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amah thawn ka thukam cu ka bal lo ding ih, A hnenih ka tiam ciami thukamnak pakhatte hman ka la kir lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumkhua daih in a hnenah ka hmin thianghlim in thukamnak ka tuah zo. David hnenah thuphan ka sim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cat loin tesinfa a nei ding ih, Ni a tlan sung hmuahhmuah ah A ram uknak cu ṭhatein ka zoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Van ih a ummi thu theihpitu Thlapi vekin kumkhua in a hmun ding a si,” na rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain na hrilmi siangpahrang parah na thin a heng; Amah cu na tlansan zo ih na hnong zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na siahhlawh amah thawn thukam na tuahmi na siatbal thluh zo. A siangpahrang lukhuh cu leivut lakah na hlon sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A khawpi kulhnak phar pawl cu na balcim ṭheh ih, A ralhruang pawl cu na siatsuah thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A feh sukso pawl in a thilri an ruk sak ih, A inn hnen pawl in caponak ah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ralnehnak cu a ral pawl hnenah na pek ih, An lung na awiter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A hriamnam pawl cu santlai lo na canter ih, Raldonak ah na sunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A siangpahrang kianghrol cu na long saal ih, A siangpahrang tokham cu leilung ah na tuul thluk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tar a cu lo naón na tarter ih, Ningzah mualphonak in na khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kumkhua in maw na relh ringring ding? Ziangtik tiangso na thinhengnak cu meisa bangin a alh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , milai nunnak a tawizia hi hngilh hlah aw; Mi hmuahhmuah a thi ding ih na tuah hi ciing hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Thi lo ih a nung ringringtu zoso a um? Sheol thleng lo ih a luat theitu zoso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , in duhdawt zia a hlan ih na langtermi pawl kha khui-ah so an si? David hnenih na tiam ciami Na thukamnak pawl kha atu khui-ah so an um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Kei na siahhlawh hmuhsuam ka si zia hi hngilh hram hlah aw. Khawvel pawl ih nautatnak ka tuar zia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na ral pawl in na hril cia mi Siangpahrang cu an va hmuhsuam lawmmam so! A fehnak kip ah an hmuhsuam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in thangṭhat uhsi! Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nang cu kumkhua in kan inn na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlang pawl na tuah hlanah le, Leilung pumpi na seemsuah hlan ihsin nang cu thawhnak le cemnak nei loin, A kumkhua in Pathian na si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minung cu leilungih kir sal dingin thu na pek ih, Leilung ah na canter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum thawng khat cu na hmaiah ni khat bangtuk a si; A cem ciami manisun vek a si ih Zan ih tikcu tawite sung vek a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tilian vekin minung cu na fen hlo hai; Mang hnakin rei deuh an awh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zinglam ih a khomi hrampi, a ṭhang ih a par; Asinain a vuai ih zanlam ah a thimi bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thinhengnak in in siatsuah ṭheh; Na ai-thawhnak in in ti hloral ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan sualnak pawl cu na mithmuh ah na ret; A thupte ih kan sualnak khal na hmu ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan nundam ni cu na thinhengnak in a tawiter; Kan nunnak cu dimte ih ṭongmi aw vekin a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan nundam kum cu kum sawm sarih sung a si; Kan dam cak asile kum sawmriat khal a si thei. Asinain hi kan nunsung kum ih in summi cu, Harsatnak le donharnak lawng a si. Nunnak cu rei lo ah a cem ih kan hlota.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thinhennak a cahzia hi zoso a thei thei? Na ai-thawhnak ih a thlentermi ṭihnak cu zoso a hmu cawk ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan nun tawizia siar daan in zirh awla, Cule mifim ah kan cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso na thin a heng ding? Na siahhlawh pawl hi in zaangfah hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak thawn zingtinte in khatter aw; Cuticun kan nundam sung nunnuam le hlasa in kan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harsat zonzaihnak kan tuar kum sung hmuahhmuah ahhin, Riahsiatnak in pek zat tal in Lungawinak in pe ve hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kannih na siahhlawh pawl hi na thil tuahmi a nasa zet pawl in hmuh aw; Kan tefa pawl khal na thacahnak sunglawi cu hmuhter ve hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian, na mithmai ṭha kan hnenah um hram seh; Kan tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah hlawh tlinnak in pe aw. Asi, kan tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah hlawhtlinnak in pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik hnenah himnak duh ah feh tahratin, Ziangkimtithei thladem thuai ih a umtu cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah, “Nang cu ka beunak le ka ralhruang na si; Ka Pathian na si ih ka lo rinsan a si,” a ti thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lang lomi ṭihphannak ihsin a lo hum ding ih, Natsia a phunphun sungin a lo luatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thla in a lo hup ding ih, A lo kilkhawinak sungah na him ding; Rintlak a sinak cu na ral phawpi le phawte an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan ih ṭihphan ding tla na phang lo ding ih, Sun ih conkiang khal na ṭih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawthim lakih a vakmi pulhnat, Sun khawvang ih mi thah hmang siatsuahtu khal na ṭih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na siir ah thawng khat an tlu ding ih, Na kiangkap ah thawng hra an ril ding, Sikhalsehla nang cu tuahmawh na si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl hremnak an tuarzia cu, Na zoh ding ih na hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa cu a lo ṭantu ah na tuah ih, Cungnungbik cu a lo humtu ih na hman ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siatsuahnak zianghman na tong lo ding; Na inn kiangah thisen luannak a thleng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na fehnak hmunkip ih a lo humtu dingah le, A lo kilvengtu dingah Pathian in A vancungmi pawl a ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kut in an lo cawi ding ih Na ke cu lungto ah na khawng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kiosa le rul na pal ding; A heer zetmi kiosa le tur nei rul pawl cu na pal ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in, “Keimah i duhtu pawl cu ka run ding ih, Bawipa ka si hi i theitu pawl cu ka hum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In kawh tikah ka awi hai ding; Harsatnak an ton tikah an hnenah ka um ding; Ka luatter ding ih hmin ṭhatnak ka pe hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nun saunak laksawng ka pe ding ih, Ka runsuak tengteng hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih lungawi thu rel le, Cungnungbik Pathian, na hmin thannak hla ih sak cu a va nuam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu zingtinte phuang in, Rintlak na sinak cu zantinte phuang sehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hri a nei ih tum theihmi awnmawi: ṭingṭang le tingrisit pawl thawn, Rintlak na sinak zantinte thanter cu a va nuam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thil tuahmi mangbangza in ka lung i awiter. Na tuahmi ruangah lungawi in hla ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thil tuahmi hi a va mak so! Na ruahnak cu a va thuk lawmmam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi aa pawl ih theih thei ding a si lo; Mi hmuk pawl ih ruah ban ding khal a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu hrampi bangin an kho ding; Thilsual tuahtu pawl cu an ṭhangso zet ding. Asinain annih cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa nang cu kumkhua in na Cungnungbik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ral pawl an thi ding ti kan thei; Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an sung ding ih ṭhekdarh ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah in sele bangin i cakter; Nunnomnak thawn i thluasuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ral pawl an sun kha ka hmu, Mi ṭha lo pawl an aihram ka thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mifel pawl cu tum kung bangin an ṭhang hluarhlo ding; Lebanon ih sidar thing bangin an ṭhang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anmah cu Bawipa ih inn sung phunmi thingkung bangtuk an si. Kan Pathian Biakinn sungah an ṭhang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An tar hnu khalah rah an rah; A kumkhua in an hring ih an khohzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himi in Bawipa cu miding a si, ti a langter. Amah cu ka lungpi a si ih A sungah dingfel lonak zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si. Sunlawinak huham in a thuam aw ih thazaang cahnak in a khat. Leilungpi cu a umnak ah na ret zo ih ṭhawn theih a si nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na siangpahrang tokham cu, A hramthok ihsin a rak hnget zo. Caan a um hlanah nang cu na rak um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tipithuanthum a thukmi pawl in an aw an suah. An aw an suah ih a huuk in an huuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu vancung ah uktu bawi bik a si. Tipithuanthum ih huuk aw hnakin a nasa sawn ih, Tifinriat ih tisuar hnakin a cak sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na daan pawl cu kumkhua in an hnget ih, Kumkhua in kumkhua tiang na Biakinn cu a thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nang cu phuba latu Pathian na si; Na thinhengnak langter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang cu mi hmuahhmuah thuṭhentu na si; Tho awla mi puarthau pawl an sual man pe hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangtik tiangso mi ṭha lo pawl hi an lung a awi ding? Maw Bawipa , ziangtik tiangso?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thilsual tuahtu hi ziangtik tiangso hngal zet le Puarthau zetin an sualnak hi an aupi hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl an palcih hai; Na ta a si mi pawl an hrem hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuhmei le ngakṭah farah pawl an that ih, Kan ram sungih a ummi mikhual pawl an phil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih in, “ Bawipa cun in hmu lo paam; Israel ih Pathian cun in hliah leem lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw ka minung pawl, ziangtinso hiti lawmmam ih thinlung mal le mi aa nan si? Ziangtikah so nan beng a var ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan hna a tuahtu Pathian cun, Thei loin a um ding maw? Kan mit a tuahtu Pathian cun, Hmu loin a um ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphunkip hotu cun a hrem hai lo ding maw? Mi hmuahhmuah zirhtu cun a thei thluh lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in milai ih thinlung cu a hmu ṭheh; An ngaihtuahmi zianghman a si lozia khal a thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ih nun na zirh mi le, Na daan na zirhmi pawl cu mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo hrangih thlaan laih a si hlan tiang, Harsatnak ni sungin colhnak na pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl a dungtun lo ding; Amah ih ta a si mi pawl cu a tlansan lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuṭhennak hmunah dingthluk lairelnak thawn thuṭhennak a um sal ding ih, Miding hmuahhmuah in an thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl do dingah zoso ka hrangah a ding ding? Mi siava pawl tawng dingah zoso ka lamah a ṭang ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in i bawm hlah sehla, Daiziar ih umnak ram ah zamrang zetin ka feh zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka rilsawn thlang ding a si hi!” ka ti tikah, Maw Bawipa , a hmunmi na duhdawtnak in i dingter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thinphang le donhar ih ka um tikah, Nangmah in i hneem ih ka lung i awiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang cu nawhthuh laak ih thuṭhentu pawl, A dik lomi khi a dik tiah a titu pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi ṭha a phiartu pawl le sual nei lomi thah dingih thu a ṭhentu pawl thawn Nan ṭang tlang lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in i ṭan ih, Ka Pathian cu ka beunak lungpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An siatvaat manah Pathian in a hrem hai ding ih, An sual manah a siatsuah ṭheh hai ding. Bawipa kan Pathian in a tisiat hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ra uh, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uhsi! In humtu le in runtu hnenah Kan lungawinak hla in sa uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungawinak thawn a hmaiah feh uhsila, Thangṭhatnak hla cu aipuang in sa uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa cu a mak zetmi Pathian a si. Khawzing hmuahhmuah tlun ah a tum bik siangpahrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung pumpi hi a kut sungah a um; A thuk bikmi khur ihsin a saang bikmi tlang zim tiang, Amah in a uk ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah tuahmi tifinriat khi a uk ih a seemsuahmi leilung khal a uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ra uh, kan lu kuun in a mah cu bia uhsi; Bawipa , in tuahtu hmai ahcun kan khuk bil uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah cu kan Pathian a si. Kannih cu a kilkhawi mi a minung kan si ih, A khalh mi tuurual kan si. A thusimmi cu tuihsun ah ngai hnik uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nan pu le nan pa Meribah ah, Mi lungruh an rak sivek cun si ve hlah uh. Massah nelrawn ih an rak si vek si ve hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In rak hniksak ih an hrangih ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah An hmu ko naón in rak dodal thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpi kum sawmli sung hi minung pawl ih nunzia cu ka khop neekneek a si. ‘Ziangtluk rintlak lo minung so an si? Ka thukham pakhatte hman an thlun duh lo hi!’ ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin a heng ngaingai ih, ‘Colhnak ka lo pe hai ding, ka timi ram cu, Nan thleng hrimhrim lo pei!’ tiah siatcam in thu ka kam a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah hla thar sa uh! Leilung pumpi in Bawipa ih hnenah hla sa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah hla sak uhla a hmin cu thangṭhat uh. Nitinten in rundamnak thuthang ṭha sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah a sunlawi zia than uhla, Mi hmuahhmuah hnenah thil a ti thei zia cu phuang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu a tum ih a saang bik ah thangṭhat ding a si. Khawzing dang hmuahhmuah hnakin ṭih sawn ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miphun dang pawl ih khawzing tla cu milem an si; Asinain Bawipa cu van ih ummi hmuahhmuah tuahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunlawinak le hminthannak cu a kimvel ah an um; Huham le mawinak cu a Biakinn sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilungtlun mi hmuahhmuah tla, Bawipa cawimawi uh; A sunlawinak le a cahnak thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmin sunglawi cu thangṭhat uh; Thawinak kengin a Biakinn ah ra uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thianghlim Bik Amah a lang tikah a hmaiah kuun uh. Leilung pumpi cu a hmaiah khur seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah, “ Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si; Leilung cu a umnak ah hngette in a um zo ih, ṭhawn theih a si nawn lo. Mi hmuahhmuah cu dingthluk lairelnak thawn an thu a ṭhen sak ding,” tiah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw lei le van, nan lungawi uh! Tifinriat le a sungih ummi pawl tla au uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lo le a sungih ummi pawl tla, nan aipuang uh! Tupi sungih thingkung pawl khal Bawipa ih hmaiah lungawi in hla sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangahtile leilung uk dingah Bawipa cu a ra; Leilungtlun mi hmuahhmuah cu dingthluk lairelnak le felnak thawn a uk hai ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si! Leilung hi lungawi in um seh! Maw tifinriat ih um tikulh pawl, nan aipuang uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawdur le khawthim cu a kimvel ah an um; A tokham cu dingfelnak le dingthluk lairelnak parah a ṭoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmai ah meisa a feh; A kiangkap ih um a ral pawl a kaang ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nimthlakau in leilung pumpi a vaangter; Cumi cu leilung in a hmu ih a khur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah tlang pawl cu khuailul bangin an zup; Leilung pumpi ih Bawipa ih hmaika ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van pawl in a dingnak thu an phuang ih, Mi hmuahhmuah in a sunlawinak huham an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milem a biatu pawl cu ningzak in an um; Milem a porh rerotu pawl cu! Khawzing hmuahhmuah in Bawipa ih hmaiah an kuun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thuṭhennak ruangah Zion mi pawl cu an lung a awi ih, Judah khawpi pawl cu an thin a nuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Ziangkimtithei Bawipa , Nang cu leilung pumpi uktu na si. Khawzing hmuahhmuah hnakin na tum sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in thil ṭha lo a huatu pawl cu a duhdawt; A minung pawl ih nunnak cu a hum, Mi ṭha lo pawl ih kut sungin a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miding parah tleunak a thleng; Mi ṭha parah lungawinak a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nannih miding pawl, nan lungawi uh; Bawipa ih thil tuahmi ruangah cun; Thianghlim bik Amah ih a tuahmi cu ciing ringring uhla, A hnenah lungawinak pe uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah hla thar sa uh; Mangbangza thil pawl a tuah zo. A huham le a baan thianghlim in Ral a neh ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in a ral neh thu cu a than; Mi a run theinak huham cu miphun kip hnenah a theihter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi parih a thukammi a kimter; An parah a hmunmi a duhdawtnak le a tlaihsannak cu cat loin a hmunter a si. Vanrang thuai mi hmuahhmuah in Kan Pathian ih ral nehnak cu an hmu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw leilung mi pawl, Bawipa ih hnenah lungawinak hla sa uh. Amah cawimawinak hla sak uhla lungawi in au uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tingrisit thawn Bawipa ih hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sa uh. Lemlawi thawn hla mawi tum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawtawrawt le tuucang ki thawn, Siangpahrang kan Bawipa ih hmaiah lungawi aipuang in au uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw tifinriat le a sungih ummi pawl, au ciamco uh; Maw leilung le a parih ummi pawl, hla sa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw tipithuanthum pawl, nan zaa beeng cio uh; Maw tlang pawl Bawipa ih hmai ah lungawinak hla sa tlang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangahtile leilung uk dingah Bawipa cu a ra a si; Amah in leilung pumpi ih minung hmuahhmuah cu, Dingthluk lairelnak le felnak thawn a uk ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si, Leilung minung pawl an khur; Bawipa cu cherubim tlunih a siangpahrang tokham ah a to; Leilung cu a hnin ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu Zion ah a um ih a nasa ngaingai; Miphun hmuahhmuah Cungsin Uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in a maksakmi le a sunglawimi, A hmin cu an cawimawi ding. Amah cu a thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw a cak bik siangpahrang, nang cun a dikmi na duh; Israel hnenah dingthluk lairelnak na thlenter; Nangmah in dingfelnak le bangrannak na thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian cu thangṭhat uh; A siangpahrang tokham hmai ah kuun uhla bia uh; Amah cu a thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses le Aaron a puithiam an si. Samuel khal amah a biatu a si. Bawipa an ko ih a run let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hnenah khawdur zual sung ihsin thu a sim; An hnenah daan le thukham pawl a pekmi cu annih in an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, na minung pawl na run let hai. An sual ruangah na hrem hai naón, Minung sualnak ngaithiamtu na si zia cu an hnenah na langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian cu thangṭhat uh; A tlang thianghlim ah bia uh; Bawipa kan Pathian cu a thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw leilung tlun minung pawl, Bawipa thangṭhatnak hla lungawi in sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aipuang in Bawipa cu bia uh. Lungawinak hla thawn a hmaiah ra uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu Pathian a si kha hngilh hlah uh; Amah in in tuah ih amah ih ta kan si; Kannih cu a minung kan si; A khalh mi tuu kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A biakinn sungah lungawinak thawn ra uh; A hmun thianghlim ah thangṭhatnak thawn; A parah lungawi uhla a hmin thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa cu a ṭha. A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun, Rintlak a sinak cu san khat hnu san khat a hmun a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rintlaknak le dingthluk lairel- nak thu cu hla in ka sak ding. Maw Bawipa , na hnenah ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Soiselnak um lo nuncan ka zir; Ziangtikah so ka hnen na thlen thei ding? Ka inn sungah thinlung dingtein ka nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ṭha lomi cu ka zawi thei hrimhrim lo ding. Pathian lamzin ihsin a pialmi ih thiltuahmi cu ka hua a si. Annih thawn kan peh awknak zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zumtlak loin ka um lo ding ih, Thil ṭha lo cu a ruah hman ka ruat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A rualpi thupte in a relsiatu cu Keimah in ka siatsuah ding. Mi hngal le mi puarthau cu Ka zoh meen lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian rintlak ih a nungtu cu Ka mithmai ṭha an tong ding ih Ka siangpahrang inn ah ka umter hai ding. Soisel um lo pawl in ka hna an ṭuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuphan a pertu cu ka siangpahrang inn ah a um lo ding. Mibum a hmangtu cu ka mithmai ah a leeng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nikhat hnu ni khat kan ram sung ih mi ṭha lo pawl cu ka siatsuah hai ding. Thilsual tuahtu pawl hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih khawpi sung in ka dawi thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thlacamnak ngai awla, Bomnak dil ih ka aunak cu thei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harsatnak ka ton tikah ka hnen ihsin relh aw hlah; I thei awla, ka lo kawh tikah Zamrangte in i sawn aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu meikhu bangin a hlo; Ka taksa cu meisa kangh in a kaang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In vuak thlak ih hrampi bangin ka vuai. Rawl ei khal ka hiar nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Naapi in ka hruum ruangro, Ka ruh le ka vun lawng a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nelrawn ih ngathur vate bangtuk ka si; ṭio sanmi khawrop ih sumbuh ka bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itthat thei loin ka meng; Luanglu parih vate lungleng ka bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun nihlawh ka ral pawl in in hmuhsuam; Caponak ih i hmangtu pawl in Ka hmin cu mi camnak ah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rawl cu vutcam a si ih, Na thinhengnak le na aithoknak ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka inmi khal ka mitthli thawn a rawi aw thluh. Nangmah in i cawi ih i hlon hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu zanlam ih phenthlam vek a si; Hrampi ro bangin ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Bawipa, Nang cu kumkhua in siangpahrang na si. Sankhat hnu sankhat nang cu an lo thei ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tho ding ih Zion cu na zaangfah ding; Zion zaangfahnak caan ṭha cu a thleng. A thleng zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na siahhlawh pawl in an duh ih A lungto tiangin an ngaina. An zaangfah ih a leivut tiangin an tlaihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah in Bawipa cu an ṭih ding. Leitlun siangpahrang hmuahhmuah in a huham cu an ṭih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion khawpi a din sal tikah, Amah ih sunlawinak cu a langter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tlansan zomi a minung pawl ih aw cu a thei ding ih, An thlacamnak a ngai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ra dingmi san hrangah Bawipa ih tuahmi cu ngan siseh; A suak hrih lomi pawl khal in Bawipa an thangṭhatnak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa cun a saangmi a hmun thianghlim in a vun zoh; Vancung ihsin leilung cu a vun zoh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thawngtla pawl ih aihramnak thei dingah le Thah dingih thuṭhen ciami pawl an luatnak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuticun minung in Zion ah, Bawipa ih hmin cu an aupi ding; Jerusalem ah an lungawinak cu a hnenah an thlenpi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Miphun pawl le uknak pawl hmunkhat ah an ra ih, Bawipa an biak tlang tikah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka no lai ah Bawipa in ka tha a ṭumter; Ka nunnak a tawiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, atu-ah ka nunnak cu la hrih hlah aw; Ka san ṭhat laitak a si. Maw Bawipa , nang cu kumkhua ih a nungmi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuahlan laipi ah leilung hi na rak seemsuah; Na kutzung in van pawl hi na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An zate in an hloral ṭheh ding. Asinain nang cu kumkhua in na hmun ding; An zate in hnipuan bangtuk in an ṭet thluh ding; Hnipuan vekin na thleng hai ding ih an hloral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nang cu nangmah keel thotho na si; Na nunnak cu cem ti a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kan tefa pawl hnangam zetin an um ding ih, An tesinfa pawl nangmah ih humhimnak sungah kumkhua in an um ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw; Ka sungih ummi hmuahhmuah in, A hmin thianghlim cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat awla, A ṭhatnak hmuahhmuah hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah in ka sualnak hmuahhmuah i ngaithiam ih, Ka natnak hmuahhmuah i damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thukmi thlaan ihsin i suah ih, A hmunmi duhdawtnak le lainatnak thawn i thlawsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu thil ṭha in a khahter ih, Muvanlai bangin cak le no in i umter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cun an namthlakmi pawl ṭan in thu a ṭhen, An co ding mawi a coter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tumtahmi cu Moses hnenah a sim ih, Thil a ti thei zia cu Israel hnenah a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu zaangfahnak le lainatnak a nei; A thin a sau ih a hmunmi duhdawtnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi a kawk ringring lo ding ih, Kumkhua in a thin a heng fawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan tuar ding zat in in tuarter siang lo ih, Kan sualnak le kan mawhnak man zat in in cawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangahtile van cu, Leilung hnakih a saanzet bangin, Amah a ṭihzahtu hrangah, A duhdawtnak cu a saangzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nisuahnak cu nitlaknak ihsin, A hlatzet bangin, Kan sualnak pawl cu kan hnen ihsin hlatzet ah a ret a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa in a faale pawl cu, A zaangfahzet hai bangin, Cubangtuk in Bawipa in Amah a ṭihzahtu pawl cu a zaangfah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangahtile Amah in kan taksa siam daan cu a thei ih, Leivut lawng kan si kha, A ciing ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Milai ih nunnak cu hrampi vek a si; A ṭhang ih hramlak pangpar bang in a par;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thli in a hran ih a hloralta, Zohman in an hmu sal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain amah a upattu hrangah cun Bawipa ih duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thukamnak vekih a nungtu le A thukham vekih a thlun ringringtu hrangah cun, A ṭhatnak cu sankhat hnu sankhat a hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in a siangpahrang tokham cu vancung ah a ret ih, Amah cu ziangzongza ih tlun ah siangpahrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw nannih vancung mi pawl, a cak le thil tithei, A ṭong a ngai ih a thupekmi a thluntu pawl, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maw nannih van ralkap pawl, a duhmi tuahsak ih, Amah a riantu pawl, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa ih seemsuahmi pawl, A uk sung khuazakip ih um pawl, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh. Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw; Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, na va nasa so! Upatnak le sunlawinak cu hnipuan bangin na hruk ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tleunak in na thuam aw. Van tla khi puanthlam bangin na pharh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlun ih tidai parah na inn cu na sak; Khawdur cu na rangleng ah na hmang ih, Thli ih thla par in na feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thli pawl cu na palai ah na hmang ih, Nimthlakau tleu cu na siahhlawh ah na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung ṭoh-nak hram cu hnget zetin na tuah ih, Ziangtik khal ah a ṭhawn aw dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tipithuanthum cu leilung ṭoh-nak parah puan bangin na phah ih, Tidai in tlang pawl tla a khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain tidai cu na kawk tikah an tlan; Na thupeknak aw an theih tikah zamrang in an tlanhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlangpar ihsin an dawp ih phai rawn ah an tlan; An hrangih na tuah ciami hmun an pan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An lan thei lo dingmi ramri na tuah sak, Leilung an khuh sal lonak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cerh pawl cu horkuam ihsin na puutter ih, Tlang karlak in tidai na luanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tivate in ramsa phunkip tidai an pe ih, Hramlak rang khal in an tihal an riamter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tiva kap ih thingkung parah Vate in bu an sak ih hla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van ihsin tlangpar ah ruah na surter ih, Leilung cu na thlawsuahnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ṭilva hrangah hrampi na cerh ter ih, Milai hrangah thingkung le hrampi na khohter. Thlai rawl a ciing ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thin nuamtertu dingah sabit, A lungawitertu dingah olif hriak le A tha caktertu dingah rawl na tuahsak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon ih sidar thingkung in ruah tampi a ngah, A phun ciami Bawipa ih thingkung pawl cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutawkah vate phunkim in bu an tuah; Vaca tla cun farthing parah a inn a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zaathar pawl cu tlangsaang par ah an um ih, Meingan pawl cu khaam lakah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thla siarnak ah thlapi na tuah, Ni khal in tlak caan a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zan na tuah ih khawthim lakah Hramlak ramsa hmuahhmuah an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kiosa no pawl cu sa deh duh ah an huuk ih, Pathian ih pekmi an rawl an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a suah tikah an tlung sal, Anmah ih kua ciar ah an bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Milai pawl cu hnaṭuan dingah an feh ih, Zanlam tiang hna an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Bawipa na tuahmi hi an tam ngaingai; Fimnak thawn na tuah ṭheh hai. Leilung cu na tuahmi thil nung in an khat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tipithuanthum cu a tum zetih a kau ngaingai fawn. Siar cawk lo thilnung a tum a seen in a sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A parah lawng an feh ih, Na tuahmi ṭihnungza ramsa Leviathan cu a sungah a lek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An zatein nangmah an lo zoh, An ei tik caanih rawl ngah dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rawl na pek hai ih an ei; Na kut in rawl na pek ih an pum a puar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khatlam na hoisan tikah an thin a phang; An thaw na lak sak tikah cun an thi ih an seemnak leilung ah an kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain thaw na pek tikah cun an nung; Leilung nunnak thar na pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa ih sunlawinak huham cu kumkhua in hmun hram seh. Bawipa cu a tuah ciami parah a lungawi hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawipa in a run zoh ih leilung cu a khur; Tlang pawl a run tham ih meikhu an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka nunsung hmuahhmuah Bawipa hnenah hla ka sak ding; Ka dam sung hmuahhmuah Bawipa thangṭhatnak hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka hla ah a lungawi hram seh, Ziangahtile ka lung i awiter cu Amah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Misual pawl cu leilung in hloral hai seh; Mi ṭha lo pawl cu um nawn hlah hai seh. Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw; Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uhla a hmin cu aupi uh; A thil tuahmi cu miphun zate hnenah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah hla sa uh; Amah thangṭhatnak hla sa uh. Mangbangza a tuahmi pawl cu phuang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah ih ta kan si ruangah nan lungawi uh; Bawipa riantu hmuahhmuah in nan aipuang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bomnak dil in Bawipa ih hnenah feh uh; A mithmuh ah um ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nannih a siahhlawh Abraham ih tefa pawl, A hrilmi Jakob ih tefa pawl, A nasa zetmi le mangbangza a thil tuahmi le a thuṭhennak pawl cu, ciing ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan Pathian a si; A thukham cu leilung pumpi hrangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thukam cu kumkhua in a nungter ding ih, A thutiam cu san thawng khat tiang a thlun ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham hnenih a thukam le Isaak hnenih a thutiam mi pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel hnenah, Kumkhua daih in thukamnak a tuah; Jakob hnenah san siar cawk lo hrangin thutiamnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kanaan ram ka lo pe hai ding; Nan ro a si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ih minung pawl cu mi malte an si; Ram sungah mi vakvai an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram khat ihsin ram dangah an ṭhawn; Mi phun khat ihsin phun dang hnenah an ceer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in zohman a hremter lo; Anmah humhim dingah siangpahrang tampi a kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka hrilmi ka siahhlawh pawl dai hlah uh; Ka profet pawl tisiat hlah uh,” tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in an ram sungah paam a tlunter ih, An rawl hmuahhmuah a lak ṭheh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sal ih zuarmi Josef cu Hmai ah a rak thlah sung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ke cu thir cikcin in an ṭem, A hngawng ah thir kual an thlaih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu sim ciami a kim hlan lo! Bawipa ih thu in miding a si kha a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Izipt ram siangpahrang in a thlah; Miphun tampi uktu bawi cun a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ram uknak hotu bikah a ret; A ram sung hmuahhmuah uktu bawi ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siangpahrang kut thuai ih bawi pawl tlunah thuneihnak a pek; A thuronmi pawl tlun khalah thu a nei thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Jakob cu Izipt ram ah a vung ih cuih ram ahcun a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl cu a punzaiter ih, Anmah hremtu pawl hnakin a cakter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A minung pawl hua dingah le A siahhlawh parih mi depde si dingah, Izipt mi pawl ih thinlung cu a lehter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule a hrilmi a siahhlawh Moses le Aaron a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian ih mangbangza thil an tuah ih, Izipt ramah thil khawruahhar an langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An ram sungah thimnak a thlenter; Asinain Izipt mi in a thupekmi an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An tiva pawl cu thisen ah a canter ṭheh ih An nga pawl a thihter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram cu butlak in a khat; An siangpahrang inn tiangin a khat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian in thu a pek ih an ram cu thothe le fikfa in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An ram sungah ruah sur ai ah, Rial a tlakter ih nimthla a kauter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sabit kung le theipi kung pawl a siatsuah ih, Thingkung pawl a khiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amah thupek in kharbok an ra; Siar cawk loin an ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ram sungih thinghnah le hrampi an ei ṭheh; Thlaikho hmuahhmuah an piat bul ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Izipt mi innsang hmuahhmuah ih Fapa upabik a thah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl a suahpi, Annih in an sui le an ngun tla an keng; An zate in mi cak le mi harhdam hlir an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an suah tikah, Izipt mi pawl cu an lung a awi; Ziangahtile an ṭih zetmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian in a minung pawl ih tlun ah khawdur a umter; Zan ih tleunak petu ah meisa a vaangter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hnenah an dil ih vanim a pek; Vancung ihsin rawl a pek ih khop zetin an ei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lungpi a ongter ih tidai a put; Nelrawn ah tiva bangin a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A siahhlawh Abraham hnenih A thukam thianghlim kha a ciing ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutin a minung pawl cu lungawi zetin a suahpi; A hril ciami pawl cu hla sak le au phah in a hruaisuak hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Miphun dang pawl ih ram cu a minung hnenah a pek; An thlawh ciami lo cu a coter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A minung pawl in a daan an thlun ih, A thukham pawl an thlunnak dingah a tuah ṭheh a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uh, Ziangahtile amah cu a ṭha. A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangbangza a tuahmi pawl zoso Tlamtling in a sim thei ding? Amah thangṭhatnak cu zoso a saal cawk ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thupekmi a thluntu le thudik a tuah ringringtu cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na minung pawl na bom tikah, Maw Bawipa , kei khal i thei hram aw. Na run hai tikah kei khal i telhcih hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hrilmi pawl mineinung an si tik caan cu i hmuter ve hram aw; Na miphun ih lungawinak ah i telh ve awla, Nangmah ih ro an si ruangih nunnomnak cu i coter ve hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan pu le kan pa pawl vekin, Kannih khal kan sual zo; Thil ṭha lo kan tuah ih misual taktak kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan pupa pawl Izipt ramih an um laiah Pathian ih mangbangza a tuahmi kha an thei thei lo. A duhdawtnak a langter ringring naón an hngilh cingcing. Tipi Sen an thlen tikah, Cungnungbik Bawi cu an dodal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain a kam cia vekin a hum thotho hai; A cakmi a huham langter duh ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tipi Sen cu thu a pek ih a caar; Lei parih a hruai hai vekin, A minung pawl a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A huatu pawl hnen ihsin a run hai ih, An ral pawl ih kut ihsin a hum hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tidai in an ral pawl cu a khuh ṭheh ih, A luatmi pakhat hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnu lawngah a thukammi an zum ih, A hnenah thangṭhatnak hla an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla rei lote-ah, A tuahmi hmuahhmuah an hngilh sal ih, Bawipa ron hmaisa loin thil an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nelrawn ramṭhingah rawl hiarnak in an khat ih, Pathian cu an hniksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah an dilmi a pek hai; Asinain thacem natsia an hnenah a thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih nelrawn ah Moses le, Bawipa ih mi thianghlim Aaron cu an nahsiik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah leilung a kak ih Dathan a dolh hlo, Abiram le a innsang tla an pil ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anmah thluntu pawl parah meisa a rung tla ih, Cuih mi ṭha lo pawl cu a kaang ṭheh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Horeb ah sui in cawnote zuk an tuah ih cuih cawlem cu an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian sunlawinak huham cu Hrampi a eitu ṭilva in a ai an awhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anmah runtu cu an hngilh; Izipt ramih mangbangza tuahtu Pathian cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt ramih thil mak zetzet a tuahtu le, Tipi Sen ih thil khawruahhar tuahtu cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian in Amah ih minung pawl cu siatsuah a tum. Asinain a hrilmi a siahhlawh Moses cu Pathian hmaiah a ding ih anmah siatralter lo dingah Pathian thinhengnak cu a nemter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule ramṭha le ramnuam cu, Zianghman ah an siar lo; Pathian ih thukam cu an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An phunzai an tlokciar ih an puanthlam ah an to; Bawipa ih thu cu an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah siatcam in ralrinnak a pek hai; “Nelrawn ramṭhing ah nan thi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nan tefa pawl cu lawki mi lakah ka ṭhekdarh ding ih, Miphun dang pawl ih ram ah an thi ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule Pathian ih minung pawl cu Peor ih Baal khawzing biaknak ah an tel ve. Nunnak nei lo an khawzing hnenih an pekmi raithawinak ti rawl pawl an ei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian ih thin an ṭeuter ih, An lakah natsia a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain Finehas a ding ih misual pawl thu a ṭhen; Cuticun pulhnat cu a reh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cumi cu Finehas ih felnak ah ruahsak a si; Kumkhua in ruahsak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meribah cerhti ah Bawipa a thin an hengter; Anmah ruangah Moses cu harsatnak a tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses a thin an hengter tuk ruangah a ṭong lo ding tiangin a ṭong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian thei lo minung pawl that thluh dingin, Bawipa ih thupekmi a si naón an that lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian thei lo pawl thawn an ṭhi-aw ton ih, An khawvel daan cu an cawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian ih minung pawl cun milem an bia ih, Anmah awktu thang ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An fanu le an fapa pawl an pek; Khawzing pawl biak thawinak ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mawh nei lo thisen, A fanu le an fapa pawl ih thisen cu an suahter; Kanaan ram khawzing lem thawinak hrangah cun, Cuih thisen ruangah cuih ram cu an baalter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cutiih an tuah ruangah, Anmah tla cu mi borhhlawh an si, Pathian hmaiah mi uire ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu a minung pawl parah a ai a thok; A hril ciami parah a thinlung a uih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khawvel pawl kut sungah a taanta hai ih, An ral pawl in an uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A huatu pawl in an hrem ih, An kut hnuai ahcun an tuar cuahco a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Voi ziangzat mengso Bawipa in a runsuak hai? Cucing in Bawipa an dodal thotho ih, An sualnak cu a thuk sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asinain an aunak cu Bawipa in a ngai ih, An vansaannak cu a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Anmah zawnruah ah a thukam cu a ciing; A hmunmi a duhdawtnak a tum ruangah a thinlung a ṭhum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A minung a neh-nentu pawl ih thinlung sungah zaangfahnak a umter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, in run hram aw; Miphun dangdang lak ihsin in finkhawm sal hram aw; Cuticun na hmin thianghlim kan thangṭhat ding ih, Lungawi in kan lo cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh, Israel ih Pathian cu! Atu le kumkhua in thangṭhat uh! Mi hmuahhmuah in “Amen,” ti thluh hai seh. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!.
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uh, Ziangahtile amah cu a ṭha; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan thangṭhat pei, A run zomi pawl in; Nan ral kut sungin a lo run ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuah, nitlak, saklam le thlanglam ih a ummi, Ram dangdang ihsin a lo kirter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihrek cu nelrawn ramṭhing ah, Lamzin an hlo ih an vakvai; An umnak ding khawpi an pan thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ril a rawng, an ti a haal; An bei a dong ih an thin a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An harnak sung ihsin Bawipa an ko ih, An zonzaihnak ihsin a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hruaisuak hai ih lamzin ṭha ah a fehpi; An umnak ding khawpi thleng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmunmi a duhdawtnak le An hrangih mangbangza a tuahmi ruangah Bawipa cu thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tihal pawl an tihal a riamter ih, Rilrawng pawl cu thil ṭha in a cawm hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihrek cu thinpihnak le khawthim sungah an um; Thawngtla an si ih thir cikcin khihnak an tuar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih thukham an duh lo ih, A thupekmi an el ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnaṭuan khung an ṭuannak ah an baang tuk ih an tlu; Asinain zohman bawmtu le thotu an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An harsatnak sung ihsin Bawipa an ko ih, An zonzaihnak ihsin a luatter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An riahsiatnak le khawthim sung ihsin a suahter hai ih, An thir cikcin pawl cu a ticat ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hmunmi a duhdawtnak le an hrangih mangbangza a tuahmi ruangah Bawipa cu thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dar ih tuahmi sangka pawl cu a khuai ṭheh ih, Thir ih tuahmi kothrolh pawl cu a deen kiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihrek cu an aa, an sual ruangah an na a si; An ṭhat lo ruangah an tuar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rawl an fih ih a zoh hman an duh lo; Rilrawng in an thi zik cuahco thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An harsatnak sung ihsin Bawipa cu an ko ih, An zonzaihnak sung ihsin a luatter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ṭongkam in a damter hai; Thihnak khur sung ihsin a suah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hmunmi a duhdawtnak le An hrangih mangbangza a tuahmi ruangah Bawipa cu thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thawinak pe in amah hnenah lungawinak an pe pei; Lungawinak hla thawn a thil tuahmi pawl cu an phuang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihrek cu tipithuanthum parah tangphawlawng in khual an tlawng; Ti par khualtlawnnak in pumcawm- nak an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa ih thil tuahmi pawl an hmu; Ti parih mangbangza a tuahmi pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu a pek ih thlipi a huuk ciamco, Tifinriat ih tisuar pawl an tho ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tangphawlawng pawl cu tlun ah a hlirh ih, Ti hnuai ah a pilter hai. Cubangtuk ṭihnungza tikcu ahcun, Milai ih ralṭhatnak cu an hlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zuri bangin an tlu, an sawn; Thiamnak an neihmi pawl cu a lak an si ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An harsatnak sung ihsin Bawipa cu an ko ih, An zonzaihnak sungin a luatter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlipi cu a rehter ih Tisuar cu a daiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Daihnak a um ruangah an lung a awi; An feh duhnak khua-ah him damteón A thlenpi hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hmunmi a duhdawtnak le an hrangih mangbangza a tuah ruangah Bawipa cu thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi senpi khawmnak hmunah a mak zia cu an tlang-au pi pei ih, Upa pawl an tonkhawmnak hmunah an thangṭhat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa in tiva pawl cu, Hul verver in a caarter ih, Ticawm pawl khal a kangter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ram ṭha cu ram caar le ram phul ah a canter; Cutawk ummi pawl ih ṭhat lonak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nelrawn cu ticawm umnak hmunah a tuah ih, Lei ro le lei caar cu cerhti in a khahter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi rilrawng pawl cutawk ah a umter ih, An umnak dingah khawpi an din.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lo ah thlaici an tuh ih hmuan ah sabit an phun; A let tampi in an khawm sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl cu mal a sawm ih tefa tampi an nei; An ṭilva pawl khal an ṭum suk dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian ih minung pawl cu, Hremnak le harnak a phunphun in Hmuhsuammi le palcihmi ih an can tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hremtu pawl cu Bawipa in a namsuk hai ih, Lamzin um lo nelrawn ramṭhing ah, Mi vakvai ah a tuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Asinain mi zonzai pawl cu, An retheihnak ihsin a run hai ih An innsang cu tuurual bangin, a karhzaiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cumi cu miding pawl in an hmuh tikah an lung a awi; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu ṭong ding nei loin an dai khepkhep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mifim pawl cun hi thil pawl hi ruat ṭha hai seh; A hmunmi Bawipa ih duhdawtnak cu thei fel hai seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thinlung zatein ka lo rinsan. Hla in ka lo thangṭhat ding; Maw ka thlarau, ṭhang thlang aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭingṭang le ka phirivau pawl tho thlang uh! Ni ka ṭhangphawk ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , miphun tampi lakah ka lo lawm ding. Minung tampi lakah ka lo cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak vancung a thleng; Rintlak na sinak in van a dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na maksaknak cu, Van ah khin langter aw; Na sunlawinak huham cu, Leilung pumpuluk ah langter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na cahnak in in run aw; Na duhdawtmi na minung pawl an luatnak dingah, Ka thlacamnak in let hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmun thianghlim sung ihsin Pathian in, “Lungawi zetin Shekhem cu ka ṭhenṭhek ding; Sukkoth phairawn cu ka miphun hnenah ka zem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead cu ka ta a si; Manasseh khal ka ta a si. Efraim cu ka lukhuh a si; Judah cu ka bawi kianghrol a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain Moab cu ka kut kholhnak kheng ah ka hmang ding ih, Edom ram cu ka kedam hlonnak ah ka hmang ding, ka ta a si ti theihnak ah. Filistin ka neh ruangah ka au ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ralhruang kulhmi khawpi ah zoso i feh pi ding? Edom ah zoso i hruai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in dungtun ngaingai zo maw si? Kan ralkap pawl hnenah na tel lo ding maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in do bawm hram aw; Ziangahtile milai ih bomnak cu man nei lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan hnenih Pathian a ṭan ahcun kan neh ding; Kan ral pawl a neh ding a si!
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah ka lo thangṭhat; Daite in um hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl le, Mi bumhmang pawl in in do ciamco; Ka thuhla an rel ih thuphan an per a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭong mawi lo zetzet hmang tahratin in rel; Thuhla zianghman um loin in dodal ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmah cu ka duhdawt hai ih, An hrangah thla ka cam naón, Annih cun in ral thotho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭhatnak cu siatnak in in sam ih, Duhdawtnak cu huatnak in in ruul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ral thuṭhentu dingah mi ṭha lo hril awla, A huatu cu sual a puhtu ah re aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thu an rel tikah mi sual a si ti in thuṭhen si hram seh; A thlacamnak hman cu mawhnak ah ruahsak siseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A san tawi sehla A hnaṭuan cu midang in co seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A faale pawl cu pa nei lo farah si-aw hai sehla, A nupi cu nuhmei ah cang seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A faale pawl cu inn nei lo, Rawl diltu ah cang-aw hai sehla, An umnak deu siava ihsin dawi vivo si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paisa a coihtu pawl in, A neihmi hmuahhmuah long thluh hai sehla, Mikhual pawl in a hlawhmi hmuahhmuah kha la ṭheh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A parah zohman in, Zaangfahnak nei hlah hai seh; A faale khal zohman in kilkhawi hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A cithlah hmuahhmuah thi ṭheh aw hai sehla, Amah ih hmin cu sankhat hnu cun hngilh fai siseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pupa pawl ih ṭhat lonak cu, Bawipa in ciing ringring-aw sehla, A nu ih sualnak cu, Ziangtik khalah ngaidam hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in an mawhnak cu thei camcin seh; Asinain anmah cu hngilh fai ṭheh mi si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cupa cu mi zaangfahnak a nei hrimhrim lo; Mi farah, mi tlasam le bawmtu nei lo pawl, A hrem ih a that hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midang camsiat cu a hiar ṭeuṭeu, Amah sawn camnak tuar seh. Midang thlawsuah pek cu a duh hrimhrim lo; Zohman in thlawsuahnak pe hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnipuan a hruk tluk in, Midang cu ol zetin siat a cam; A micamnak in a ruangpi cu tidai bangin ciah sehla, A ruh sung khalah siti bangin lut ṭheh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnipuan bangin amah khuhtu ah cang-aw sehla, Taikhap bangin a kimvel in kulh ringring seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siazet ih i reltu ka ral pawl parah a tlun vekin Bawipa in hrem hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa ka Pathian, i tiam cia vekin, Nangmah in kei cu i bawm ih, Na mi duhdawtnak a ṭhat ruangah kei cu i hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei cu mi rethei le mi tlasam tuk ka si; Ka thinlung cu a muril tiangin hliamnak a tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zanlam ih thlahliap vekin a hloral mi ka si; Pa-ngang vekin hlon meenmi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rawl ka ei lo ruangah ka khuk a ṭhia; Ka taksa a ṭawl ih ka ruh le ka vun lawng a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi in in hmuh tikah in hnihsan; In hmuhsuam ih an lu in thin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, i bawm hram aw. A hmunmi duhdawtnak na nei ih I run hramhram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmah lawng i runtu na si hi Ka ral pawl theiter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annih in in cam hman hai sehla, Nang cun i thlawsuah ding. I hremtu pawl cu sung hai seh. Cule kei na siahhlawh hi ka lungawi seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu mualphonak in khuh hai sehla, An ningzahnak cu korfual bangin hruk hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah ringzet in lungawinak thu ka sim ding; Misenpi hmaiah amah cu ka thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziangahtile farah zonzai pawl hnenah a ṭang ih, Anmah thah a tumtu pawl kut sung ihsin a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in siangpahrang ka Bawipa hnenah, “Na ral pawl na ke hnuai ih ka ret hlan lo, Hitawk ka vorhlam kapah to aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion ihsin na uknak cu Bawipa in a kauter ding; “Na ral pawl uk hai aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ral pawl na do ni in, Na milai an tho ciamco ding. Zing thlapit ih daitla bangin, Tlang thianghlim ah na mino pawl Na hnenah an ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in thukamnak cu siatcam in a tuah zo ih A let saal nawn lo ding. “Puithiam Melkhizedek bangtuk in, Kumkhua in puithiam na si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu na vorhlam kapah a um; A thin a heng ni ah siangpahrang pawl cu a neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun kip an thu a ṭhen ding, An raldonak hmun cu miruak in a khahter ding. Leilung pumpi ah Siangpahrang pawl cu a neh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu lamzin kap tiva ih tidai a in ding; A tha a tlung ding ih nehtu a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Misenpi tonkhawmnak ah ka thinlung zate in Bawipa ka thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih thil tuahmi pawl, Ziangtluk mangbangza so an si, Cuih thil tuahmi parih lungawitu cun a tican an thei thiam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuahmi cu upat tlak an si ih, Sunlawinak in an khat. A dingnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in mangbangza a tuah mi pawl cu in hngilhter lo; Amah cu zaangfahnak le, lainatnak neitu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah a ṭihtu pawl cu ei ding rawl a pek hai; A thukam cu a hngilh dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thil tithei zia cu a minung pawl hnenah a langter ih, Miphun dang pawl ih ram cu a pek hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu, Rintlak an si ih an ding ṭheh. A thukham pawl cu rintlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumkhua in a hngetmi an si ih, Felzet le dikzetih pekmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A minung pawl hnenah runnak a thlenter ih, Anmah thawn kumkhua hrangin thukamnak a tuah. A thianghlimmi le huham nei zetmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah cu fim hramthawhnak a si; Cubangtuk ih a tuahtu pawl cu, Theih thiamnak ṭhazet an nei. Amah cu kumkhua ih thangṭhat ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa a ṭihzahtu le a thupekmi a thluntu cu mi thlawsuak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A faale pawl cu hi ram sungah mi cak bik an si ding; Mi ṭha ih tesinfa pawl cun malsawm an dong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A innsang cu milian le sumsaw nei zet an si ding ih, A dingfelnak cu kumkhua in a hmun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl hrangah cun Khawthim sung khalah tleunak a suak ṭheu; Lainatnak, zaangfahnak le dingnak a neitu pawl hrangah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tirhsiang zetin mi a coih ih Dik zetin mah ih hna a ṭuantu cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi ṭha cu a tlasam dah lo ding. Ziangtik hmanah an hngilh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thusia theih ding kha a hreh hrimhrim lo; A zumnak a khoh ih Bawipa ah a rinsannak cu hngetzet in a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Donhar a nei lo, ṭih khal a nei lo; A ral pawl an sun kha a mit rori in a hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi harsa le mi farah hnenah siang zetin a pek; Mi a zaangfahnak cu a ṭhum dah lo. Thil tithei a si ih zozo khalih upatmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cumi cu mi ṭha lo pawl in an hmuh tikah an riah a sia; An mitkem in an ha an rial ih an tlan hlo; Beiseinak an neihmi cu kumkhua in a cem a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa thangṭhat uh! Maw Bawipa ih siahhlawh pawl, a hmin cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmin cu atu le kumkhua in thangṭhat siseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuahnak ihsin nitlaknak tiang Bawipa ih hmin cu thangṭhat in um seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in miphun hmuahhmuah a uk; A sunlawinak cu van hnakin a saang sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian bangtu zohman an um lo; Amah bangtuk ih a saang bikah um tahratin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei le van pawl suk zoh ih a run zoh theitu zoso a um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi farah pawl cu leivut lak ihsin a khaisaang ih, Mi tlasam pawl cu an harsatnak ihsin a cawi hai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih cu uktu pawl le bawi pawl ih hawipi ah a tuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fa nei lo nucing pawl cu, An inn ah mithmai ṭhatnak a coter; Faate a pek ih an lung a awiter a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi Izipt ram ihsin an suah tikah, Jakob tefa pawl khi miphun dang ram an tlansan tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah cu Bawipa ih miphun thianghlim ah a cang ih, Israel cu amah ih ta ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tipi Sen in a hmuh tikah a tlan hlo; Jordan Tivapi cu luang loin a cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlang saang pawl cu me bangin an pet; Tlang niam deuh pawl cu tuu bangin an khir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Tipi, ziang inso a lo tlan hloter? Maw Jordan, ziangah so luang loih na colh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Tlang saang pawl, ziangah so me bangin nan pet? Maw Tlang niam pawl, ziangah so tuu bangin nan khir?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw leilungpi, Bawipa a rat tikah khur aw; Jakob ih Pathian hmai ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungpi cu amah in ticawm ah a canter ih, ṭeklung tlangtluan pawl cu tipuut ah a canter a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na hnen lawngah, Kan hnenah si loin, Nangmah ih hnen lawngah, Sunlawinak cu pek siseh; A hmunmi na duhdawtnak le zumtlak na sinak ruangah hin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khuiah so nan Pathian cu a si?” tiah ziangah so miphun dangdang pawl in in suut rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu vancung ah a um ih a duh poh a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An khawzing pawl cu sui le ngun ih tuahmi, Milai kut ih tuahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaa an nei naón an ṭong thei lo. Mit an nei naón an hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hna an nei naón an thei thei lo. Hnar an nei naón rim an thei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kut an nei naón an tham thei lo. Ke khal an nei naón an feh thei lo. An awn-au thiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi khawzing pawl a tuahtu le a rinsantu pawl cu, An tuahmi milem vekah cang thluh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, Bawipa rinsan uh! Amah cu a lo bawmtu le a lo humtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian ih puithiam pawl, Bawipa rinsan uh! Amah cu a lo bawmtu le a lo humtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Pathian ṭihzah tu pawl, Bawipa rinsan uh! Amah cu a lo bawmtu le a lo humtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa cun in thei ringring ih thlawsuahnak in pe ding. Israel mi le Pathian ih puithiam pawl cu Pathian in a thlawsuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah a ṭihzahtu cu a tum a seen in a thluasuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanmah le na tesinfa pawl cu Bawipa in tefa lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei le van tuahtu Bawipa in Thlawsuah lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van khi Bawipa ih ta an si; Amah ih ta lawnglawng an si ṭheh. Asinain leilung cu minung kutah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu mithi pawl in an thangṭhat lo; ṭong thei lonak hmun a thlengtu pawl cun an thangṭhat lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kannih a minung pawl cun atu le kumkhua in amah kan thangṭhat ding. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka duh; Ka thlacamnak le zaangfah ka dilnak a theih ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kawh tinte ka aw a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thihnak cun a hridai in i run ngerh ih, ṭihnungza thlaan in i naih deuhdeuh ruangah, Donharnak le ṭihphannak in ka khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka ko ih, “Maw Bawipa , zaangfah ka lo dil, i run hram aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭha ih zaangfahnak a nei; Kan Pathian cu zaangfah lainatnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in bawmtu nei lo pawl cu a hum; ṭihphannak hmun ihsin i luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, hnangamte in cawl aw, Ziangahtile Bawipa cun ka zawn i ruat ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cun thihnak ihsin i luatter; Ka mitthli a hulter ih ka ke khal tlukbahnak ihsin a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa ih hmaiah ka feh ih, A nungmi pawl ih ram ahcun ka leeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka cem riai a si hi,” ka ti hmanah ka zumnak a der cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭihphannak ka neih ih, “Zumtlak zohman an um lo,” ka ti hmanah ka rinnak cu a ṭum cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka parih a ṭhat ruangah hin Bawipa cu ziangso ka pek ve ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in i run ruangah A hnenah in ding thawinak ka pe ding ih a hmin ka ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnenih ka kam ciami cu A minung pawl tonkhawmnak ah amah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah ih minung pakhatkhat an thih tikah, Bawipa ih hrangah ziangtluk in so a man a khun?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kei hi na siahhlawh ka si; Ka nu vekin kei khal in nangmah ka lo rian; Nangmah in zalennak i pe zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungawi thawinak ka lo pe ding, Na hmin cu ka ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na minung pawl an tonkhawmnak le Jerusalem ih na Biakinn khaan sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hnenih ka tiamkam ciami cu Ka lo pe ding a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw miphun hmuahhmuah tla, Bawipa thangṭhat uh! Mi hmuahhmuah in Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A duhdawtnak cu kan hrangah a fek ih, Rintlak a sinak cu kumkhua in a hmun a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uh; Ziangahtile amah cu a ṭha, A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in, “A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun,” ti hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ih puithiam pawl in, “A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun,” ti hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah a ṭihzahtu pawl in, “A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun,” ti hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka harsat laiah Bawipa cu ka ko; Ka kawhnak a thei ih luatnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka hnenah a um; Zianghman ka ṭih lo ding. Milai in ka parah ziangso an tuah thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I bawmtu cu Bawipa amah a si; Ka ral an sun kha ka mit in ka hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milai rinsan hnakin Bawipa rinsan a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung uktu pawl rinsan hnakin Bawipa rinsan a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ral pawl ka kiangkap ah an um ṭheh; Asinain Bawipa ih huham in ka siatsuah ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kimvel in in kulh ṭheh; Asinain Bawipa ih cahnak in ka cemter ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuai bangin in herh ciamco; Asinain hrambur meisa kaang bang in an kaang ṭheh. Bawipa ih huham in ka siatsuah ṭheh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Neh ding rori in nasa zetin in do ih ih neh cuahco; Asinain Bawipa in i bawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in huham neizet le cakzet ah i tuah; Amah cu i runtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa ih minung pawl an puanthlam ihsin nehnak lungawi ih an au ciamco cu ngaihnik uh; “ Bawipa ih baan thacak in a neh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A huham in nehnak in pe zo; A ral nehnak huham cak cun!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thi lo ding, ka dam ding ih Bawipa ih thil tuahmi pawl ka aupi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nasa zetin i hrem zo; Asinain i thiter siang lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hrangah dingfelnak kotka i on sak hram uh; Ka lut ding ih Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa ih kotka cu hihi a si; A dingmi lawng an lut thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka aunak aw i thei ih, Nehnak i pek ruangah ka lo thangṭhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Inn saktu pawl in santlai lo, ti ih an hnonmi lungto cu, A ṭhahnem bikmi lungto ah a cang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cumi cu Bawipa ih tuahmi a si; Zohthanungza a va si so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuih ni hi Bawipa ih tuahmi ni a si; Lungawi aipuang in um uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In hum aw, Bawipa, in hum hram aw; Maw Bawipa , hlawhtlinnak in pe hram aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmin in a rami cu, Pathian in thlawsuah hram seh! Bawipa ih Biakinn ihsin thlawsuahnak kan lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa cu Pathian a si; Kan hnenah tleunak in pe zo. Nan kutah thinghnge keng in puai cu tuah uhla, Biakṭheng cu heel rero uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si ih, Lungawinak thu ka sim ding; Na maksaknak ka tlang-au pi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uh, Ziangahtile a mah cu a ṭha; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nunnak ah soisel ding a um lo mi le, Bawipa ih daan vekih a nungtu pawl cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thinlung zate in Bawipa ih thu a ngaitu le, A thupekmi pawl a thluntu cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asi, thilsual zianghman tuah loin Bawipa ih lamzin ahcun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na daan pawl cu in pe zo ih Felte ih thlun dingah in tiam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na daan terek pawl tiangin, Felte in thlun thei ningla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Taima zetih na thukham pawl ka thlun ahcun, Ningzak in ka um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thinlung thiang in ka lo thangṭhat ding, Na thuṭhennak felzia ka theih hnu ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na daan pawl cu ka thlun ding; I taanta hram hlah aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangtin so mino in ziaza thiang a neih thei ding? Na thupekmi thlun lawngin a nei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thinlung zatein nangmah lo rian dingah ka pe-aw, Na thukham pialsan lo dingah i kilkhawi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thinlung sungah na daan cu ka ret zo, Na parih ka sual lonak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo thangṭhat; Na daan pawl i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thukham in pekmi pawl cu ring zetin ka saal ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumsaw tampi neih hnakin Na thupekmi thlun ah ka lung a nuam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na nunsimnak cu ka zir ding ih, Na thuzirhmi pawl cu ka ruat ṭha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na daan pekmi ah lungawinak ka nei ih, Na thupekmi pawl cu ka hngilh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nundam ih na thu ka thlun theinak dingah, Kei na siahhlawh parah hin ṭha hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na daan sungah mangbangza thudik ka hmuh theinak dingah ka mit cu vaangter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitlun ahhin rei lote sung lawng ka um; Ka hnen ihsin na thukham cu thup hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thuṭhennak theih ka duh ringring ruangah, Ka thinlung cu mei bangin a hlio ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi puarthau na kawk hai ih Na thupekmi a pahtu pawl cu, Siat na serh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thukham ka thlun zo ruangah ka parih hmuhsuam le nautatnak an neihmi in i luatter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hotu pawl an tonkhawm ih in phiar rero hmanah, Kei na siahhlawh in na daan cu ka zir thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thuzirhmi pawl cu lungawinak i petu an si ih ruahnak ṭha i petu khal an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu leivut lakah namnuai in a um; Na thutiam cia vekin ka tha tlungter sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka tuah mi hmuahhmuah ka phuang ih nang in i thei; Na thupekmi pawl i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na daan thlun thei dingah i zirh awla, Mangbangza na thuzirhmi cu feltein ka ruat ṭha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Riahsiatnak ruangah ka thinlung a zup ṭheh; Na thutiam cia vekin ka tha tlungter sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zin peeng ka zawh lonak dingah i kilveng aw; Na ṭhat ruangah na daan cu i zirh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na thu thluntu si dingah ka ruat cat zo; Na thukham pawl cu ka hmai ah ka ret zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thuzirhmi pawl cu ka thlun zo; Mualpho in i ret hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangmah in theihthiamnak i pek ding ruangah, Na thupekmi cu thatho zetin ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thupekmi ih tican i sim awla, Ziangtik khalah cat loin ka thlun ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na daan pawl cu i zirh fiang awla ka thlun hai ding; Ka thinlung zate in ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thukham thlun thei dingah i hruai aw; Ziangahtile cutawkah lungawinak ka ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lennak duhtu si loin na thupekmi thlun duhtu sawn i siter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thil ṭhahnem lo a hawl rerotu Ka si lonak dingah i kilkhawi aw. Na thutiam cia vekin ka parah ṭha hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nangmah a lo ṭihzahtu pawl hnenih na thukamnak cu, Kei na siahhlawh hnen ahhin kimter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka ṭihzetmi nautatnak ihsin i luatter hram aw; Na thupekmi pawl cu mangbangza ngaingai an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na thupekmi cu ka sunsak a si; A dingmi na si ruangah i nungter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i duhdawtnak a maksakzia langter hram aw, Na thutiam cia bangtuk in i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cuticun i nautattu pawl cu An thu ka sawn thei hai ding; Ziangahtile na ṭongkam cu ka rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thudik a sim ngam ringringtu si dingah thazaang i pe aw; Ziangahtile na thuṭhennak khi ka beiseimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na daan pawl cu ka thlun ringring ding; Kumkhua cat nawn loin ka thlun ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na thupekmi pawl thlun dingih ka hawl suak ruangah, A famkimmi zalennak sungah ka nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na thupekmi cu siangpahrang pawl hnenah ka than ding; Ka zahpi hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na thukham pawl thlun cu ka diriamnak a si. Ziangahtile ka ngainatmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na thukham pawl cu Ka uar mi le ka duhmi an si; Na thupekmi cu ka thinlung ah ka ruat ṭha ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na siahhlawh kei ka hnenih, Na thutiam cu hngilh hram hlah aw; Beiseinak i neihter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka vansaan caan hmanah i hnemtu a si; Ziangahtile na thutiam in nunnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl in in hmuhsuam; Asinain na daan pekmi ihsin ka pial dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kan dung caan reipi laiih i pekmi na thu pawl cu, ka ciing ringring; Maw Bawipa , ka hrangah hneemtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in na daan an balsiat kha ka hmuh tikah, Ka thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hi leitlun khual ka tlawnnak ramah hin, Na thukham pawl cu ka hlasakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , zan khalah nangmah ka lo ruat ih, Na daan khal ka ruat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na thupekmi thlun cu Ka lungawinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka duhmi cu nangmah lawng na si; Na daan thlun dingah thu ka kam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka thinlung taktein ka lo ngen a si; Na thutiam cia bangin, Ka parah zaangfahnak nei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka nunnak ih a zawhmi lamzin hi ka zoh sal ih, Na thupek thlun dingah ka lo kam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Khulfung loin na thukham thlun dingah zamrang in ka tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cun an thang in fekzet in in khit; Asinain na thupekmi ka hngilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Zanṭim ah ka ihnak ihsin ka ṭhang; A dingmi na thuṭhennak thangṭhat dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na daan a thluntu le A lo riantu hmuahhmuah ih rualpi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , leilung pumpi hi a hmunmi na duhdawtnak in a khat. Na thukham pawl i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thutiammi cu na kimter ih, Kei na siahhlawh hnenah na ṭha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Fimnak le thuruah thiamnak i pe hram aw; Ziangahtile na thukham ka rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Hrem ka si hlan ahcun zinpeng ka zawh ṭheu; Asinain atu ahcun na thu ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Na ṭhatzia le mi na zaangfah zia cu! Na thukham pawl i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Mi hngal pawl in ka thu cu Thuphan hlir in an rel; Asinain ka thinlung zate in na daan cu ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hi bangtuk minung pawl cun Theihthiamnak an nei lo; Asinain na daan sungah lungawinak ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />I hremnak cu ka hrangah a ṭha; Ziangahtile na thupekmi i zirter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />I pekmi na daan cu leilung pumpi ih sui le ngun hmuahhmuah hnakin ka hrangah a sunglawi sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Nangmah in i seemsuah ih nangmah in himte in i kilveng; Na daan pawl ka zirnak dingah ruahthiamnak thinlung i pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />A lo ṭihzahtu pawl cun In hmuh tikah an lung a awi ding; Ziangahtile na thu cu ka rinsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thupekmi pawl cu an dik a si ti ka thei; Zumtlak na si ruangah I hrem a si ti khal ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Kei na siahhlawh i tiamkam cia vekin, A hmunmi na duhdawtnak in i hneem hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />I zaangfah awla ka nung ding; Ziangahtile na daan sungah ka lung a awi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl in, Sual in puh ruangah an ningzak seh; Kei cun ka thinlung sungah, Na daan pawl cu ka ruat ṭha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Na thupekmi a theitu pawl le Nangmah a lo ṭihzahtu pawl cu ka hnenah ra hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Ningzak mualpho ih ka um ve lonak dingah, Na thukham cu famkim zetin thlun thei hram ning law!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah runnak Ka hngahnak ah ka hnang ṭheh; Na thu cu ka rinsan fawn si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />Na thutiammi ka zoh-nakah Ka mit a kham ṭheh zo; “Ziangtik ah so i bom ding?” tiah sut loin ka um thei fawn lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />An hlon ciami savun sabit thawl vekin santlai lo ka si; Asinain na thupekmi cu ka hngilh hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Ziangtik tiangso ka lo hngah hrih ding? I hremtu pawl hi ziangtik ah so na hrem ve hai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Na daan a thlun lotu mi hngal pawl in, Ka tlaknak dingah khur tampi an lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Na thukham pawl cu rintlak zet hlir an si; Mi hngal pawl cun thuphan hlir in in hrem zok rero; I bawm hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Atu-ah cun in that thei zik ngaingai thlang; Asinain na thupekmi pawl cu ka daithlan cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak ruangah Ka parah ṭha hram aw. Cuticun na daan pawl cu ka thlun thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thu cu kumkhua in a hmun ding; Vancung ih a hnget zomi thu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Zum tlak na sinak cu Sankhat hnu sankhat a hmun; Leilungpi hi nangmah in na retih Na retnak ihsin a ṭhawn dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah na thupek vekin tuih sun tiang an hmun; Ziangahtile an zatein a lo riantu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na daan pawl hi ka lungawinak ih hrampi sihlah sehla, Ka zonzaihnak ah ka thi zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Na thupekmi pawl ziangtik hmanah ka daithlan lo ding; Ziangahtile cupawl cu na hmang ih nunnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Kei cu na ta ka si, I run hram aw. Na thupekmi thlun ding lawng ka tummi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in thah dingah in bawh; Asinain na daan cu ka thinlung in ka ruat ṭha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />A famkimmi zianghman a um lo, ti ka thei zo; Asinain na thukham cu a famkim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Aw, na daan pawl ka duh zia cu! Sun nihlawh in acu lawng ka ruat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Na thukham cu ka hnenah a caam ringring; Ka ral pawl hmuahhmuah hnakin i fimter deuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />I zirhtu pawl hmuahhmuah hnakin ka thei deuh, Na thuzirhmi pawl ka ruah ṭha ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Patar pawl hnakin ka fim deuh, Na thupekmi ka thlun ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Ziaza ṭha lo cu ka hrial zo, Na thu thlun ka duh ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Na thuzirhmi ka daithlan lo, I zirhtu nangmah na si ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Na thupekmi pawl an thlum zia cu! Khuaitizu hnakin an thlum sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na thukham pawl ihsin fimnak ka ngah ih, Nuncan ṭha lo hmuahhmuah cu ka hua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na thu cu ka ke hrangah mei-inn a si ih, Ka lamzin hrangah tleunak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />Siatcam ih thu ka kam vekin, A dikmi na thuzirhnak cu ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka tuarzia cu a nasa ngaingai; I tiamkam zo vekin i nungter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka lungawi thlacamnak cu saang hram awla, Na thupekmi cu i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Nitin ka nunnak pe dingin ka tiar aw; Na daan pawl ka hngilh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in ka hrangah thang an kam; Asinain na thupekmi pawl cu ka pah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Na thukham pawl cu kumkhua in ka ta an si; Ka thinlung nuamtertu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Na thupekmi pawl cu ka thih ni tiangih thlun dingah, ka ruat cat zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Na hnenih thinlung reprai Nei lotu pawl cu ka mit an kem; Asinain na daan cu ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nang cu ka beunak le ka ralphaw na si; Na thutiam ah beiseinak ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />Maw misual pawl, ka hnen ihsin tlan uh; Ka Pathian ih thukham pawl cu ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />I kam cia vekin thazaang i pe awla ka nung ding; Ka ruahsannak ah ka riah i siatter hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />I kai awla ka him ding; Cule na thupekmi pawl cu ka seherh ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Na daan a pahtu pawl cu na hnon hai; An mibum thiamnak cu a lak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Mi tha lo pawl cu hnawmhne tlukah na ruat hai; Curuangah na thuzirhnak cu ka duh zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Nangmah ih ruangah ka thin a phang; Na thuṭhennak ruangah ṭihnak in ka khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />A dikmi le a ṭhami cu ka tuah zo; Ka ral pawl ih kut sungah i taanta hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Ka lo bawm ding tiah, Na siahhlawh kei hi i tiam aw; Mi puarthau pawl in i neh-nen hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Na runnak le bomnak zoh ah ka mit a kham ṭheh zo; Na tiam ciami luatnak ka zohnak ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />A hmunmi na duhdawtnak thawn i zoh awla, Na thupekmi pawl i zirh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Kei hi na siahhlawh ka si, Theihthiamnak i pe aw; Na thuzirhmi pawl ka theih theinak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hnaṭuan thok a cu thlang, Milai in na daan an pah vivo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Na thukham cu sui hnakin ka duh sawn; Leitlun ih sui ṭha bik hnakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Curuangah na thuzirhmi pawl hmuahhmuah ka thlun ih, Um daan dik lo pawl cu ka hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na thuzirhmi pawl cu mangbangza in an ṭha; Curuangah ka thinlung zate in ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na thuzirh fiangtermi in tleunak a pek; Mi lungmol hnenah fimnak a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Na thupekmi pawl ka hiar tuk ruangah, Ka kaa ang in tidai haal in ka haal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Nangmah a lo duhtu pawl na zaangfah bangin, Ka lam hoi awla i zaangfah hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />I tiamkam cia bangin i bahter hram hlah aw; ṭhat lonak ih uk ding cu i siang hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />I neh-nentu pawl ih kut ihsin i hum awla, Na thupekmi cu ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Na mithmai ṭha cu ka parah, Ni bangin tlangter awla, Na daan pawl cu i zirh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Ka mitthli cu tidai bangin a luang; Milai in na daan an thlun lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nang cu a dingmi na si ih, Na thupekmi khal an dik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />Na thuzirhmi cu an fel ih, Rintlak an si ih an ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka thinhengnak cu meivam bangin a ling, Ka ral pawl in na thukham an poisat lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Na thukam cu ziangtluk in so rintlak a si! Na siahhlawh in ziangtluk in so ka duh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Mi nauta le nautatmi ka si naón, Na thupekmi pawl cu ka daithlan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na dingnak cu kumkhua in a dingmi an si ih, Na daan cu an dik ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Harsatnak le donharnak in ka khat; Asinain na thukham in lungawinak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na thuzirhnak cu kumkhua in a dik; Theihthiamnak i pe awla ka nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka thinlung taktein ka lo ko; Maw Bawipa , i sawn awla na thu ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka lo ko; I hum awla na daan ka thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Khua a van hlan ihsin, Na bomnak dil in ka lo ko; Na thukam ah beiseinak ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Zanvarte itthat loin ka um; Na thuzirhmi pawl ngaihtuahnak ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na duhdawtnak ruangah i run ngai hram aw! Na ṭhatnak ruangah ka nunnak cu zuah hram aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />Mi zaangfah nei lo i hremtu pawl cun in naih deuhdeuh; Na daan a thlun dah lotu pawl cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , nang cu ka kiangah na um; Na thukam cu kumkhua hrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Na thuzirhmi cu hlanlaipi in ka zir zo; Kumkhua daih ih na pekmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka harsatnak hi zoh awla i run aw; Na daan cu ka daithlan dah lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />I ṭan awla i luatter hram aw; Na thutiam cia vekin nundamnak i pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu runmi an si lo ding; Na daan an thlun dah lo ruangah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , Na lainatnak cu a tum ngaingai; I zaangfah awla i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />I raltu le i hremtu tampi an um; Asinain na daan cu thlun loin ka um dah lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Mi phiartu pawl ka hmuh tikah, Ka mit an kem nasa; Na thupekmi an thlun dah fawn lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thuzirhmi ka duh zia hi zohhnik! A hmunmi na duhdawtnak ruangah i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na daan ih muruh cu thutak a si; A dikmi na thukham pawl cu kumkhua in an hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Ziang thu hman um loin, Mi upa cak zetzet pawl in in raal; Asinain ka upatmi cu na daan lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Na thukam ruangah ziangtluk in so ka lung a awi; Thilri mankhung sartu bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Thuphan hmuahhmuah cu ka hua ih ka fih; Asinain na daan cu ka ngaina.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />Na hnenah nitin voi sarih lungawinak thu ka sim, Na thuṭhennak a fel ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Na daan a duhtu pawl cu, Humhimnak famkim an ngah; Zianghman in a bahter thei hai lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i run dingah ka lo hngak; Na thupekmi ka thlun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Na daan pawl cu ka thlun hai; Ka thinlung zate in ka duh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Na thupekmi le na thuzirhmi pawl cu ka thlun; Ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah na hmu ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , bomnak dil ih ka aunak cu, Na hnenah thleng hram seh. Na thutiam vekin theihthiamnak i pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu na hmaiah thleng hram seh; Na thutiam vekin i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Cat loin ka lo thangṭhat ding; Na thu i zirh zo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Na daan cu hla in ka sa ding; Na thupekmi pawl an dik ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Keimah bawm dingah tiar cia in um hram aw; Na thukham ka thlun ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na runnak ka ngai zia cu! Na daan sung lawngah lungawinak ka nei a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Nunnak i pe hram aw, Ka lo thangṭhat ringring ding; Na thuzirhmi in i bawm hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />A hlomi tuu vekin ka vakvai; Ra awla kei na siahhlawh hi i ra hawl hram aw; Na thupekmi ka daithlan lo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangbang vansaang ih ka um laiah Bawipa ka ko; Cule amah in i let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , thuphanper le mibum hmang pawl hnen ihsin, i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw thuphanper pawl, Pathian in ziangtinso a lo ti hai ding? Ziangtin so a lo hrem daan ding cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hriam zetmi ralkap conkiang le A sen zetmi meivam thawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan lakih um cu Meshek ram ih um tlukin a har, Asilole Kedar mi pawl hnenih um tlukin a har a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Remnak a huatu pawl hnenah Rei tuk ka um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rem thu ka rel tinte in Ral-awknak thu an rel ve a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tlangpar khi ka hei cuan; Khui-inso bomnak ka hnenah a rat ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keimah bomnak cu Bawipa ih hnen ihsin a ra; Lei le van tuahtu Bawipa ih hnen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cun a lo bahter lo ding. A lo humtu cu a itthat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi humtu cu a itthat dah lo; A sing khal a sing dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in a lo kilveng ding; Nangmah lo hum dingah na kiangah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sun ah ni in a lo siatsuah lo ding ih, Zan ah thlapi khal in a lo tuahmawh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭihphannak hmuahhmuah ihsin, Bawipa in a lo hum ding. Thlaphang lotein a lo humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cun na suah le na luh ah a lo kilveng ding; A tu le kumkhua in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Bawipa ih innah feh uhsi!” in ti tikah ka lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atu ah hinah kan um; Jerusalem kotka sungah kan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi cu mawizet le remzet ih tundin salmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vek in Israel hrin pawl cun, Bawipa hnenih lungawinak pe dingah an rat ṭheunak khawpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi khawsungah bawi thuṭhennak tokham a um ih, Siangpahrang in a minung pawl thu ṭhen in a tonak hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem daihnak hrangah thlacam uh: “Nangmah a lo duhtu pawl cu ṭhangso hai seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na khua kulhnak hruang sungah daihnak um sehla, Na siangpahrang inn sungah himnak um hram seh,” ti in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sungkhat le ka hawipi pawl ruangah Jerusalem hnenah, “Daihnak na hnenah um ko seh,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian ih innsang zawn ruat in, Neinung zetih na umnak dingah ka dil a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na tonak hmun Vancung lam cu ka hun thlir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnen-umpa in a bawipa a rinsan bangtuk le Zawng-umnu in a bawinu a rinsan bangtuk in, Bawipa kan Pathian, nangmah lawng kan lo rinsan; Kan parih zaangfahnak na neih lai hlan lo kan lo thlir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In zaangfah aw, maw Bawipa , In zaangfah hram aw. Nautatnak kan tuar tuk zo si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milian pawl in caan rei tuk in hnihsan zo ih, In neh-nentu mi hngal pawl in in hmuhsuam tuk zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan lamah ṭang hlah sehla, Ziang kan cang ding? Maw Israel!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Bawipa cu kan lam ah ṭang hlah sehla, Kan ral pawl in in do tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan parih an thinhengnak nasa zet thawn, Kan nung cungin in dolh hlo thluh zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule tilik cun in fen hlo ding ih, Tidai sungah kan pil hlo thluh zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tilian in in phim ṭheh zo ding,” tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawi thu sim uhsi; Kan ral pawl in bauhthlek thluh loih in humtu, Bawipa hnenah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thangkamtu ih thang sung ihsin, A suakmi vate bangin kan suak. Thang cu khiah ṭheh a si ih kan luat thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan hrangih bomnak cu Bawipa hnen ihsin a ra; Lei le van tuahtu Bawipa hnen ihsin!
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa a rinsantu pawl cu ṭhawn theih lo le hnin theih lomi Zion tlang bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlang pawl cun Jerusalem an kulhvel bangin, Bawipa cu a minung pawl ih kimvel ah, Atu le kumkhua in a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in Pathian minung pawl ih ram cu, An uk ringring lo ding. An uk ringring asile Pathian ih minung pawl in ṭhat lonak an tuah ve pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mi ṭha hnen ahcun ṭha ve awla, Na thupekmi a thluntu pawl hnen khalah ṭha hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misual pawl na hrem hai tikah, An lamzin ṭha lo a thluntu pawl cu hrem ve hai aw. Israel ram ah daihnak um hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion ih in thlenpi sal tikah cun, mang lam vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan hni kan kheek ih lungawi in hla kan sak; Kan kiangkap ih miphun dangdang pawl in, “ Bawipa in an hrang ah thil maksak a tuah,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asi, kan hrangah thil nasa zetzet a tuah a si; Kan lung a awi zia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ruah na surter ih Negeb tiva ah, Tidai a luan sal bangtuk in, Mi neinung in siter sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthli thawn thlaici vorhtu in Lungawi zetin an khawm sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭap phah in thlaici vorh ih a fehtu pawl cu, Lungawinak hla sak in, Fangteel thawn in an kir sal ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in inn cu a sak lo ahcun, Inn saktu pawl ih hnaṭuan cu a lak a si. Bawipa in khawpi cu a kil lo ahcun, Khua kiltu pawl ih kilvennak cu a lak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan pum cawmnak ah zingpit in nan tho ih, zanlam siimzet ah nan it. Zonzai ih hna nan ṭuanmi hi a lak a si. Ziangahtile Bawipa in a duhdawtmi hnenah cun, An ṭulmi cu an ihthat sung hmanah a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Faate cu Bawipa ih laksawng an si; Amah ih malsawmnak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No lai ih neihmi fapa cu, Ralkap ih kenmi conkiang bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cubangtuk conkiang tampi neitu cu mi lungawi an si. Thuṭhennak hmun ih a ral pawl thawn an ton awk tikah, A sung hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihzahtu pawl le A thupekmi vekih a nungtu cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ṭuan man theitlai khopkham in na ei ngah ding; Mi lungawi le mi neinung na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na inn sungah na nupi cu a rah zetmi sabit hri vek a si ding; Na cabuai kimvelih na fapa tla Olif kung note vek an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asi, Bawipa ih thu a ngaitu cu cubangtuk ih thlawsuahnak cotu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion ihsin lo thlawsuah hram seh; Na nundam sung hmuahhmuah ah Jerusalem ih neihnunnak cu hmu hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na fa ih faate pawl hmutu si hram aw. Israel ramah daihnak um hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel, na no lai ihsin na ral pawl in, Zaangfahnak nei loih an lo hremnak kha in sim hnik aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka no lai ihsin ka ral pawl in, Zaangfahnak zianghman um loin in hrem; Asinain in neh suak dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka zaang ah in dawt ih, Lei an leh bangin thuk zetzet in in rai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain a dingmi Bawipa cun Saltaannak ihsin in luatter zo,” ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion a huatu hmuahhmuah cu, ningzak in a sungmi le, a dawi kirmi si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ṭhan reh hlanih a vuai salmi, Inn parih a khomi hrampi bangtuk si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hrampi cu zohman in an finkhawm lo ih, Fangteel bangin zohman in an phur fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiangih fehtu zohman in, “ Bawipa in lo thlawsuah hram seh! Bawipa ih hmin in thlawsuah kan lo pe!” an ti lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka vansaannak hmun thukpi ihsin ka lo ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka lo kawhnak i ngaisak hram awla, Bomnak dil ih ka aunak i theih sak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan sualnak pawl cu cazin sungah khum cila, Maw Bawipa , zoso sual thuṭhennak ihsin a luat ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain nang cun kan sualnak in ngaidam, Curuangah nangmah kan lo ṭihzah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih bomnak cu hngakhlap zetin ka hngak ih, Amah ih thu cu ka rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ralvengtu in zinglam khawvan a hngakhlap vekin, Asi, ralvengtu in zinglam khawvan a hngakhlap hnak hman ih luar sawn in, Bawipa cu ka hngak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Israel, Bawipa rinsan aw; Ziangahtile a duhdawtnak cu a thleng aw dah lo ih, Milai run duhnak thinlung a nei ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung Israel mi pawl cu, An sualnak ihsin a run hai ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka hngalnak cu ka hlon zo ih, Ka puarthaunak khal ka taan zo. Ka hrangih thil thupi zetzet pawl le, Ka tuah thei lomi thil har zetzet pawl cu thil poimawh ah ka ruat nawn lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu aiah thinnuam le lungdai in ka um zo. Naute cu a nu-ih ṭang sungih a hna a ngam vekin, Ka thinlung cu hnangamnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Israel, Bawipa cu Atu le kumkhua in rinsan aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , David cu ciing ringring awla, A tuarmi hmuahhmuah khal hngilh hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Jakob ih Pathian, Cungnungbik Bawi, na hnenih thu a tiammi le siatcam ih thu a kammi cu ciing hram aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Inn ah ka tlung lo ding ih, Ihkhun khal ah ka kai lo ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka cawl lo dingih a ih khal ka it lo ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian Cungnungbik hrangih hmun ka hmuh hlan lo le, Bawipa hrangih umnak inn ka sak hlan ahcun,” a rak ti kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thukam Kuang thu cu Bethlehem in ka thei ih, Jearim ih lo sungah kan hmu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Bawipa ih innah feh uhsila, A siangpahrang tokham hmaiah kun in bia uhsi,” kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na huham lang tertu na Thukam Kuang thawn, Na colhnak hmunah ra thlang awla, kumkhua in ra um aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na puithiam pawl cu dingnak thawn thuam-aw hai sehla, Rintlak na minung pawl cu lungawi in au hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na siahhlawh David hnenah thu na tiam zo; Maw Bawipa , na hril ciami siangpahrang cu hnong hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David hnenah siatcam in thu na tiam zo ih, Na la kir sal lo ding: “Na fapa pawl sungin pakhat cu, Siangpahrang ah ka tuah ding; Na aiah siangpahrang a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na fapa pawl in ka thukam an thlun ih, ka thupekmi pawl an ngai a si ahcun, Anmah ih fapa pawl khal na neh hnuah kumkhua in siangpahrang an ṭuan ding,” na rak ti kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion a hril zo; A umnak dingah a duh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“hittawk ah kumkhua in ka um ding; Ka umnak hrangah ka duh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion ih ṭulmi hmuahhmuah cu, Famkim zetin ka pe ko ding; A mi farah pawl ka cawm hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A puithiam pawl cu, An hnaṭuannak kipah ka thlawsuah ding ih, A minung pawl cu lungawi in an au ding ih hla an sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David ih tefa pakhat cu, Siangpahrang ka siter ding ih, Ka hrilmi siangpahrang ih uknak cu, hitawk ah ka hmunter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ral pawl cu ningzahnak in tuam hai ding; Asinain anih uknak cu a kau sinsin dingih, a ṭhangso vivo ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian minung pawl unau bangin hmunkhat ih umtlang hi a ṭha in a va nuam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron ih lu ihsin a khahmul le A korfual hngawng tiang, A luangmi olif hriak sunglawi bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon Tlang ih daitla, Zion tlangpar ih a rung tlami daitla bangtuk a si. Cutawkah Bawipa in thu in tiam ih thlawsuah in pek. Cuih a thlawsuah cu kumkhua nunnak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih siahhlawh pawl le, Zan ih a Biakinn hnaṭuan pawl, Ra uhla Bawipa thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakinn sungah kut thlir in thlacam uhla, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei le van tuahtu Bawipa in Zion ihsin lo thlawsuah hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa thangṭhat uh! Bawipa ih siahhlawh pawl, a hmin cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih inn sung Kan Pathian hmun thianghlim ih a dingtu pawl, Bawipa ih hmin cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh; Amah cu a ṭha a si! A hmin thangṭhatnak cu hla in sak uh; Zaangfahnak a neih ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob cu amah ih hrangah a hril, Israel mi khal amah ih ta dingah a hril a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Bawipa cu a maksak a si ti ka thei; Khawzing dang pawl hnakin a tum sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van le leilung ah siseh, Tipi le tipithuk hnuai ah siseh, Tuah a duhmi cu a tuah thei ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanhram deng ihsin khawdur a rak keng ih, Ruah le thlipi hrangah lakah nimthlakau a tuah; A thilri retnak sung ihsin thli a suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ram ah milai siseh, ṭilva siseh, An fatir hmuahhmuah a that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutawkah khawruahhar le mangbangza a tuah ih, Faro le a kut hnuai bawi pawl a hrem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun tampi a siatsuah ih Siangpahrang cak zetzet pawl a that a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amor siangpahrang Sihon, Bashan siangpahrang Og le Kanaan ram sung siangpahrang hmuahhmuah a that hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ram cu amah ih minung, Israel mi hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hmin cu kumkhua in a thang ding; Sankhat hnu sankhat ah na thawm a thang ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl a ṭan ding ih, A siahhlawh pawl parah lainatnak a nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miphun dangdangih milem pawl cu, Sui le ngun in tuahmi an si. Milai kut ih tuahcopmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaa an nei naón an ṭong thei lo; Mit an nei naón an hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hna an nei naón an thei thei lo; Kaa an nei naón thaw an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih milem pawl a tuah ih a rinsantu pawl cu, An tuahmi milem bangtuk ah cang ṭheh hai seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, Bawipa thangṭhat uh! Maw Pathian ih puithiam pawl, amah cu cawimawi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Levi mi pawl, Bawipa thangṭhat uh! Amah a biatu in Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu Zion ah thangṭhat uh! A umnak Jerusalem ah cawimawi uh! Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah lungawinak thu sim uh; Ziangahtile amah cu a ṭha; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawzing pawl lakih a tum bik Pathian hnenah lungawi thu sim uh; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi hmuahhmuah lakih bawi bik hnenah lungawi thu sim uh; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah lawng in mangbangza a tuah; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A fimnak in van tla khi a tuah; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leilung cu tithuukpi parah a dinter a si; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah in ni le thlapi khal a tuah; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni cu sun uktu ah a tuah; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlapi le arsi pawl zan uktu ah a tuah; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl ih fapa upa bik a that ṭheh, A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt ram ihsin a hruai suak; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ban thacak le a kut thawm lian in; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tipi Sen cu a ṭhen awkter; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih sung cun a minung pawl a hruai; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro le a ralkap pawl cu, Ti sungah a pilter ṭheh hai; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A minung pawl nelrawn ramṭhing ah a hruai: A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siangpahrang cak zetzet a that ṭheh a si; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang hmin thang zetzet tla a that; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor siangpahrang Sihon a that; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bashan siangpahrang Og tla a that; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ram cu a minung pawl hnenah ro ah a pek; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih ro cu a siahhlawh Israel hnenah a pek: A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ral kan sun tikah in hngilh lo; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan ral pawl kut sungin in luatter; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Minung le ramsa hmuahhmuah rawl a pek; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vancung Pathian hnenah lungawi thu sim uh; A duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon tiva kap ah kan to ih kan ṭap, Cutawkah kan ṭap, Zion kan ngai caan ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan kiangih partiam kung parah, Kan ṭingṭang pawl kan thlai ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In kaitu pawl in hlasak in fial; Anmah lungnuamtertu dingah: “Zion thu kha hla in in sak sak uh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangtin so Bawipa ih hla cu, Miphun dang ram ahcun kan sak thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭingṭang tum thiam nawn loin um ninglaw, Jerusalem nang ka lo hngilh ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang lo cing nawn loin ka um ih, Jerusalem kha ka lungawinak saang bik ih ka ret lo ahcun, Ka lei hi ka saangkhar ah bet seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Jerusalem an lak ni ah, Edom mi pawl ih an tuahmi kha cing ringring aw: “Balsiat ṭheh uh, balsiat ṭheh uh,” ti ih an au kha hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Babilon, nang cu balsiat ṭheh na si ding; Kan parih na tuahmi hmuahhmuah ruangah na parih phu a latu cu mi thlawsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na fa note pawl la tahratin, Lungto parih a vuatu cu mi thlawsuak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thinlung zate in ka lo lawm; Khawzing pawl hmaiah na thang- ṭhatnak cu hla in ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na Biakinn thianghlim hoih in ka kuun ih, Na hmin cu ka thangṭhat; A thleng-aw dah lomi na duhdawt- nak le rintlak na sinak ruangah; Na hmin le na thupekmi pawl cu A saangbik ih na langter ruangah; Na hmin ka thangṭhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lo kawh tikah i run awi; Na thazaang in i cakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung tlun siangpahrang hmuahhmuah in, Maw Bawipa , an lo thangṭhat ding. Ziangahtile na thutiammi an thei ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah le, A sunlawinak huham cu hla in an sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu a saang bikah a um naón mi nauta pawl ih zawn a ruat. A mithmuhnak ihsin mi puarthau an relh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harsatnak tampi in in kulh ṭheh khalle, A heng zetmi ka ral pawl i do sak ih, Na vorhlam kut in i run a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In tiamkam ciami hmuahhmuah cu, Na kim ter ṭheh ding; Maw Bawipa , na duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun; Na kut in na thawh ciami na hnaṭuan cu ṭheh suak hram aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa , nangmah in i hliakhlai thluh zo ih, I thei ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah na thei ṭheh a si. Lam hlatzet ihsin ka thinlung ruahmi na thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hna ka ṭuan le ka colh khal i hmu; Ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah na thei ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ṭong hlan ihsin ka ṭong dingmi cu na rak thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kimvelah nang cu na um; Na huham in i hum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I theih thei zia hi mangbangza ngaingai a si; Ka hrangah a thuuk tuk, ka thei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hnen ihsin khuiah so ka relh ding? Na mithmuh ihsin khuiah so ka tlan cuang ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancung ah kai ningla cunah nang na um ding; Mithi pawl ram Sheol ah it khal ningla cunah na um thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla nei bangin nisuahnak lan in zuang khal ningla; Asilole nitlaknak a hlat bik hmunah um khal ningla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutawkah na kut in i hruai ding ih, Keimah bawm dingah na rak um thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thimnak cu ‘I thup aw,’ ti in, Ka kiang ih tleunak cu ‘Thimnak ah cang aw,’ tiah ti khal ningla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang na hrangah thimnak cu a thim lo! Zan cu sun tluk in a vang ih, Na hrangah thimnak le tleunak cu an bang-aw a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka sungril tiang a tuah ṭhehtu cu nangmah na si; Ka nu ih pum sungih i seemtertu khal nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ṭih-um zet le lamdang zet ih in tuah ruangah, Ka lo thangṭhat. Na tuahmi hmuahhmuah hi mangbang le khawruahhar an si. Cucu ka thinlung zate in ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Seemsuah dingah ka ruangrai na zing ih, Ka nu ih pum sungah ka thi le ka sa na pehcih laiah, A thupte in cutawk ih ka ṭhan rero laiah khan, I hmu ṭhehtu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka suah hlan ihsin i hmu zo; Ka hrangih na tuahmi kum le caan pawl cu, Na cabu sungah khum cia an rak si zo, Nikhat hman a thok hlan ihsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na ruahnak pawl cu, Ka hrangah a thuuk ih a har. Na ruahnak an tam zia hi ka ruat ban lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siar khal ningla vunnel hnakin an tam sawn ding; Ka ṭhang khalle na hnen thotho ah ka um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Pathian, mi ṭha lo pawl cu, That ṭheh hai cila ka va duh so! Thisen suah a hiartu pawl cun, I tlansan ṭheh hai sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thu cu mawi lo zetzet in an sim; Na hmin cu ngai tlak loin an rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a lo huatu pawl ziangtluk in so ka huat hai! Nangmah a lo raltu pawl cu, ziangtluk in so ka mit an kem!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anmah cu huat tithum in ka hua; Ka ral ih ka ruahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw Pathian, i hliakhlai awla, Ka thinlung hi thei hram aw; I hniksak awla ka ruahnak hi hmu hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka sungah ṭhat lonak a um le um lo zohfiang aw; Cule kumkhua nunnak lamzin ah i hruai aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mi ṭha lo pawl kut ihsin i hum aw; Mi puarthau pawl kut ihsin i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annih pawl cun ṭhat lonak lawng an hawl ih, Tawhawknak lawng an ngaihtuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei cu rul cukhrang lei vekin a hriam, An ṭong cu rulngan ih tur vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mi ṭha lo pawl kut ihsin i hum aw; Keimah thlak ding le thisen suah ding lawng a hiartu pawl ih kut ihsin i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hngalhngawng pawl in thang in kam; Palphum thang an siah ih, Keimah awk dingah lamzin tluan in thang an kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah, “Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si,” ka ti. Maw Bawipa , bomnak dil ih ka aunak i ngai hram aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka Pathian le i humtu cak, Raldonak hmunah ka lu cu ralphaw thawn na hum ngah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , mi ṭha lo pawl cu an duhmi pe hlah aw; Mi an phiarnak tla hlawhtlinter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu nehtu siter hlah aw; In hro siatnak cu an parah tla hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A vaam zetmi meiling cu an parah tla hram seh; Khur sungah suak thei nawn lo dingin hlonmi si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dik loih midang sualpuhtu cu, hlawhtling hlah hai seh; Thisen suah a hiartu pawl cu, ṭhat lonak in man sehla siatsuah si hram hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nang cun mi farah pawl ih thu le, Mi tlasam pawl ih covo cu na ṭan a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miding pawl cun an lo thangṭhat zet ding; Miding cu na mithmuh ah an um ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo ko; Atu ah i bawm hram aw. Ka lo kawh tikah i ngai hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu, Rimhmui ai-ah i co sak awla, Ka kut ka thlir mi cu, zanlam thawinak ai-ah i san sak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka kaa ah kiltu re awla, Ka hmur ih sangka ah vengtu re hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thilsual tuah duh lotu si dingah i bawm awla, Mi ṭha lo pawl ih ṭhat lonak ah tel lo dingin i kham aw. An puai tuahnak khalah tel hram hlah ning law!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha cun zawnruahnak in i kawk ding ih i hrem ko ding; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo in ka lu ih an toihmi cawimawinak hriak cu, ka saang dah lo ding; Ziangahtile a tuahmi thil ṭha lo duh loin thla ka cam ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anmah uktu pawl lungpang khaam ihsin hlon hlo an si tikah, Ka thu a dik zia kha minung pawl in an phuang leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An phel ih an sutkuai ṭhehmi lungto bangin, An ruh pawl cu thlaan kaa ah, ṭhekdarh ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa Pathian, kei cun ka lo rinsan ringring; Nangmah ih humhimnak lawnglawng ka hawl; I thiter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hrangih an kammi thang ihsin i hum aw; ṭhat lonak lawng a tuahtu pawl ih thang ihsin i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei cu himdamte ih ka tlanleen laiah mi ṭha lo pawl cu anmah ih kammi thang ah tla hai seh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah bomnak dil in ka au; Amah cu zaangfah ka dil ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka phunzainak hmuahhmuah Bawipa hnenah ka thlenter; Ka harsatnak hmuahhmuah amah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vansang beidong ih ka um laiah, Ka tuah dingmi theitu cu amah a si; Ka fehnak lamzin ah ka ral pawl in a thupte in thang in rak siah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kiangkap ka zoh tikah, I bawmtu ding zohman ka hmu lo; I humtu ding zohman ka hmu lo, Zohman in ka zawn in ruat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , bomnak dil in na hnenah ka au: “Maw Bawipa , nang cu i humtu ka beunak na si, Hi leitlun nunnak ram ahhin nang lawng hi ka covo na si,” ka lo ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bomnak dilih ka aunak i theihsak hram aw; Ziangahtile beidonnak sungah ka pil zo. Kei hnakih a cak deuhmi ka ral pawl kut sungin i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka harsatnak sungin i luatter aw; Cule na minung pawl an tonkhawmnak ah ka lo thangṭhat ding; Ka parih na ṭhatnak ruangah!
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka thlacam i ngai awla, Dingnak na neih ruangah zaangfah ka lo dilnak i theih sak hram aw. Rintlak na si ruangah i let hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thuṭhennak hmun ah, Kei na siahhlawh hi i suahpi hram hlah aw; Na mithmuh ah zohman mi ding an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in in hual ih nasa zetin in neh zo; A thimmi thawng inn sungah in ret ih, Khuahlan laiih a rak thi zomi ka bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah ka bei a dong, Awloksong, vansaang laam in ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A liam ciami ni le thla ka vun thei sal; Na thil tuahmi pawl ka vun mang sal ih, Na kut ih tuahmi hmuahhmuah ka thinlung in ṭhatein ka ruat sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah na hnenah ka kut thlir in thla ka cam; Lei caar in tidai a haal bangin, Ka nunnak in nangmah a lo haal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i sawn hram aw; Ruahsannak zianghman ka nei nawn lo; Ka hnen ihsin relh hram hlah aw! Culole mithi ramih a fehtu lakah, Kei khal ka tel ve pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah lawnglawng ka lo rinsan; A hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu, zingtinte in i theiter hram aw. Ka thlacamnak cu na hnenah ka thlenpi; Ka fehnak ding zin i hmuh hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , humhimnak duh ah na hnen ka ra; Ka ral pawl ih kut in i luatter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si; Na duhmi tuahtu si dingah i zirh aw. Na thlarau cu ka parah ṭha hram sehla, Lamzin rawn ah i hruai hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i tiamkam cia vekin i run hram aw; Na ṭhat ruangah ka harnak sungin i luatter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei i duh ruangah ka ral pawl cu that hai aw; I neh-nentu pawl tla siatsuah ṭheh hai aw; Ziangahtile na siahhlawh ka si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka beunak lungpi Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Raldo daan le ral nam zia cu, Amah in i zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah cu i humtu le ṭantu a si; Ka beunak le i runtu khal a si; Ka himnak ah amah ka ring. Miphun dang pawl cu ka hnuai ah a ret hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , milai hi ziangso a si ih na seherh ringring? Mihring taak ko hi ziangso a si ih, a zawn na ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minung cu thaw vek fang a si; A nundam sung cu, A liam cingmi phenthlam vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa , van khi run ong awla rung lang aw; Tlang pawl khi tham awla meikhu an suah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimthla kauter awla na ral pawl ṭhekdarh hai aw. Na conkiang sai awla tlanter ṭheh hai aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlun ihsin run dawh awla, Ti thuuk sung ihsin i dir suak in i run hram aw. Thudik a sim dah lo mi le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siatcam in thuphan a pertu, Ram dangmi pawl ih kut sung ihsin i hum hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na hnenah hla thar ka sak ding; ṭingṭang tum in hla ka lo sak sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl hnenah nehnak na pek ih, Na siahhlawh David cu na run suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zaangfah nei lo ka ral pawl kut in i hum awla, Thudik a sim dah lo tu le, Siatcam in thuphan a reltu pawl, Ramdang mi ih kut sungin i run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan fapa pawl cu mino an si lai ihsin, ṭhazet le cakzet ih a ṭhangmi, Thingkung bangtuk si hai seh. Kan fanu pawl cu siangpahrang inn mawi tertu, Inn kilih phunmi lungser bangtuk si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan cuam pawl cu rawl phunkim in khat seh; Kan loram sungih tuu pawl cu, A thawng a saang in fano nei hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan caw rual tla karhzai ciamco hai sehla, Hloral le fahrulh ti um hlah seh. Kan lamzin ah riahsia ninghang ih, ṭahnak awn-au um hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cubangtuk a si mi ram cu ram thlawsuak a si; Bawipa kha an Pathian ah a neitu miphun cu, mi thlawsuak phun an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na maksak zia cu ka tlang aupi ding ka Pathian le siangpahrang; Kumkhua in kumkhua tiang na hnen ah lungawi thu ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nitinte ka lo lawm ding; Kumkhua cat loin ka lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu a tumlian ih, Nasa zetih thangṭhat ding a si. Maktara a si ih theih ban ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thil tuahmi pawl cu sankhat hnu sankhat ah, Thangṭhat ringring a si ding. Mangbangza na tuahmi pawl cu an thanter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minung in na sunlawinak le na huham an sim an rel ding ih, Mangbangza na tuahmi pawl cu Ka thinlung in ka ngaihtuah ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil maktara na tuahmi pawl cu mi in an sim ding ih, Kei in na tumlian zia ka phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ṭhat zia an rel ding ih, Zaangfahnak na neih zia hla in an sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu mi duhdawtu le mi zaangfahtu a si; A thinheng a har ih a hmunmi duhdawtnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah parah a ṭha; A tuahmi hmuahhmuah tlunah lainatnak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na seemsuahmi hmuahhmuah in, An lo thangṭhat ding ih, Na minung pawl in lungawi thu na hnenah an sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na uknak sunlawi zia le na cah zia cu annih in an sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuticun mi hmuahhmuah in mangbangza na tuahmi le, Na uknak huham sunglawi cu an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na uknak cu kumkhua in a hmun; Nang cu kumkhua in siangpahrang na si. Pathian cu a thutiammi hmuahhmuah ah rinsantlak a si; A thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah zaangfahnak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Harsatnak a tuartu hmuahhmuah a bawm ih, Mi lungnem hmuahhmuah a cawisaang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunnak neitu hmuahhmuah in, Beiseinak thawn nangmah an lo zoh. An ṭul tikah nang in rawl na pek hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khopkham in na pek hai ih A tum a seen ih ṭulmi hmuahhmuah na pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu a tuahmi kipah a ding; A tuahmi tin ah zaangfahnak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa cu amah a kotu ih kiangah a um ringring; Thinlung taktein a kotu ih kiang ah a um ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah a ṭihzahtu pawl ih poihai mi cu a pe, An aunak a thei ih a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah a duhtu hmuahhmuah a hum; Asinain mi ṭha lo hmuahhmuah cu a ti hloral ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat ringring ding; A seemsuahmi hmuahhmuah in a hmin thianghlim cu, Kumkhua in thangṭhat hai seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunsung hmuahhmuah amah ka thangṭhat ding; Ka nunsung cat loin ka Pathian hnenah hla ka sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Milai hotu pawl ih parah nan rinsannak ṭhum hlah uh; A lo run thei lotu ih parah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thi ih leivut ah an cang; Cuih ni ah an tumtahmi hmuahhmuah a cem ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah bawmtu dingah Jakob ih Pathian a neitu cu, Mi thlawsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei le van, tifinriat le a sung ummi hmuahhmuah tuahtu, Bawipa Pathian a rinsantu cu mi lungawi a si. Bawipa cun a thutiammi a kimter ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namthlakmi pawl ṭan in thu a rel ih, Rilrawngmi pawl hnenah rawl a pek. Bawipa in thawngtla mi pawl a luatter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mitcaw pawl khua a hmuhter. Tangdor pawl a khaisaang ih, Miding pawl a duhdaw hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram sungih ummi miphun dang pawl a hum hai ih, Nuhmei le ngakṭah fa pawl a bawm. Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl ih tumtahnak cu a siatsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in siangpahrang a si ding; Maw Zion, na Pathian cun kumkhua in a uk ding. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Kan Pathian hnenih, Thangṭhatnak hlasak cu a ṭha. Amah thangṭhat cu a nuammi le a dikmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in Jerusalem cu a din sal; Saltaang Israel mi pawl a kirpi sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thinlung kuaimi pawl a damter ih, An hma pawl a tuam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in arsi um ding zat a khiah; Pakhat hnu pakhat an hmin ciar in a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Bawipa cu a nasa mi le a maksak mi a si; A thil theih theizia cu tah theih ding rual a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tangdor pawl cu a cawisaang; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu, leilung ah a palcih hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thangṭhatnak hla sak uh! Ṭingṭang thawn kan Bawipa hnenah hla mawi sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van ah khin khawdur a pharh ih, Leilung hrangah ruah a surter. Cule tlangpar ah hrampi a khoter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah in ramsa pawl rawl a pe ih, Tlang-ak note pawl khal an ai tikah rawl in a cawm hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lungawinak cu rang cak zetzet parah a um lo; A thinnomnak khal ralkap ralṭha zetzet parah a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain amah a ṭihzahtu le, A hmunmi a duhdawtnak a rinsantu pawl parah a um sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, Bawipa cu thangṭhat aw! Maw Zion, na Pathian cu thangṭhat aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah in na kotka a hngetter ih, Na minung pawl thlawsuah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ramri pawl a himter ih, sangvut ṭha bik in a lo cawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah in leilung cu thu a pek ih, A thupekmi zamrang in tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Patpar bangin vur a tlakter; Vur tla cu leivut bangin a ṭhekdarh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rial cu lungte hluum bangin a tlakter; A thlenter mi khawsik cu, zohman in an tuar thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu a pek sal ih tikhal pawl an zup ṭheh; Thli a hranter ih tidai a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu cu Jakob hnenah a pek ih, A thu zirhmi le a daan pawl cu Israel a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi bangtuk cun miphun dang hnenah a tuah lo; A daan pawl an thei lo a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa cu vancung in thangṭhat uh! Tlun hmun saang ah thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vancungmi hmuahhmuah in amah thangṭhat uh; A van ralkap hmuahhmuah tla in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni le thlapi tla, amah thangṭhat uh! A tleumi arsi pawl tla, amah thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vancung saang bik pawl le, Van tlunih tidai pawl khal in amah thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An zate in Bawipa hmin thangṭhat hai seh; Amah in thu a pek ih seemsuah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thupeknak in an hmun ciar ah, Kumkhua in an hmun; A thu an el thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilung ihsin Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Tipi sungih ramsa tumpipi, tipi thuuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimthlakau, rial, vur, Khawdur le thlisia pawl, A thu a ngaitu hmuahhmuah in thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlangniam le tlangsaang in amah thangṭhat uh! Rah a rahmi thingkung le tupi thingkung pawl in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn zuat ṭilva, hramlak ramsa, Vate pawl le a bokvakmi ramsa pawl khal in, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl le miphun kip, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawi le uktu pawl hmuahhmuah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fala le tlangval pawl khal in, Nutar patar le nauhak pawl tla in, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An zate in Bawipa ih hmin cu thangṭhat hai seh. A hmin cu hmin dang hmuahhmuah hnakin a nasa sawn a si. A sunlawinak cu lei le van tlun ah a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A minung pawl ih ram cu a cakter, Cuticun a ngainatmi Israel miphun, Amah ih minung hmuahhmuah cun an thangṭhat ding. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa hnenah hla thar sa uh! Amah a rinsantu a minung pawl ih, tonkhawmnak ah thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Israel, a lo Siamtu ruangah na lungawi aw! Maw Zion mi pawl, nan siangpahrang ruangah nan aipuang uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laam phah in a hmin cu thangṭhat uh; Amah thang ṭhatnak ah khuang le, ṭingṭang pawl tum uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A minung parah Bawipa a lung a awi; Mi tangdor pawl cu ral nehnak thawn upatnak a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An nehnak ruangah Bawipa ih mi pawl cu lungawi in um hai seh; Aipuangzet in an puai caan ah zanvar hla sak hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian thangṭhat phah in, Ring zetin au ciamco hai seh; A hriammi ralnam an kutah kengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miphun dangdang neh dingah le, Mi hmuahhmuah hrem dingah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An siangpahrang pawl khit ding le An hotu pawl thir cikcin in ṭeem dingah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih thupeknak vekin, Miphun dang pawl hrem dingah a si. Himi cu Pathian mi pawl ih nehnak a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa thangṭhat uh! A Biakinn sungah Pathian cu thangṭhat uh! Vancung ah a cahnak cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil mak zetzet a tuah ruangah thangṭhat uh! Ziang hmuahhmuah ih hnakin a tum lian bik ruangah thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tawtawrawt thawn thangṭhat uh! Ṭingṭang le tingrisit thawn thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuang le dar thawn laam phah in thangṭhat uh! Ṭingṭang le phirivau thawn thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dar sumsel thawn thangṭhat uh! Darkhuang thawn thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah in, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
</usx>
